<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- ELOYI TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="h">Omatiyu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ɛza Iyeshi iyi i ngyi mu kwuwo ungwu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Omatiyu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Oma</para>
  <para style="mt1">OMATIYU</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ɛza Iyeshi i i ngyi mu kwuwo ungwu</para>
  <para style="mt1">OMATIYU</para>
  <para style="imt">Kambu Iyemo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwokpo ungwu Ɛza Iyeshi iyi i ngyi mu kwuwo ungwu Omatiyu kwɔlɛ kwu so ɛza iyeshi tee Ɔzhizɔsi gba akwu Usama uwu bɔkɔ o siso o shimɛzhi mawu le, uwu bɔkɔ mawu gba Ukpo a nyɔlɔ iyi bɔkɔ e so e shimɛzhi laa enzu wu mu Kenzu Igyirima Ungekyi le. Ɛza iyeshi ɛlɛ akwu kwuwongwu enzu umba Azhu umba bɔkɔ o mba Ɔzhizɔsi munyimbo akwɛyi e yi mbala mba kɛɛkyi mo, akwu kwuwongwu enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ lɛɛbi.Iso mu kwokpo ungwu Omatiyu kwɔlɛ ɔ nɔngɔ yi marimari. I ye mu kwɔmba ungwu Ɔzhzɔsi, obatisima mbala ipwama wu, akwɛyi i siso meka iyi ɛduma wu iyi anu itama, mbala ɛzu izɔma, enzu ɛfya ibɔmo mu Ogalili. Mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ, Ɛza Iyeshi ɛlɛ i siso meka iyi ifulama iyi Ɔzhizɔsi i ye mu Ogalili nzhii ba mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ, mbala apula iyi bɔkɔ i wo mu afyi imbwambwa iyi iŋɔma wu mu kwudu kwɔlɛ iyi imbwa mu lukwu wu mbala iyimo mu kwuvɔ wu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwokpo ungwu Ɛza Iyeshi ɛlɛ kwu zɔ Ɔzhizɔsi tee akwu Uzɔ kiya uwakwuu, uwu e yi idomo iyi iluma iyi Ɛrama iyi Ukpo, uwu a zɔ ɛzu meka iyi Ɛsu Iyoshi Irimo. Ɛzu izɔma iyi Ɔzhizɔsi o kayima ekpo ekpo ɛlɔ: (1) Ɛzu izɔma mu Lɔwa, iyi i siso meka iyi luzɛ, mbala ɛduma, mbala rigbɛ, mbala ewo iyi bɔkɔ enzu umba o ri Ɛsu Iyoshi o bo yi moshi (Ɛmɛ iyɛkwu 5-7); (2) okpa uwu o shi wavɔngɔ kiya wewo la wepo mbamba meka iyi ɛduma mba (Umɛ uwakwu 10); (3) aba meka iyi Ɛsu irimo moshi (Umɛ uwakwu 13); (4) ɛzu izɔma meka iyi iluma iyi Ɔzhizɔsi imbwaluma (Umɛ uwakwu 18); mbala (5) ɛzu izɔma meka iyi ibomo iyi kwuye kwɔlɛ mbala inyɔma iyi Ɛsu irimo iyi Ukpo (Ɛmɛ iyɛkwu 24-25).</para>
  <para style="iot">Iso Iyi I Yi Mɛmi</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɛdɔ iyi Ɔzhizɔsi mbala kwɔmba wu (1.1—2.23)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɛduma iyi Ɔzhɔnu u wo Obatisima (3.1-12)</para>
  <para style="io1">Obatisima mbala ipwama iyi Ɔzhizɔsi (3.13—4.11)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɛduma iyi Ɔzhizɔsi e wo gedegede mu Ogalili (4.12—18.35)</para>
  <para style="io1">I ye mu Ogalili nzhii ba mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">Afyi imbwambwa mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ mbala kɛlɛ mbala Ɔzhɛrusalɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">(28.1-20)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s">Ɛdɔ Iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Oluku 3.23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Ɛlɛ gba akwu Ɛdɔ iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi umɛ uwu Odevidi umɛ uwu Aburamu le.<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Aburamu akwu ete uwu Aziki, Ɔzhɛkɔbu akwu ete uwu Ozhuda Mbala ɛmanyi wu; <verse eid="MAT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Ozhuda akwu ete uwu Ɔpɛrɛzi mbala Ɔzɛra, umba bɔkɔ anyi mba akwu Otama awu. Ɔpɛrɛzi akwu ete uwu Ɛzirɔ, Ɛzirɔ akwu ete uwu Oramu, <verse eid="MAT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Oramu akwu ete uwu Aminadabu, Aminadabu akwu ete uwu Ɔnashɔ, Ɔnashɔ akwu ete uwu Ɔsalamɔ, <verse eid="MAT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Ɔsalamɔ akwu ete uwu Obowazi, uwu anyi wu akwu Ɔrawabu awu, Obowazi akwu ete uwu Ɔbɛdi, uwu anyi wu akwu Orutu, Ɔbɛdi akwu ete uwu Ozhese, <verse eid="MAT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Ozhese ba akwu ete uwu Odevidi, uwu bɔkɔ e ri ɛsu awu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 1:6">Odevidi akwu ete uwu Ɔsɔlɔmɔ, uwu bɔkɔ anyi wu akwu oko uwu Uriya dɛ-ɛ awu, <verse eid="MAT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Ɔsɔlɔmɔ akwu ete uwu Orehobowa, Orehobowa akwu ete uwu Abizha, Abizha akwu ete uwu Asa, <verse eid="MAT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asa akwu ete uwu Ozhehoshafa, Ozhewoshafa akwu ete uwu Ozhoramu, Ozhoramu akwu ete uwu Uzaya, <verse eid="MAT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Uzaya akwu ete uwu Ɔzhɔta, Ɔzhɔta akwu ete uwu Awazi, Awazi akwu ete uwu Ɛzɛkaya, <verse eid="MAT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Ɛzɛkaya akwu ete uwu Omanase, Omanase akwu ete uwu Amoni, Amoni akwu ete uwu Ozhosaya, <verse eid="MAT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Ozhosaya akwu ete uwu Ozhekoniya, mbala ɛmanyi wu kwuye ungwu rinye igbomo mu Ɔbabilɔ.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Mizhikembo iyi rinye mbo igbomo mu Ɔbabilɔ akwɛyi: Ozhekoniya a mba Ɔshiyɛtiyɛ, Ɔshiyɛtiyɛ a mba Ɔzɛrubabɛ, <verse eid="MAT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Ɔzɛrubabɛ a mba Abiwudu, Abiwudu a mba Eliyaki, Eliyaki a mba Azɔ, <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Azɔ a mba Ɔzadɔki, Ɔzadɔki a mba Akimu, Akimu a mba Ɛliwudu, <verse eid="MAT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Ɛliwudu a mba Ɛlɛyaza, Ɛlɛyaza a mba Omata, Omata a mba Ɔzhɛkɔbu, <verse eid="MAT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Ɔzhɛkɔbu a mba Ɔzhɔsɛfu, uwu akwu ɔnu uwu Omeri uwu a mba Ɔzhizɔsi, uwu o ya wu tee Okrasi awu.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />I na mu kwuyengwu Aburamu i ka mu kwuyengwu Odevidi, akwu ebegye iyi ɔyi uwo la endo. I na mu kwuyengwu Odevidi i ka mu kwuyengwu rinye igbomo mu Ɔbabilɔ, akwu ɔyi uwo la endo, i na mu kwuyengwu rinye igbomo mu Ɔbabilɔ i ka mu kwuyengwu Okrasi, akwu ɔyi uwo la endo tete.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwɔmba Ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi:</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Oluku 2.1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Eza iyi kwɔmba ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi gba i yi tee, anyi wu, Omeri, Ɔzhɔsɛfu e ye wu mu iluma bɛnɛ, akwɛyi o gele wu la rifo ingyi ri ngyi mbaa Kwundu uwu Ukpo. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Ɔzhɔsɛfu, ɔnu wu, akwu onzu ototo, uwu ba a gyi tee la ta wu undu kwudu, kaa le lo wu lovya mo. Akwɛyi a ka amasa tee, a lu wu afyima, kyokyokyo byi. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Kwuye ungwu e yi mu egbo ɛnyi ibyima akwɛyi e wolo ondo tee, ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ɔkwu, e bo a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔzhɔsɛfu, umɛ uwu Odevidi, ki wo iyi iyi Omeri itomo kaa lakwu oko ŋɔ mo, moo rifo nyɛ ngyi ri ngyi mbaa Kwundu uwu Ukpo. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Aa mba umɛ ɔzɔnu, akwɛyi ŋɔ kpowu ɛnyi tee Ɔzhizɔsi - moo a sa enzu wu ma mu ingbomo mbo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Iwomo ɛlɛ lɛɛbi i wo tee kaa Ii nyɔlɔ iyi Ɔkwu e so mu kenzu unga anukenzu wu tee, <verse eid="MAT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />&lt;&lt;Oko uwu o do lu wu eza mo, e shi rifo a mba umɛ ɔnzɔnu, akwɛyi oo kpowu ɛnyi tee Imanuwɛ&gt;&gt; (iyi bɔkɔ iluma yi akwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ukpo e yi mbala nzu&gt;&gt;) awu.<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhɔsɛfu a nyeyimo mondo, e wo iyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ɔkwu e so wu awu. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Uwu ba a nɔ mbala wu mo nzhii ba a mba umɛ ɔnzɔnu wu ma. Akwɛyi Ɔzhɔsɛfu e kpowu ɛnyi tee Ɔzhizɔsi.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s">Agboga Ɔ Wɔ Mu Ɔnu Uwu Kwoto O Bo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Mizhikembo iyi kwɔmba ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi, mu Ɔbɛtilɛhɛ uwu Ozhudiya, mu ɔyi uwu ɔsu Ɛrɔdu, wayitu ɔ wɔ mu ɔnu uwu kwoto o bo mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />akwɛyi o yo tee &lt;&lt;Umɛ uwelu uwu o mba wu kaa la kwu Ɔsu uwu Azhu le, e yi mu na? Moo ki ma kwulovyo wu mu ɔnu uwu kwoto gba ki bo tee la ki gbo wu ɔya le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Kwuye ungwu ɔsu Ɛrɔdu a pwa iso ɛlɛ, uwu mbala enzu umba Ɔzhɛrusalɛ lɛɛbi, ubwu mbo e fomo gyɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Akwɛyi Ɔsu a ya eboshi umbakɔ ma, mbala wa zɔ Ɛrama. Akwɛyi e yo mbo tee, &lt;&lt;Muna ba o zɔ tee o mba Okrasi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />O gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Mu Ɔbɛtilɛhɛ mu ɛzhi iyi Ozhudiya. Tegba gba anukenzu a ka yi le tee,<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />&lt;Ɔbɛtilɛhɛ ɔshɛshɛkɛ ele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">akwu uŋɔ gba ŋɔ kwu umbwambwa le mo mu ɛzhi iyi Ozhudiya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">moo mbaa ŋa gba u to keyi a ŋaa wɔ le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">u zɔ enzu mi umba Izirɛ, ɔgwuzɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Ɛrɔdu a ya wayitu mbamba ma mɛmba kaa lo so wu kwuyengwu bɔkɔ umba o gwo la kwulovyo kwɔngu imama shɛ. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Akwɛyi a ta mba okpa tee: &lt;&lt;La lu so mu Ɔbɛtilɛhɛ kaa la lu gagyi mbaa bɔkɔ umɛ awu e yi; akwiyi gba lu ma wu, la lu gba yi lu ka mi, kaa mi tete la mi so la mi gbo wu oya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛnyi, akwɛyi o kwu luzɛ mba. Tabɔkɔ o yi mu luze akwɛyi o gba o ma kwulovyo ungwu bɔkɔ o gwo ngwu laa imama mu ɔnu uwu kwoto awu kpɔ. Akwɛyi kwu to mbo keyi nzhii ba mbaa umɛ awu e yi. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Tabɔkɔ o ma kwulovyo kwɔngu, akwɛyi ɔnyɛ a ga mba ma. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />O fyemo mogba, akwɛyi o du umɛ awu mbala anyi wu Omeri, akwɛyi o kwu mo o gbo wu ɔya. Akwɛyi o vuvu ewulo mbo mo akwɛyi o wa la rɛshi mba ingyi egolu, mbala ɛfurakisɛ mbala ɛmira akwɛyi o shi wu.<verse eid="MAT 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Ukpo a ta mba ɔkpa mu ondo kpeke-e te lo zɛ mbaa Ɛrɔdu fo. Kwuwo kwɔngwu o zɛ mu ɔgwuzɛ owa o ka mu ɛzhi mba.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">O Wirima O Ka Mu Izhipiti.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Mizhikembo iyi wa yitu mbamba o gba o kama, ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ɔkwu e bo mbaa Ɔzhɔsɛfu mu ondo akwɛyi a za wu te, &lt;&lt;Yi mo kaa to umɛ awu ma mbala anyi wu kaa la lu so mu Izhipiti, la lu ŋɔ mɔmɔ la lu gbo kwuyengwu mi bi za yi tee la lu yi mo mɔmɔ; moo Ɛrɔdu e yi mu ɔgwuzɛ igagyima kaa la ngbɛ umɛ awu ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhɔsɛfu e yimo e to umɛ awu ma mbala anyi wu mu utuweka akwu luzɛ mba undu Izhipiti. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />Ɔ ŋɔ mɔmɔ nzhii ba Ɛrɔdu e kpo mo dɛ. Ɛlɛ i wo tee kaa li nyɔlɔ iyi bɔkɔ Ɔkwu a zɔ mu kenzu unga anukenzu tee, &lt;&lt;Mi ya Umɛ mi a wɔma mu Izhipiti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛmɛshɛri Ingbɛma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Kwuye ungwu Ɛrɔdu a zɔngɔma te wayitu mbamba o kyoro wu mo, amba o wo wu mo gyɔɔ. A ta ɔkpa te ɛmɛ anzɔnu umba bɔkɔ o yi lɔri lopo i gba mɛzhi, mu Ɔbɛtilɛhɛ mbala wanɔkpa ngwu lo ngbɛ mba ma. E so tayi kwuwo ungwu lɔri ndɔndu lu zɛ kya mbala kwuyengwu bɔkɔ kwulovyo ungwu bɔkɔ wayitu mbamba o ma, kwu gwo laa iwɔma.<verse eid="MAT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Mu ɔgwuze ɔlɛ gba iso iyi anukenzu Ozheremaya e so i nyɔlɔma le tee:<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />&lt;&lt;O pwa opwu mu Ɔrama.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">opwu uwu ɔga mbala inyima iyɛkuu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Ɔrɛshɛ e yi mu ɔga ilomo uwu ɛmɛ wu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">o byi wu ɛyi ba e tomo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">moo ɛmɛ wu o kpomo-o.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Igbama Mu Izhipiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Mizhikembo iyi lukwu undu Ɛrɔdu, Ɔzhɔsɛfu a gba e wolo ondo umbu ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ɔkwu e du wu mu Izhipiti <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />akwɛyi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Yimo, to umɛ awu ma mbala anyi wu, kaa gbama so mu ɛzhi iyi Izirɛ, moo enzu umba o gyi tee lo ngbɛ umɛ awu ma o kpomo-o.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhɔsɛfu e yimo e to umɛ awu ma mbala anyi wu, akwɛyi o ka mu ɛzhi iyi Izirɛ.<verse eid="MAT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhɔsɛfu a pwa te Akɛlayusu, umɛ uwu Ɛrɔdu, gba akwu ɔsu mu Ozhudiya le ŋa, a wiyi iyi isomo mɔmɔ. O gba o kyo o ta wu ɔkpa kpɔ mu ondo, akwɛyi a ka mu ɛzhi iyi Ogalili ŋa, <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />a ka ŋɔ mu kwuse ungwu ɔ ya ngwu te Ɔnazarɛti awu. Ɛlɛ i nyɔlɔ iyi bɔkɔ anukenzu o so awu tee, &lt;&lt;Oo kpo wu ɛnyi tee, Onazari.&gt;&gt; .<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s">Anu Itama Iyi Ɔzhɔnu U Wo Obatisima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Omaki 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Oluku 3.1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Ɔzhɔnu 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Mu kwuye kwɔngu Ɔzhɔnu u wo Obatisima e bo mu ɛzhi ɛngbarara ungwu Ozhudiya, laa anu itama iyi iso iyi Ukpo. <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />A zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;La lu kwu ira yi ɔsu,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;moo ɛsu irimo iyi oshi, inda fo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Ɔzhɔnu gba akwu uwu bɔkɔ anukenzu Azaya e siso wu le tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">&lt;&lt;Onzu uwufo e yi mu iyama mu opwu uwɔkwu mu ɛzhi ɛngbarara tee.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">&lt;Nɔngɔ ɔgwuzɛ ma laa Ɔkwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">bɔ ɔgwuzɛ shɛ kaa laa zɛ mawu.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Ɛkpayi iyi Ɔzhɔnu o fu mu inyi iyi onyakurumi; a ma kwɔbɛti ungwu kwokpo mu uzhi. Kiya ingyirimo wu ba akwu eko mbala lotu undu ɔsɛ. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Enzu o wɔ mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ, mbala ɛzhi iyi Ozhudiya lɛɛbi, mbala kamba unga ɔkwu uwu Ɔzhɔda lɛɛbi o ka mbaa wu. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />O zɔ ingbomo mbo akwɛyi Ɔzhɔnu e wo mbo obatisima mu ɔkwu uwu Ɔzhɔda.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhɔnu a ma Afarisi mbala Asadusi te o yi mu inyɔma mbaa wu kaa lo wo mbo obatisima, akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Lunyi agbazhi mbɔlɛ - uwe e lo yi ilutu mu alu te, la lu rɛnya la lu shi wɔnu umbu u yi mu inyɔma awu? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />La lu wo ɛduma iyi bi zɔ tee lu ku ira yi ɔsu-o. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />La lu kwɛnwu te lu kwu ɛmɛ umba Aburamu mo mɛɛ, moo Ukpo e do te ee shi ekyi ɛlɛ i wala ɛmɛ laa Aburamu! <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Keko ke yi mɛzhi-e unga ke kpolo ɛwɛyi ma laa akpa lɛɛbi; uwɛyi uwu bɔkɔ u wala imwuma iyeshi mo o kpolo wu o ta mu ɔyi. <verse eid="MAT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Imi mi wo yi obatisima uwu embyi uwu a zɔ te lunyi lu ku ira yi ɔsu-o, onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ka mi ma uwu bɔkɔ ekpoyata wu lala mi do yi ishimo mo ba e yi mu inyɔma. Ee wo yi obatisima mu Kwundu uwu Ukpo, mbala ɔyi. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Kwɔta wu kwu yi mu ɔwu wu ungwu a fya ɔngbɔ ma kaa li shi eyi. Akwɛyi akwu eyi ee fu mu kɛnɛ, ɔngbɔ ba ee fu wu mɔyi uwu bɔkɔ u pwu u nyima mo awu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">O Wo Ɔzhizɔsi Obatisima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Omaki 1.9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21">Oluku 3.21</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:22">22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a wɔ mu Ogalili e bo mu Ɔzhɔda kaa, Ɔzhɔnu le wo wu obatisima. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Ɔzhɔnu ba a gyi tee le wo wu mo. Akwɛyi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ gba ifate wo mi obatisima le, ɔbulɛ Ŋɔ bo mbaa mi tee la mi wo obatisima?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a za wu tee, Nyama kaa wo yi tayi kwuye ngwɔlɛ, moo mu ɔgwuzɛ ɔlɛ gba kii wo lɛɛbi iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a gyi le. Akwɛyi Ɔzhɔnu a nyama e wo wu obatisima.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Tabɔkɔ o mbwa Ɔzhizɔsi obatisima iwomo, akwɛyi a wɔma mu embyi. Akwɛyi oshi u wuma gboo, akwɛyi a ma Kwundu uwu Ukpo a wɔ moshi mate ogarikwokwo tayi akwɛyi e kwu mawu. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Akwɛyi opwu u wɔ moshi u zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ele akwu umɛ mi uwu idɛnyi mi, mi mwɔnyɛ mbala wu gyɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s">Ɔshɛta A Pwa Ɔzhizɔsi Ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12">Omaki 1.12</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Oluku 4.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Akwɛyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo e to Ɔzhizɔsi a kawa mu ɛzhi ɛngbarara kaa Osheta laa pwa wu ma. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Mizhikembo iyi Ɔzhizɔsi e wo kenyo afyi uwekpendo, lutu lɔnu, akwɛyi lonzu lu wo wu mo. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Akwɛyi Osheta e bo mbaa wu akwɛyi a za wu tee &lt;&lt;Gba ŋɔ kwu Umɛ uwu Ukpo ngboro de, ba za laa ekyi ɛlɛ tee li vindɔ kiya ingyirimo nɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;O ka yi ma mu kwokpo ungwu iso iyi Ukpo tee, Akwu mu kiya ingyirimo kɛɛkyi gba onzu ee yi kwunyɔ le mo, i kyo mbala iso iyinayina iyi i wɔ mu kenzu unga Ukpo tete.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Akwɛyi Osheta a gba e to Ɔzhizɔsi a kawa mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ kwuse kwɔ kɛrikɛri kwɔngu, a ka e shi wu a rima mu ikperembe iyi Ɔtɛpu, <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />akwɛyi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Gba ŋɔ kwu Umɛ uwu Ukpo ngboro de ba, &lt;&lt; yimo piriri kaa la mɛzhi nɛ, moo o ka yi ma lo mu kwokpo ungwu iso iyi Ukpo tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">&lt;&lt; &lt;Ukpo aa ta alɔgbulɔ wu ɔkpa tee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">lo shi ewo mbo kaa lo na ŋa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">kaa ki la ɛfyi mu kwoki mo.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;O ka yi ma mu kwokpo ungwu iso iyi Ukpo tete lo tee, &lt;Ki pwa Ɔkwu Ukpo ŋɔ ma mo.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Akwɛyi Osheta a gba e to Ɔzhizɔsi a kawa mu ikperembe iyi lɔwa akwɛyi a zɔ wu ɛzhi iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ lɛɛbi mbala woshi yi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />Akwɛyi Osheta a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Gba ŋɔ kwumo, ŋɔ gbo mi ɔya, iyi mi zɔ ŋɔ yi ele lɛɛbi, mi ra yi mi shi ŋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔshɛta yimo munɛ! O ka yi ma mu kwokpo ungwu iso iyi Ukpo tee, Ɔkwu Ukpo ŋɔ kɛɛkyi gba ŋɔɔ gbo wu ɔya, ŋɔ gbo wu rinye le!&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Akwɛyi Ɔshɛta a lu Ɔzhizɔsi afyima, akwɛyi alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo o bo o mbwa wu ma.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi E Gwo Laa Ɛduma Wu Mu Ogalili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14">Omaki 1.14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14">Oluku 4.14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 4:15">15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Kwuye ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi a pwa tee Ɔzhɔnu o ta wu mu ugu ugyi, a gba a ka mu Ogalili. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />A ka ŋɔ mu Ɔnazarɛti dɛ, akwɛyi a lafya laa mɔmɔ akwɛyi a ka ŋɔ mu Ɔkapanawu, kwuse ungwu kwu yi kɛlɛ mbala risu ingyi Ogalili mu ɛzhi iyi Ɔzɛbulu mbala Onafitali awu. <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />Ɛlɛ i wo tee kaa li nyɔlɔma iyi anukenzu Azaya e so tee:<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />&lt;&lt;Ɛzhi iyi Ɔzɛbulu mbala ɛzhi iyi Onafitali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">mu ɔgwuzɛ u sheye mu risu, mu ɔsɔwu uwu Ɔzhɔda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">Ogalili, ɛzhi iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo!<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Enzu umba o yi mu ipwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">O ma ɛbɛ iyɛku.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">Umba o ŋɔ mu ɛzhi iyi ipwu iyi lukwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">ɛbɛ i lemo mɔmɔ memowu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />I na mu kwuye kwɔngwu, Ɔzhizɔsi e gwo laa anu itama, tee: &lt;&lt;La lu kwu ira yi ɔsu, moo Irɛsu iyi Oshi i bo kɛlɛ-ɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi A Ya Wayi Emu Wendo Ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Omaki 1.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Oluku 5.1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Ɔnu uwufo Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu luzɛ mɛmba iyi Risu ingyi Ogalili te akwɛyi e gele ɛmɛnɛ wepo wa yi emu Ɔsayimɔ(uwu o ya wu tee Opita) mbala umanyi wu, Anduru, o yi mu eya ifumo mu embyi moo umba akwu wa yi emu. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La lu mbwalu mi, akwɛyi mi zɔ yi enzu iyimo ŋa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Kɛlɛlɛ o la afyi laa iya mba akwɛyi o mbwalu wu.<verse eid="MAT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e turu a gba keyi bwɛɛ te, akwɛyi a gba e du ɛmɛnɛ wepo kpɔ, Ozhemisi, umɛ uwu Ɔzɛbɛdi, mbala Ɔzhɔnu umanyiwu. O yi mu kwoda mbala ete mbo, Ɔzɛbɛdi, mu iya mba inɔngɔma. Ɔzhizɔsi a ya mba ma tee lo bo, <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />Akwɛyi o yimo kpara, o lafya laa kwoda mbala ete mbo, akwɛyi o mbwalu wu.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi E Bo Enzu Efya Ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Oluku 6.17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Ɔzhizɔsi e le mu igɔma mu ɛzhi iyi Ogalili lɛɛbi, laa ɛzu izɔma mu idaba iyi ɛlu ikpalama, mu anu itama iyi Iso Iyeshi iyi irɛsu iyi Ukpo, mbala enzu umba efya ikikɔ – ikikɔ ibomo. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Ɛza wu i fulama munamuna mu ɛzhi iyi Osiriya, akwɛyi enzu o ka wu laa enzu umba efya ikikɔ – ikikɔ: umba bɔkɔ o yi ɛndu iyira, mbala umba o yi ofya umbu ookpo, mbala umba o kpokapiya - akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e bo mbo efya ma lɛɛbi. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Enzu riba umba o wɔ mu Ogalili, Ɔdikapɔli, Ɔzhɛrusalɛ, Ozhudiya mbala Onya uwu ɔsɔwu uwu ɔkwu uwu Ɔzhɔda, o mbwalu wu.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s">Ɛzɔ Iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Mu Lɔwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a ma riba ingyi enzu, akwɛyi a yama mu odudu a ŋɔma. Wa vɔngɔ kiya wu o ya ma o du wu o fula wu ma <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />akwɛyi e le mbo mu ɛzɔ izɔma tee:<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔnyɛ Ureyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Oluku 6.20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />Ɔnyɛ akwu uwu umba bɔkɔ o yitu tee umba ɔ kwu ayirɛwa mu kwundu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:3">kwuwongu irɛsu iyoshi akwu iyamba!<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Ɔnyɛ akwu uwu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu ubwu ugyi iwomo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:4">moo Ukpo e gbo mbo idu mo!<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Ɔnyɛ akwu uwu umba bɔkɔ o to ɛmba o fulo kadu mo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:5">moo oo fya kiya ingyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a zɔ tee ee shi mbo awu!<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Ɔnyɛ akwu uwu umba bɔkɔ egbo mbo akwiyi lo wo iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a gyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:6">moo Ukpo a sa mba igɔ mba ma ndii!<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Ɔnyɛ akwu uwu umba bɔkɔ o ma eyembembyi iyi enzu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:7">moo Ukpo a ma eyembembyi mbo tete!<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Ɔnyɛ akwu uwu umba bɔkɔ akɔ mba i yi sɛsɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:8">moo o ma Ukpo!<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Ɔnyɛ akwu uwu umba bɔkɔ o gyi iŋɔma iyi oloto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:9">moo Ukpo a ya mba tee ɛmɛ wu!<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Ɔnyɛ akwu uwu umba bɔkɔ o lo mbo inyashi kwuwongu o wo iyi Ukpo a gyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">moo irɛsu iyoshi akwu iyamba!<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />Ɔnyɛ akwu uwayi lunyi, kwuyengwu enzu o kpa yi ari, o lo yi inyashi, o mulo yi iyira kwuwongu lu kwu wa mbwalu mi. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />La lu mwɔnyɛ gyɔ, moo rigbɛ ingyɛku ri rigbo yi moshi. Te gba o lo anukenzu umba o to keyi la yi inyashi le tete.<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔtɔpwa Mbala Ɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Omaki 9.50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34">Oluku 14.34</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 14:35">35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />Lunyi lu yi kyamate otopwa tayi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ. Gba otopwa e yi rɛnu fo, ɔgwuzɛ uwu o wo kaa laa gba laa rɛnu u yi mo. Oo fuwumo akwɛyi enzu oo kpa wu ata bi ŋa moo e yi rimbu fo.<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />Lunyi lu yi kyamate ɛbɛ iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ tayi. Kwuse ungwu kwu yi mu kadu unga lɔwa kwu nvyemo mo. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Tatayi ɔ byi kambwu ɔyi o kpo ngo kiya mo. Oo shi ngo mu kana unga ɔyi kaa onzonzu la ma ɛbɛ mogba. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Tegba i fa te ɛbɛ yi li lemo mba enzu le, kaa lo ma ɛduma yi iyeshi akwɛyi ɔɔ du Ete yi uwoshi ma.<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛzɔ Iyi Ɛrɛma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La lu byi egbo tee, mi bo tee la mi ngbɛ Ɛrama iyi Omosisi naa ɛzɔ iyi umba anukenzu ma mo. Imi mi bo tee la mi ngbɛ yi ma mo, Imi mi bo tee la mi nyɔlɔ yi ma. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Ongbulolo gba mi so yi ele tee, nzhii ba kwudu kwɔlɛ mbala oshi ii bo mo, kwɔzu kwukpɛnyi naa kwulakyɛ ungwu Ɛrama iyi Ukpo ɛlɛ o ngbɛ yi ma mo, kpɛkpɛyi i nyɔlɔ ma. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, onzu uwunawuna uwu e towo imbwambwa iyi ɔkpa ɛlɛ imbwaluma, akwɛyi a gba a zɔ umbafo tete kaa lo mbwalu mo, onzu awu aakwu umbwambwa mu Irɛsu iyoshi. Tatayi, onzu uwunawuna uwu a mbwalu Ɛrama ɛlɛ akwɛyi a gba a zɔ umbafo tete tee lo mbwalu yi , onzu awu aakwu onzu uwakwu Irɛsu iyoshi. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, la mi so yi tee, gba ototo yi a pyika uwu Afarisi mbala uwu Wazɔ ɛrama ma mo, lu fye mu Irɛsu iyoshi gbee mo.<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛzɔ Mekeka Iyi Amba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />&lt;&lt;Lu pwa o za laa enzu mekyi tee, &lt;La lu ngbɛ onzu mo; onzu uwu a ngbɛ onzu o zɔ wu ombu uwoyi.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Imi ba mi gyite la mi za yi tee: onzu uwunawuna uwu e wo amba mbala umanyi wu, o zɔ wu ombu uwoyi, onzu uwunawuna uwu a ya umanyiwu tee, &lt;Onzu uwumbwa ele!&gt; o ya wu ma mu udaba uwu ɔsu, onzu uwunawuna uwu a ya umanyi wu tee, orondo ele, e yi mu kwumbɛ ungwu kwoba ungwu ɔyi. <verse eid="MAT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, gba ŋɔ ka laa Ukpo rɛshi mu rɛbɛ ingyi Ukpo, ŋɔ yɔmɔ akwɛyi ŋɔ lolo tee umɛnɛ ŋɔ a ra laa amba ŋa mu akɔ, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />lafya laa rɛshi ŋɔ mu rɛbɛ mɔmɔ kaa so la lu lo mesu, la lu zɔ rɛnu yi ma dɛ akwɛyi gba bo mbaa rɛshi ŋɔ iwomo laa Ukpo.<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />Gba onzu uwufo lo ewa ŋa akwɛyi e to ŋɔ e sheye mu ɔkwɔtu, kpapyi kaa lo mesu mbala wu kwuyengwu lu du ba mu ɔkwɔtu mo. Moo akwu tayi mo e do te aa ra ŋa e lo u zɔ ombu mɔwu akwɛyi a ra ŋa e shi ɔlɔgbulɔ kaa la ta ŋa mu ugu ugyi. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Mi so ŋɔ, ŋɔɔ ŋɔ mɔmɔ nzhii ba eduwo iyi ŋɔ yi yi, ŋɔɔ mbwa yi iwama dɛ gba oo wa ŋa ma mu ugu ugyi awu le.<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛzɔ Mekeka Iyi Iyama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />&lt;&lt;Lu pwa ɔ zɔ tee, &lt;Lo yama mo&gt;. <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Imi ba mi za yi te, gba onzu e yese okokpayi la egbo iyi inɔma mbalawu, a mbwa wu iyama mu egbo wu oo. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, gba kwuyi ŋɔ ungwu ungyi kwunu shi ŋɔ ŋɔɔ ngbomo, wa la ngwu tama! I shoshi te kiya ngyi ɛnwu ŋɔ kikpɛnyi la ki to mo i shi ika iyi bɔkɔ o to ɛnwu ŋɔ ngyɔɔ oo ta mu kwogba ungwu ɔyi. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Gba kwuwo ungwu ungyi ŋɔ kwuu shi ŋɔ ŋɔɔ ngbomo, kpolo ngwu ta ngwu ma! I shoshi kaa kwɔlɛ ŋɔ kwukpɛnyi laa ku tomo kaa ɛnwu ŋɔ ngyɔɔ i bi fye mu kwogba ungwu ɔyi mo.<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛzɔ Mekeka Iyi Oko Irama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Omatiyu 19.9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11">Omaki 10.11</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Oluku 16.18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />Lu pwa &lt;&lt;ɔ zɔ tee, &lt;Onzu uwunawuna uwu a ra la oko wu ma, ba mɛga le shi wu kwupwu ungwu irama.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Imi ba mi za yi tee: gba onzu a ra la oko wu ma, ba akwu kwuwo ungwu kaya itomo mo, e yi kwungbɛ kwuwongu a ta wu kaya itomo gba oko awu a ya ɔnu ɔwa; onzu uwu e to oko uwu o ra wu ma, ba e yi mu kaya itomo tete.<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛzɔ Mekeka Iyi Ivungɔma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />Lu gba lu pwa kpɔ tee, mekyi o za la enzu tee, &lt;La lu fo ishi iyi bɔkɔ lu to mu idu iyi Ukpo ma mo, la lu nyɔlɔ ishi iyi lu to mu idu iyi Ɔkwu.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Imi ba mi so yi tee: la lu vungɔma mo ndii gba lu to ishi. La lu vungɔma laa oshi mo, moo oshi akwu ukpa uwu ɛsu iyi Ukpo; <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />naa laa ɛzhi ŋa, moo ɛzhi akwu kiya ingyi alɛ ifulomo wu; naa Ɔzhɛrusalɛ ŋa, moo akwu kwuse ungwu Ɔsu uwakwuu. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Uŋɔ lala ki to laa reshi ŋɔ mo, kwuwongu uŋɔ ŋɔ do tee ŋɔ wo kwunyi ŋɔ kwukpɛnyi te kwuruwu naa kwugyi mo. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Kaa &lt;Ee&gt; yi la kwu ee, &lt;Aayimo&gt; yi ba la kwu Aayimo - iyi ŋɔ so i pyika ɛlɛ ma i wɔ mba Onzu uwoyi.<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛzɔ Mekeka Iyi Kwusa Iwama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29">Oluku 6.29</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:30">30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />&lt;&lt;Lu pwa o zɔ tee, &lt;Gba onzu a ngbɛ kwuyi ungwu onzu uwufo mo, ungwa wu tete o ngbɛ ngwu ma, gba onzu a mu onzu uwufo kwunyi ma, o mu wu ungwa wu ma tete.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Imi ba mi za yi tee: la lu wakwusa laa onzu uwu e ngbo yi mo mo. Gba onzu a kpa ŋa afyi mu kwɔngba ungwungyi, shi wu kwɔngba ungwɔzu tete. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Gba onzu e lo ewa ŋa kaa la na ŋa ɔmu ma, lafya laa origa ŋa ka shi wu tete. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Gba osozha a kpa ŋa mɛga te to ewulo iyi ewa wu kaa mbwalu wu nzhii ba kwomelu kwunyi, so mbala wu emelu epo. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Onzu uwu a nda ŋa kiya, shi wu; ki kwu wu onzu uwu e bo tee aa na kwokpa munyi ŋɔ ɔsu mo.<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛzɔ Mekeka Iyi Idɛnyi Iyi Agewa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27">Oluku 6.27</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:28">28</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />&lt;&lt;Lu pwa mate bɔkɔ o so yi mekyi tee, &lt;Pwu idɛnyi iyi onzu uwu a nɔ a kpa ŋa, wo anya iyi ogewa ŋa.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Imi ba mi so yi tee: la lu pwu idɛnyi iyi agewa yi, la lu lɛ Ukpo kwuwongu enzu umba bɔkɔ o lo yi inyashi, <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />iwomo ɛlɛ i zɔ tee lunyi lu kwu ɛmɛ shɛ umba Ete yi uwu e yi moshi. Uwu ee shi kaa ɔnu wu lu lama lu shi enzu umba ira mbala umbeshi, a gba e shi embyi laa enzu umba o wo iyeshi mbala umba o wo iyira. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Gba lu pwu idɛnyi iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o pwu idɛnyi yi kɛɛkyi, kwuwongu kwuwongumbe bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi yi rigbɛ? Wa na oba uwɛzhi lala o wo ɛlɛ tete! <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Gba lu gbɛlɛ ɛmanyi yi kɛɛkyi ɛnyi, kimbe ba lu yi mu iwomo iyi bɔkɔ i ka iyi enzu umbafo mo? Enzu umba o mbwalu Ukpo mo lala oo wo ɛlɛ tete! <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />La lu yi kwungbɛ mo - kyamate bɔkɔ Ete yi uwoshi e yi kwungbɛ mo awu!<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s">Ɛzɔ Mekeka Iyi Rɛshi Iwomo Laa Ayirewa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />&lt;&lt;La lu ngbɛndu kaa la lu wo ɛduma iyeshi gedegede kwuwongu enzu lo ma yi mo. Gba lu wo tayi, lu na rigbɛ mbaa Ete yi uwoshi mo.<verse eid="MAT 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />&lt;&lt;Kwuwo kwɔlɛ gba ŋɔɔ wo rɛshi laa ɔyirewa, ki kpa kwɔzɔ mo, moo te gba wamwangba o-oo wo le mu idaba iyi ɛlu ikpalama iyi Azhu mbala mu ɛgwuzɛ, kaa enzu lɔ pwɔ mba ma. Mi so yi ongbulolo tee o na rigbɛ mba ma ndii-e. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Gba ŋɔɔ wo rɛshi laa ɔyirewa ba, ki nyama tee umɛza ŋa uwu kasɛkɛ lala le yitu mo. <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />Akwɛyi rɛshi iwomo ŋɔ aakwu kyokyokyo. Akwɛyi Ete yi, uwu bɔkɔ a ma iyi ŋɔ wo kyokyokyo awu, e shi ŋɔ rigbɛ.<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛzɔ Mekeka Iyi Ukpo Ilɛma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Oluku 11.2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />&lt;&lt;Kwuye ungwu lu lɛ Ukpo, la lu yi ma te wamwangba mo! Umba ɔ gyi Ukpo ilɛma mu irima mu idaba iyi ɛlu ikpalama iyi Azhu mbala ɛgwuzɛ kaa onzu uwunawuna laa ma mba. Mi so yi ongbulolo tee, o na rigbɛ mba ma ndii-e. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Gba ba luu lɛ Ukpo, la lu fye mu ugu yi, la lu koko riku mo akwɛyi luu lɛ Ete yi, uwu bɔkɔ o ma wu mo awu. Akwɛyi Ete yi, uwu a ma iyi bɔkɔ o wo kyokyokyo awu, ee shi yi rigbɛ.<verse eid="MAT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />Kwuye ungwu lu lɛ Ukpo, la lu ri mu iso ikpɛnyi iyi umbwa mo, kyamate wa byi eshi oo wo tayi, imama mba eshi mbo i pwa kwɔya mba kwuwongu iso isomo mbo gbulɔlɔ. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />La lu yi mate umba mo. Ete yi e yitu iyi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ lu gyi-e dɛ ishi lu nda wu le. <verse eid="MAT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, gba luu lɛ Ukpo la lu zɔ tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">&lt;Ete nzu uwu e yi moshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:9">Ɛnyi ŋɔ ɛkɛrikɛri lo du yi ma;<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />Irɛsu ŋɔ li bo; iyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ gyi yi awu li wo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">mu kwudu kwɔlɛ kyamate ii wo moshi tayi.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Shi nzu kiya ingyirimo nzu ingyi ɔnɛ.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Gba laa ingbomo nzu kpa nzu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:12">kyamate bɔkɔ kinzu ki gba yi kpa umba bɔkɔ o ngbo nzu mo tayi.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Ki so nzu mbaa ipwama iyi ii ga nzu ma mo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">uŋɔ ba sa nzu ma mbaa Onzu uwoyi.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />&lt;&lt;Gba lu gbayi lu kpa enzu umba o ngbo yi mo, Ete yi uwoshi aa gba laa ingbomo yi aa kpa yi tete. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Gba lu gbayi lu kpa enzu umba o ngbo yi mo mo, Ete yi ba aa gba laa ingbomo yi aa kpa yi mo.<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛzɔ Mekeka Iyi Kenyo Irima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />&lt;&lt;Kwuye ungwu lu ra laa kenyo, la lu shishi eyi kyamate enzu wamwangba o wo mo. Umba o yese mbaa emba mo kaka kaa onzu uwunawuna laa ma tee o ra laa kenyo. Mi so yi ongbulolo tee, o na rigbɛ mba ma ndii-e. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Kwuye ungwu lu ra laa kenyo, la lu vye eyi yi mo, la lu fyii inyi yi mo, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />kaa enzu lo zɔngɔma tee lu ra laa kenyo mo - kaa Ete yi kɛɛkyi, uwu o ma wu mo awu e yitu. Ete yi uwu ba a ma iyi bɔkɔ oo wo kyokyokyo awu, ee shi yi rigbɛ.<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛzɔ Mekeka Iyi Kiya Ɛlukpalama Moshi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33">Oluku 12.33</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:34">34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />&lt;&lt;La lu kpala kiya ingyi kwuwo yi ɛlu mu kwudu kwɔlɛ mo, mbaa ela mbala akazhi i fye ma yi akwɛyi i tutu yi mo mo, mbaa awɛlɔ o fye akwɛyi o to ngyimo mo. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Lunyi ba la lu kpala kiya ingyi kwuwo yi ɛlu moshi, mbaa ela mbala akazhi i fye mo, mbaa awɛlɔ o do ifyemo kaa lo to kiya mo. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Mbaa bɔkɔ kiya ingyi kwuwo ŋɔ ki yi le, gba ba egbo ŋɔ i yi le tete.<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛbɛ Iyi Ɛnwu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Oluku 11.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />&lt;&lt;Eyi i yi mate kambwu ɔyi unga ke shi ɛbɛ laa ɛnwu tayi. Gba eyi ŋɔ ishoshi, ɛnwu ŋɔ kpɛkpɛyi akwu ɛbɛ; <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />gba eyi ŋɔ ba ishoshi mo, ɛnwu ŋɔ lɛɛbi akwu ipu kpakiri. Gba ɛbɛ iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu ɛnwu ŋɔ le akwu ipu, de ba ipu ɛnyi akwu iyɛku!<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukpo Mbala Kiya Ingyi Kwuwo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Oluku 16.13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">12.22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />&lt;&lt;Onzu ukpɛnyi akwu unye uwu ada umba kwogba wepo mo; moo e towo ukpɛnyi ma akwɛyi ba e pwu idɛnyi iyi ukpɛnyi; naa e lo ukpɛnyi mo akwɛyi aa zhi uwufo ma. Ŋɔ do te ŋɔ kwu umɛgba uwu Ukpo mbala uwu eduwo mo.<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />&lt;&lt;Kwuwo kwɔlɛ mi so yi tee la lu ta aka kwuwongu kiya ingyirimo ingyi bɔkɔ lu ri naa embyi umba lu wo naa ekpayi iyi lu kpo mɛnwu mo. Kwunyɔ ku sheshi ku ka kiya ingyirimo moo? Ɛnwu ba isheshi i ka ekpayi ma moo? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />La lu yese afyi umba oshi: o gbama mo, ba ɔ lɔ kaa lo fu mu lunɛ mo; tete Ete yi uwoshi gba ee fye mbo le! Lunyi lu koshi laa afyi moo? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Uwe meka yi, kwuwongu aka itama wu e do tee ee kyo kwunyɔ wu wɔzhi ma?<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />&lt;&lt;Kwuwongwu mbɛ ba lu ta aka iyi ekpayi iyi ilomo? La lu yɛsɛ ibulɔma iyi edodo mu akata: i wo ɛduma mo ba i fu ekpayi iyi ikpo mu ɛnwu mo. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Tetete mi so yi tee, Osolomonu laa kiya ingyi kwuwo wu lɛɛbi lala e kpo ekpayi iyesheshi mate edodo ɛlɛ mo. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Ukpo gba ee kpo ɔsɛ mu akata ekpayi le - ɔsɔ uwu bɔkɔ o ma wu ɔnɛ kwɔnyikwɔlɛ o ma yi fo, o pwuyimo mɔyi. Uwu ba e do tee e yese mba yi moo? Kimbe ki shi lu yi ikwidu fulo iyɛri te?<verse eid="MAT 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />&lt;&lt;Kwuwo kwɔlɛ la lu ta aka tee: &lt;Kimbe ba ki ri? Naa kimbe ba ki wo? Naa kimbe ba ki kpo mu ɛnwu?&gt; mo. <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />(Moo wa yi Ukpo mo tete o yi mu apula ɛlɛ igagyima.) Ete yi uwoshi e yitu tee lu yi ugɔ uwu apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Lunyi ba la lu gagyi ɛsu irimo iyi Ukpo mbala iyi bɔkɔ a gyi keyi dɛ, akwɛyi iyi lu gagyi yi awu lɛɛbi o shi yi yi. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ la lu ta aka iyi kwɔnyi mo, moo kwɔnyi ku yi aka ngwu. Kwɔfyi ngwunangwuna ku yi ira ngwu.<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s">Ombwu Izɔma Uwu Enzu Umbafo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37">Oluku 6.37</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:38">38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:41">41</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:42">42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />&lt;&lt;La lu zɔ enzu umbafo ombu mo, Ukpo laa zɔ yi ombu mo, <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />moo ombu uwu bɔkɔ lu zɔ uwu enzu umbafo, tatayi gba Ukpo a zɔ uwayi le. Omudu uwu lu mondo laa enzu, mawu gba o mondo yi le. <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />&lt;&lt;Kimbe ki shi ba ŋɔ yese kwɔsɛ ungwu ku ta umɛnɛ ŋɔ mu kwuyi, kutu ungwu kwuwɛyi ungwu bɔkɔ ku yi mu kwuyi ŋɔ ba ŋɔ mangwu mo? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Ŋɔ wo laa ba ŋɔ za la umɛnɛ ŋɔ tee,&lt;Bo kaa laa mi wala kwɔsɛ ungwu ku ta mu kwuyi ŋɔ le ma,&gt; munɛ ba kutu ungwu kwuwɛyi ku yi mu kwuyi ŋɔ? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Uŋɔ u mu angba ele! Wa la kutu ungwu kwuwɛyi ungwu bɔkɔ ku yi mu kwuyi ŋɔ ma dɛ, akwɛyi ŋɔ ma ɛbɛ gedegede, gba ba ŋɔɔ wa la kwɔsɛ mu kwuyi ungwu umɛnɛ ŋɔ ma le.<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />&lt;&lt;La lu shi izu kiya ingyi ki yi kɛrikɛri mo. La lu to lɔkyɛ undeshi la lu fo la erusu mo, moo gba lu wo tayi oo kpa ndu ata, o gba oo fulowa oo shi yi eyi mɛnwu akwɛyi o pe yi mo yɛyɛ.<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">La Lu Nda, La Lu Gagyi, La Lu La Kwuwo Mu Riku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Oluku 11.9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />La lu nda, oo shi yi; la lu gagyi, luu fya; la lu la kwuwo mu riku, akwɛyi oo wa yi riku mo. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Moo onzu uwunawuna uwu a nda oo shi wu, onzu uwunawuna uwu a gagyi aa fya, onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a la kwuwo mu riku ba oo wa wu ngyi ma. <verse eid="MAT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />&lt;&lt;Uwe mekeka yi bɔkɔ umɛ wu aa nda wu kwoburedi ba ee shi wu kwoki? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Naa umɛ wu ba aa nda wu umu ba ee shi wu ɔkwu? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Lunyi bɔkɔ lu yi ira te le lala, lu yitu iyi luu shi ɛmɛ yi kiya ingyeshi, ɔ bɔ zɔ tee Ete yi uwoshi ee shi yi apula iyi iyesheshi laa umba oo nda wu kwoya mo?<verse eid="MAT 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />&lt;&lt;Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, mu ingyinangyina la lu wo laa enzu ingyi bɔkɔ lu gyi tee lo wo yi awu: moo ɛlɛ gba akwu Ɛrama iyi Omosisi mbala izɔma iyi anukenzu le.<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kenzugwu Kashɛrɛrɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Oluku 13.24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />&lt;&lt; La lu fye mu kenzugwu kashɛrɛrɛ, moo ɔgwuzɛ uwu u sheye mbaa lukwu u yi kenzugu wowa ba u shi luzɛ kyoo te, enzu umba bɔkɔ o zɛma wu ba o yi riba. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Ɔgwuzɛ uwu kwunyɔ ba u yi kenzugwu sherere bi ba u kɔma mu luzɛ kyoo te, enzu umba o gagyi wu ba o yi bwɛ te.<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwɛyi Mbala Imuma Wu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43">Oluku 6.43</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:44">44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />&lt;&lt; La lu ngbɛndu mbala anukenzu wamulo; O bo munyi yi mu ɛnwu iyi ilɔ, munɛ ba mu egbo mbo akwu lugbonga undu ira <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Lu zɔngɔ mba ma mu ɛduma iwomo mbo. Enzu o do te oo bɛ eremi mu uwɛyi uwu owula-ɛgya, naa oboriyo mu ikpɛɛ? <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Tayi gba uwɛyi uweshi u wa la imuma iyeshi, uwɛyi uwu ra ba u wa la imuma iyira le. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Uwɛyi uweshi uu wa la imuma iyira mo, uwɛyi uwura ba uu wa la imuma iyeshi mo. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Uwɛyi uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ u muma iyeshi mo, o kpolo wu mo o ta mɔyi. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, mekeka iyi apula iyi oo wo gba lu zɔngɔ anukenzu wa mu i lo ma le.<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Midi Yi Ŋɔ Dɛ Mo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Oluku 13.25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />&lt;&lt;Akwu onzu uwunawuna uwu ya mi ma tee, &lt;Ɔkwu, Ɔkwu,&gt; gba o fyɛ mu irɛsu iyoshi le mo, akwu umba bɔkɔ o wo ingyi Ada mi uwoshi a gyi le gba o fye mu irɛsu iyoshi le. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Ɔnuwu kwɔfyi ungwu ombu izɔma enzu gyɔɔ o-oo za mi tee, &lt;Ɔkwu, Ɔkwu! Ki tanu iyi iso iyi Ukpo mu ɛnyi ŋɔ moo? Ki ra laa ɛndu iyira ma mu ɛnyi ŋɔ moo? Ki gba ki wo apula iyi kenzu iyama gyɔɔ mu ɛnyi ŋɔ moo?&gt; <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Akwɛyi mi so mba pepee tee, &lt;Imi mi yi yi mo ndii, la lu zɛ gboo mbaa mi, lunyi wa wo ɛduma iyira mbɔlɛ!&gt;<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wambo Igwu Wepo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Oluku 6.47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />&lt;&lt;Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a pwa iso iya mi ɛlɛ, akwɛyi e wo ɛduma ma yi, o masa wu mbala onzu uwu ilukwu uwu bɔkɔ e mbo kwogba wu mu ɔzɔ. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Ukpo e tumo, ɛkwu ilomo, kwokpo kwu tumo kwu kpo mu kwogba kwɔngwu, kwogba ba kwu shirimo mo, kuwongwu kwu ri mu ɔzɔ.<verse eid="MAT 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />&lt;&lt;Onzu uwunawuna uwu ba a pwa iso mi ɛlɛ ba e wo ɛduma ma yi mo, o masa wu mbala orondo uwu onzu, uwu bɔkɔ e mbo kwogba wu mu ɔgyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Ukpo e tumo, ɛkwu ilomo, kwokpo kwu tumo akwɛyi kwu kpo mu kwogba kwɔngwu, akwɛyi kwogba kwu shirimo giri laa ekpasu iyɛku!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Idomo Iyi Ɔzhizɔsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Kwuye ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi a mbwa iso ɛlɛ isomo, enzu umba o gyirima awu o ya kenzu kwuwongu ɛzɔ wu izɔma, <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />kwuwongu a zɔ mba ɛzɔ mu idomo; akwu kyamate wa zɔ ɛrama iyi Omosisi mo.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi E Bo Onzu Uwufo Ofya Ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Omaki 1.40-45</ref>; Oluku5.12-16)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Kwuye ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi a kalama mu lɔwa, enzu gyɔɔ o mbwalu wu. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Akwɛyi onzu uwufo uwu e yi ofya umbu embyi umba ɔyi e bo e kwumo mu idu wu akwɛyi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, gba ŋɔ nyama, ŋɔ do tee ŋɔɔ bo mi ofya ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a nda kwuwo a pwu wu afyi, a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Mi nyama,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ofya ŋa lu bomo!&gt;&gt; Mɔmɔɔmɔ akwɛyi ofya wu u bo mo. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ngbɛndu! Ki shi onzu onzu uwunawuna le yitu yi mo. So kaa zɔ ɛnwu ŋɔ ma mbaa obwoshi uwu Ukpo kaa le yese ŋɔ ma; akwɛyi wo isabo iyi bɔkɔ Omosisi a zɔ tee lo awu kaa onzu uwunawuna la nyama tee ofya ŋa u bo-o.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi E Bo Umɛgba Uwu U To Keyi Uwu Asozha Uwu Oroma Ofya Ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Oluku 7.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Kwuye ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi e fye mu Okapanawu, akwɛyi u to keyi uwu asozha uwu Oroma e bo mbaa wu akwɛyi a kpawu ɛshɛku tee la mbwa wu ma: <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />A za wu tee &lt;&lt;Adakwogba, umɛgba mi a nɔma mɛzhi iyi ofya mogba, ofya umbu ɛnwu kpokapiya, e yi mu inyashi imama gyɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Mi ri mi bi bo wu ofya ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />U to keyi uwu asozha uwu Oroma a gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Adakwogba, ayimo. Imi mi domo iyi ŋɔ nyɔ mogba mi mo. So iso bi akwɛyi ofya umbu umɛgba mi u bo mo. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Moo, Imi tete, mi yi wa to keyi, la asozha mu idu mi tete. Gba mi za la ele tee, &lt;Sheyimo!&gt; ee sheyimo; gba mi za la awu tee, &lt;Bo!&gt; a nyɔ. Gba mi za la unye mi tee, &lt;Wo te!&gt; ee wo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a pwa ɛlɛ, i shi wu kenzu iyama, akwɛyi a za la enzu umba o mbwalu wu awu tee, &lt;&lt;Mi so yi ongbulolo, mu ɛzhi iyi Izirɛ lɛɛbi lala mi fya onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi ikwu idu fulo kyamate ele mo. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Mi so yi te, enzu gyɔɔ oo wɔ mu ɔnu uwu kwoto mbala ɔnu uwu onoyo o nyɔ, oo ŋɔma o ri kiya kyaa mbala Aburamu mbala Aziki mbala Ɔzhɛkɔbu mu ɛsu iri mo iyoshi. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Akwɛyi ɛmɛ umba ɛsu oo wa mba ma oo fu mbo mu kizɛ ingyi ipwu, mɔmɔ gba o lo oga mbala ɛnyi ilamesu le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za la u to keyi uwu asozha awu tee, &lt;&lt; Sheyimo iya ŋa mogba! Iyi ŋɔ kwu idu lu fulo ma yi awu,o wo ŋɔ yi tayi.&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi ofya umbu umɛgba wu u bo mo mu kwotota kwɔngwu.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi E bo Enzu Gyɔɔ Efya Ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Omaki 1.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Oluku 4.38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Kwuye ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi e fye mu kwogba ungwu Opita, e du anyi wu oko wu tee a nɔma e yi okpaki. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Akwɛyi a pwa wu afyi mu kwuwo, akwɛyi okpaki wu e bomo, akwɛyi e yi mo e wo wu kiya ngyirimo.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Akwɛyi mu onoyo, o ka la Ɔzhizɔsi enzu gwurugwuru umba o yi ofya umbu ɛndu iyira. Iso iyi kenzu wu kɛɛkyi i ra la ɛndu iyira ma akwɛyi e bo enzu lɛɛbi efya ma. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Ɛlɛ i wo te kaa li nyɔlɔ iyi iso iyi bɔkɔ anukenzu Azaya e so tee: &lt;&lt; E to nzu inyashi ma, akwɛyi e bo nzu efya ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rigbɛ Ingyi Ɔzhizɔsi Imbwaluma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Oluku 9.57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a ma enzu gwurugwuru te o fula wu ma, akwɛyi a za la Wavɔngɔkiya wu te, lo sama lo so mu ɔsɔwu uwu risu. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Akwɛyi onzu ukpɛnyi u zɔ ɛrama iyi Omosisi e bo munyi wu akwɛyi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;U zɔ kiya, mi mbwalu ŋɔ munamuna bɔkɔ ŋɔ sheyi mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Lɔngbɔga lu yi ɛbu, afyi umba oshi o yi rigwu, ɔbulɛ Umɛ uwu Onzu ba e yi mbaa e lo reshi wu mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Ukpɛnyi mekeka iyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, shi laa mi so ka mi pwu ada mi ma dɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Mbwalu mi, lafya la ɛkpɛzhi kaa lo pwu ɛkpɛzhi mba ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi E Gbo Kwokpo Mo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Omaki 4.35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Oluku 8.22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e fye mu kwoda ungwu embyi akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu o mbwalu wu. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Kwokpo ungwɔkwu kwu yimo kporo mu risu, akwɛyi agba iyi embyi i muma i fu mu kwoda. Ɔzhizɔsi ba e yi mu ondo iyawu. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Wa vɔngɔ kiya wu o ka o nyi wu eyi mo akwɛyi o za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, sa nzu ma, moo embyi o ri nzu mo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Lunyi umba ikwu idu lu fulo kɛɛkyi mbɔlɛ, kimbe ki shi lu riyi te?&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi e yimo, a kpa kwokpo mbala agba iyi embyi ɛyi, akwɛyi kizɛ ki gbomo ndii.<verse eid="MAT 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Uwewe a ya kenzu, akwɛyi o yo kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu ele akwu uwe te bɔkɔ kwokpo mbala agba iyi embyi lala i lo wu mo te?&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi A Wa laa Ɛndu Iyira Ma Mu Ɛnwu Iyi Enzu Wepo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Omaki 5.1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Oluku 8.26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Kwuye ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi a sama a ka mu ɛsɛnyi iyi risu mu ɛzhi iyi Ogadara, enzu wepo o wɔ mu agariwu akwɛyi o kpolo wo kyaa. Enzu mbɔlɛ o yi eyo umbeyi mu ɛnwu mba, o lo enzu iyi gyɔɔ, onzu u zɛ mu ɔgwuzɛ ɔnwu e yi mo. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Akwɛyi o le mu oga itarama tee, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ gyi kwuwongumbe mbala nzu, uŋɔ, Umɛ uwu Ukpo? Kwuye kwu du bo mo ɔbulɛ, ŋɔ bo te ŋɔ lo nzu inyashi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Uzhi uwu erusu ba o yi mu irimo kɛlɛɛ mbala mba mɔmɔ. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Akwɛyi eyo umbeyi ɛlɛ i nda Ɔzhizɔsi kwoya tee, &lt;&lt;Gba ŋɔ ranzu ma, shi nzu la ki fye mu uzhi uwu erusu mbɔlɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee &lt;&lt;La lu so!&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi eyo umbeyi ɛlɛ i wɔma i fye mu erusu mbamba. Akwɛyi uzhi uwu erusu mbɔlɛ ndii o solomo o fu mu risu akwɛyi embyi o ri mbo mo.<verse eid="MAT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Enzu umba o yi mu erusu mbamba ipyama o rɛnya o fye mu kwuse akwɛyi o ba ɛza laa enzu, iyi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ki du enzu umba o yi eyo umbeyi ele. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Akwɛyi enzu umba kwuse lɛɛbi o wɔ kwudu o ko du Ɔzhizɔsi akwɛyi o kpa wu ɛshɛku tee la wɔma laa lafya laa ɛzhi mba.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi E Bo Ukpokapiya Ofya Ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Omaki 2.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Oluku 5.17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e fye mu kwoda ungwu embyi, a sama a ka mu kwuse wu. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Enzu umbafo o ka wu laa onzu ukpokapiya mu ɔkyɔ. Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a ma ikwu idu lu fulo mba, akwɛyi a za laa ukpokapiya awu tee, &lt;&lt; Umɛ mi, mwɔnyɛ; ingbomo ŋɔ o gba yi kpa ŋa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Akwɛyi wazɔ ɛrama iyi Ukpo o za laa esu tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu ele e wo oya!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba e yi iyi egbo mbo awu, akwɛyi e yo mbo tee, &lt;&lt;Kwuwongwu kwuwongumbe lu bi egbo iyira mu akɔ yi te? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Iyina i kɔma i ka: ka lo za ŋa tee, &lt;Ingbomo ŋɔ o gba yi kpa ŋa,&gt; naa, &lt;yimo ka zɛma ŋa.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Kaa la lu yitu tee Umɛ uwu Onzu e yi idomo iyi bɔkɔ a gba laa ingbomo iyi onzu a kpa wu mu kwudu kwɔlɛ,&gt;&gt; akwɛyi a za laa onzu ukpokapiya awu tee, &lt;&lt;Yimo, to ɔkyɔ ŋɔ ma kaa so mogba!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Akwɛyi onzu awu e yimo a ka mogba. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Kwuye ungwu enzu o ma ɛlɛ, iyi i wo mbo mo, akwɛyi o du Ukpo ma, uwu bɔkɔ e shi enzu idomo ɛlɛ.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi a ya Omatiyu Ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Omaki 2.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Oluku 5.27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e turu a gba keyi, akwɛyi a ma onzu uwufo uwu o ya wu tee Omatiyu a ŋɔma mu riyi ingyi oba uwɛzhi inama. Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Mbwalu mi.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:9">Omatiyu e yimo akwɛyi a mbwalu wu.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Ɔnu uwufo Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu kiya irimo mogba uwu Omatiyu, akwɛyi enzu wa na oba uwɛzhi mbala enzu umba &lt;&lt;Ingbomo&gt;&gt; gyɔɔ o bo o du wu mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu akwɛyi o ri kiya kyaa. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Tabɔkɔ Afarisi o ma ɛlɛ, akwɛyi o yo Wavɔngɔkiya wu tee, &lt;&lt;Kwuwongwu kwuwongu mbe u zɔ yi kiya e ri kiya mbala enzu umba ingbomo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a pwa iso ɛlɛ, akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi okpara uwɛmu o yi ugɔ uwu onzu u lo epu mo, umba bɔkɔ o yi okpara uwu ɛnwu mo gba o yi ugɔ uwu onzu u lo epu le. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />La lu so kaa la lu vɔngɔ iluma iyi iso iyi Ukpo i so tee: &lt;Eyembembyi gba mi gyi le, moo akwu isabɔ iwomo uwu izɔfyi mo.&gt; Mi bo kwuwongu enzu umba ingbomo lo fya isama, moo mi bo kwuwongu enzu umba ototo mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">O Yo Ɔzhizɔsi Kwuyo Iyi Kenyo Irima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Omaki 2.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Oluku 5.33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya umba Ɔzhɔnu u wo obatisima o bo mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi, akwɛyi o yo wu tee, &lt;&lt; kwuwongu mbe bɔkɔ kinzu mbala Afarisi ki koko ki ra la kenyo, Wavɔngɔkiya ŋa ba o ra la kenyo mo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɛmɛza umba ɔnu uwu okopo o wo ubugyi kwuyengwu ɔnu okopo e yi mbala mba? Kwuye kwu yi mu inyɔma ungwu o to ɔnu uwu okopo mbo mo; akwɛyi o wo kenyo.<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />&lt;&lt;Onzu e to okpayi uwu epo e se kwɔtu ungwu kushɔgiri ma mo, kwuwongu okpayi uwu epo a tara uwekyi ma akwɛyi e shi kwɔtu ungwɔkwu ungwu kwu ka ungwu kenze mo. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Tatayi enzu o fu embyi umba inyima umbepo mu ogya uwekyi mo. Gba o fu mbo, ogya awu e kpo kpaa, embyi umba inyima umbepo mbamba o fu mo, ogya awu ba e tutu mo. O fu owanyi umbepo mu ogya uwepo, gba epepo yi i ri ɛsɛ le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukpɛzhi Uwu Umoko Mbala Okokpayi Uwu A Pwafyi Mu Ɔriga Uwu Ɔzhizɔsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Omaki 5.21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Oluku 8.40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu iso ɛlɛ isomo bɛnɛ, akwɛyi utokeyi uwufo uwu Azhu e bo e kwumo mu idu wu akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Umɛ mi okokpayi a ta kwunyɔma kekelele; shɔɔkɔ bo kaa fulo wu kwuwo ŋɔ mawu, akwɛyi a gba laa iyimo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yimo mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu akwɛyi o mbwalu wu.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Akwɛyi okokpayi uwufo uwu e wo lɔri luwo laa lopo mu ɛnzhi ifumo, a mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi mizhikembo akwɛyi a pwu osaka uwu okpayi wu afyi. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />A byi egbo mu akɔ wu tee, &lt;&lt;Gba mi pwa o saka uwu okpayi wu afyi lala, ofya mi u bomo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Ɔzhizɔsi e geleyi a ma wu akwɛyi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Umɛ mi, shi egbo ŋɔ mɛzhi! Ikwidufulo ŋɔ i bo ŋɔ ofya ma-a. Mu kwuye kwɔngwɔngwu oko ele ofya wu u bo mo.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e fye mu kwogba ungwu utokeyi uwu Azhu awu, a ma enzu wa ta amu iyi odumudumu uwu lukwu mbala umba o yi mu uzhi iwomo le, <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Uwewe La wɔ kwudu! Umoko ele e kpomo mo - ondo gba e yi mu ikpolomo le byi!&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi enzu lɛɛbi o nyɔngɔ wu ma. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Tabɔkɔ o wa la enzu mo lɛɛbi mu kwudu, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e fyemo memi, e yi wu mu kwuwo, akwɛyi umoko le e yimo <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Ɛza ɛlɛ i fulama mu ɛzhi ɛnyi lɛɛbi.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi E Bo wapeyi Wepo Ofya Ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Mizhikembo iyi Ɔzhizɔsi a lafya la kizɛ ngyɛngyi , wa peyi wepo o mbwalu wu la iyama tee, &lt;&lt; Umɛ uwu Odevidi, ma eyembembyi nzu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Kwuye ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi e fye mu kwogba ungufo, akwɛyi epeyi wepo mbamba o bo mbaa wu, akwɛyi e yo mbo tee, &lt;&lt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:28">Lu yi ikwidufulo te mi do yi ofya ibomo?&gt;&gt; O gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ee, Ɔkwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Akwɛyi a pwu mba afyi mu eyi, a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Li wo yi tayi kwuwongu ikwu idu fulo yi&gt;&gt; - <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />akwɛyi eyi mbo i wuma. Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mbo mu alu tee, &lt;&lt;La lu so onzu uwunawuna iso ɛlɛ mo mɛɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Umba ba o wɔ kwudu o fu enzu oga uwu Ɔzhizɔsi mu ɛzhi mba lɛɛbi.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi E Bo Onzu U tukenzu Ofya Ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Tabɔkɔ o yi mu iwɔ kwudu, akwɛyi enzu umbafo o ka la Ɔzhizɔsi onzu uwu e yi kwundu ungwura ba e siso kego mo. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Mizhikembo iyi bɔkɔ o wala kwundu ungwura ma mɛnwu wu, akwɛyi onzu ele e le mu isisomo. Enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mɔmɔ lɛɛbi, Izirɛ i yi mbo mo akwɛyi o ya kenzu tee, &lt;&lt;Ki di ma ɛlɛ dɛ mo mu ɛzhi iyi Isirɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Afarisi ba o zɔ tee, akwu mu ekpasu iyi utokeyi uwu ɛndu iyira gba Ɔzhizɔsi a wa la kwundu ungwura ma le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi A Ma Eyembembyi Iyi Enzu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Ɔzhizɔsi a kpa ɛvyɛ mu ese iyɛri mbala iyɛku lɛɛbi, laa ɛzu izɔma mu idaba iyi ɛlu ikpalama iyi Azhu, a ta mba anu iyi iso iyesheshi iyi irɛsu iyi Oshi mbala ofya umbunambuna ibomo. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a ma riba ngyi enzu, akwɛyi eyembembyi mbo i wo wu mo, kwuwongu o kpo igbashi ba o yi onzu uwu imbwama mo, mate ilɔ umba o yi onzu uwu ipyama mo tayi. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Akwɛyi a za la Wavɔngɔkiya wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ewiri iyi ilɔma i yi gyɔɔ, enzu umba ilɔma ba o yi bwɛ. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ, la lu kpa ɛshɛku la Ɔkwu uwu utu, kaa la lɔ la enzu umba ɛduma mu utu wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi A Lɔ Wa zɛ ilɔ Wewo La Wepo Ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Omaki 3.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Oluku 6.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Ɔzhizɔsi a ya Wavɔngɔkiya wu wewo la wepo ma akwɛyi e shi mbo ekpasu kaa lo wa la ɛndu iyira ma mbala ofya umbunambuna ibomo. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Ɛnyi iyi wa zɛ ilɔ wewo la wepo mbɔlɛ o ya yi tee: Uwu kwonze akwu, Ɔsayimɔ (uwu o ya wu tee Opita awu) mbala umanyiwu Anduru; Ozhemisi umɛ uwu Ɔzɛbɛdi, mbala umanyiwu Ɔzhɔnu; <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Ofilipu mbala Obatolomi; Otoma mbala Omatiyu u na Oba uwɛzhi; Ozhemisi umɛ uwu Alufiyɔ, mbala Ɔtadiyɔ; <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Ɔsayimɔ Ɔzilɔti mbala Ozhudasi Isikariyɔ, uwu bɔkɔ e to Ɔzhizɔsi a yama awu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛlɔgbulɔ Iyi Wa Zɛ Ilɔ Wewo La Wepo Mbamba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Omaki 6.7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Oluku 9.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Enzu wewo la wepo mbɔlɛ gba Ɔzhizɔsi a lɔ mba ma la kaza kɛlɛ le tee: &lt;&lt; La lu fye mɛzhi iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o kwu Azhu mo naa kwuse ungwu Osamariya ungwunanguna mo. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />La lu so mbaa enzu umba Izirɛ umba bɔkɔ o yi kyamate ilɔ umba bɔkɔ o tomo awu. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Gba lu kama, la lu za mba tee, &lt;Irɛsu iyi Oshi i ndafo!&gt; <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Enzu umba o mwɔnyɛ mo, la lu bo mbo ofya ma, umba o kpo mo, la lu yi mbo mo, la lu bo enzu umba o pwu ofya umbu embyi umbɔyi ma, la lu ra la ɛndu iyira ma. Rɛshi gba lu na le, rɛshi gba ba la lu shi le tete. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />La lu za la egolu mbala esiliva mbala eduwo mu angara yi mo; <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />la lu za la kwongara mu luzɛ yi ndɔlɛ mo, la ɛriga epo mo, la ekpoyata, la upi uwu luzɛ mo, kwuwongu u wo ɛduma e do rigbɛ wu ma.<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />&lt;&lt;Kwuse ungwunanguna ungwu bɔkɔ lu fye mangwu, la ungwɔkwu la ungwɛri, la lu gagyi onzu uwu kwuyi mɔmɔ kaa la lu ŋɔ mbala wu nzhii ba kwuyengwu lu lafya laa kizɛ ngyɛngyi. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Kwuye ungwu lu fye mu kwogba kwɔngu, la lu ta mba ɔlɛ <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Gba enzu umba kwogba kwɔngu o na yi, esheshi iyi Ukpo ii ŋɔ mu kwogba kwɔngu, gba enzu umba kwogba kwɔngu ba o na yi mo, esheshi iyi Ukpo i ŋɔ mu kwogba kwɔngu mo. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Kwogba naa kwuse ungwunanguna ungwu bɔkɔ kwu na yi mo, ba kwu pwa iso yi mo, gba lu wɔma mu kwogba naa kwuse kwɔngu, la lu bulɔ kwumburu ungwu alɛ yi ma kaa la lu lafya la kizɛ ngyɛngyi. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Mi so yi ongbulolo, Ɔnuwu Ombwu Izɔma, Ukpo a ma eyembembyi iyi Ɔsɔdɔmu mbala Ogomora a ka iyi enzu umba kwuse kwɔngwu ma!<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inyashi Iyi I Yi Mu Inyɔma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Omaki 13.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Oluku 21.12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />&lt;&lt;La lu pwa! Mi lɔ yi ma mate ilɔ mekeka iyi lɔngbɔga tayi. Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ la lu kwu enzu umba ilikwu mate akwu, la lu kwu enzu umba egbo mɛzhi mate atatabiri tayi. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />La lu ngbɛndu, moo o yi yi mo akwɛyi o reye mu idaba iyi ombu ifumo, akwɛyi o kpa yi ikpa mu idaba iyi ɛlu ikpalama iyi Azhu. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Kwuwo mi o pyipyi yi o reye mbaa agomina mbala asu umba ɛzhi kaa lɔ zɔ yi ombu, akwɛyi lu so mbo mbala umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo iso iyeshi iyami. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Kwuye ungwu o yi yi mo kaa lɔ zɔ yi ombu, la lu ta aka iyi iso iyi lu bu so mo mbala ewo iyi lu bu so yi mo; moo gba kwuye kwɔngu kwu bo, oo shi yi iso iyi lu bu so. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Moo akwu lunyi gba lu so le mo; Kwundu uwu Ete yi gba a zɛ ma yi gba e so le.<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />&lt;&lt;Umɛnɛ ee shi umanyi wu te lo ngbɛ wu ma, ada tete ee shi umɛ wu; ɛmɛ o shi umba ete mbo eyi akwɛyi oo shi te lo ngbɛ umba ete mbo mo. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Enzu lɛɛbi oo towo yi mo kwuwo mi. Onzu uwu a rima ngiri nzhii ba ibomo iyi kwuye, o sa wu ma. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Gba o lo yi inyashi mu kwuse kwɔlɛ, la lu rima la lu so mu kwuse ngwufo. Mi so yi ongbulolo, lu mbwa ifulama mu ese iyi Izirɛ lɛɛbi dɛ mo akwɛyi Umɛ uwu Onzu aa gbama.<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />&lt;&lt;Uvɔngɔkiya a ka u zɔ wu kiya ma mo; unye tete a ka ada kwogba wu ma mo. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Ishoshi tee u vɔngɔ kiya le yi kyamate u zɔ wu kiya tayi, unye ba le yi kyamate ada kwogba wu tete. Gba ada kwogba lala o ya wu tee Obelezebu, enzu umba kwogba wu ba o ya mba ɛnyi iyira iyi bɔkɔ i ka ɛlɛ ma moo?<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Onzu Uwu I Fate Lɔ Riyi Wu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Oluku 12.2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />&lt;&lt; Kwuwo kwɔlɛ la lu riyi mo. Moo kiya ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ o koko ngyi mo kekelele, o ta ngyi kwudu, ingyi bɔkɔ o nvye ngyi mo ba o wu ngyi ma laa enzu lɛɛbi. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Iso iyi mi so yi mu ipwu ele, la lu ta yi anu mɔnɔnda; iyi bɔkɔ o kpo yi kenzu mu kwɔlu gba o so yi le, la lu ta yi anu mu kadu unga kɛnu. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />La lu riyi iyi enzu wa ngbɛ ɛnwu ba o do te o ngbɛ kwundu mo; la lu riyi iyi Ukpo uwu e domo te a ngbɛ ɛnwu e kyo kwundu a ta ngwu mu kwogba ungwɔyi. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Epuru wepo o ya mba ma mu kwokobo kwukpɛnyi bi mo re? Ukpɛnyi mba ba a tama mɛzhi ba Ete yi e yitu mo mo. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Inyi iyi reshi yi lɛɛbi lala Ukpo e yi riba yi. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Kwuwo kwɔle la lu riyi mo; moo lunyi lu ka igba laa epuru riba ma.<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itamɛzhi Mbala Itowo Okrasi Mo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:8">Oluku 12.8</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:9">9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />&lt;&lt; Onzu uwu a zɔ izɔgɔ mi mu idu iyi enzu, Imi mi zɔ izɔgɔ wu mu idu iyi Ada mi uwu e yi mu oshi. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Onzu uwu ba a zɔ kwu zɔ mi mu idu iyi enzu, Imi mi zɔ kwu zɔ wu mu idu iyi Ada mi uwu e yi mu oshi.<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akwu Ukpandɛrɛ Moo Akwu Oloto Mo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Oluku 12.51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26">14.26</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 14:27">27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />&lt;&lt;La lu bi egbo tee mi bo tee kaa la mi shi yi oloto mu kwudu kwɔlɛ mo. Ukpandɛrɛ gba mi bo wu le moo akwu oloto mo. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Mi bo tee kaa, &lt;&lt;&lt;Umɛ lakwu ogewa uwu ete wu, Umoko lakwu ogewa uwu anyi wu, Oko uwu umɛ lakwu ogewa uwu anyɔnu wu. <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Agewa umba onzu akwu enzu umba kwogba wu.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e pwu idɛnyi iyi anyi wu naa ete wu a ka mi ma, a fa ma mi mo; onzu uwu bɔkɔ e pwu idɛnyi iyi umɛ wu ɔnzɔnu naa umoko a ka mi ma, a fa ma mi mo. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e to kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu wu a mbwalu mi mo, a fa ma mi mo. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a gyi kwunyɔ wu, kwunyɔ wu kwu tomo; onzu uwu bɔkɔ kwunyɔ wu ku tomo kwuwo mi, a gba a fyangwu ma.<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛduma Iyi Rigbɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Omaki 9.41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />&lt;&lt; Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a na yi, a na mi tete; onzu uwunawuna uwu a na mi, a na onzu uwu a lɔ mi. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu a na anukenzu uwu Ukpo kwuwongu akwu anu kenzu, Ukpo e shi wu rigbɛ ingyi o shi anukenzu. Onzu uwunawuna uwu a na onzu uwu ototo kwuwongu akwu onzu uwu ototo, Ukpo e shi wu rigbɛ ingyi o shi onzu uwu ototo. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Ongbulolo gba mi so yi le tee onzu uwunawuna uwu e shi u mbwambwa ukpɛnyi mekeka iyi enzu wa mbwalu mi mbɔlɛ omudu uwu embyi umba oloto kwuwongu akwu wa mbwalu mi kaka lala, aa fa la rigbɛ i nama mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s">Alɔgbulɔ Mbaa Ɔzhɔnu Uwo Obatisima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Oluku 7.18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a mbwa Wavɔngɔkiya wu wewo la wepo kaza ishimo, e yimo mɔmɔ akwɛyi e fye mu ese iyi Ogalili laa ɛzu izɔma mbala anu itama iyi iso iyi Ukpo.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Kwuye ungwu Ɔzhɔnu uwo Obatisima uwu e yi mu Ugugyi a pwa iyi bɔkɔ Okrasi e yi mu iwomo, akwɛyi a lɔ Wavɔngɔkiya wu ma mbaa wu. <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />O yo Okrasi kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;So nzu,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;uŋɔ gba Ɔzhɔnu a zɔ te ŋɔ yi mu inyɔma le naa la ki fulo eyi mu onzu awa ŋa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;La lu so kaa la lu lu so Ɔzhɔnu kiya ingyi lu pwa mbala ingyi lu ma: <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />epeyi o gba la ɛbɛ imama, umba o yi alɛ mo o yi mu luzɛ, umba o yi ofya umbu embyi umba ɔyi, ofya mba u bo mo, wa salu o pwama, umba o kpomo o gba mba la iyimo, ayirewa o ta mba anu iyi Iso Iyi Esheshi. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Ɔnyɛ akwu uwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi egbo epo ma mi mo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Tabɔkɔ Wavɔngɔkiya umba Ɔzhɔnu o fulomo, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e le mu enzu umba o kpala ɛlu awu iso isomo mekeka iyi Ɔzhɔnu. E yo mbo tee: &lt;&lt;Kwuye ungwu lu ka mu ɛzhi ɛngbarara awu, lu ka tee kaa la lu yese kwuwongu mbe? Anga iyi bɔkɔ kwokpo kwu wo yi akpa awu re? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Naa lu ku yese kwuwongu mbe? Onzu uwu e kpo ekpayi iyi esheshi re? Ayimo, enzu umba o kpo ekpayi iyi esheshi o yi mu agba iyi asu! <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Ba lu ka te kaa la lu yese kwuwongu mbe? Anukenzu uwu Ukpo re? Ee, mi so yi, Ɔzhɔnu a ka anukenzu uwu Ukpo uwunawuna ma. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Moo Ɔzhɔnu gba akwu onzu bɔkɔ iso iyi Ukpo i zɔ tee: &lt;Ukpo a zɔ te, mi lɔ ɔlɔgbulɔ mi mu keyi ŋɔ kaa la nɔngɔ ŋɔ ɔgwuzɛ ma.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Mi so yi ongbulolo mɛɛ, mekeka iyi enzu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o mbamba mu kwudu kwɔlɛ uwu bɔkɔ a ka Ɔzhɔnu u wo obatisima ma e yi mo. Tetete onzu u mbwambwa mu Irɛsu Iyoshi a ka Ɔzhɔnu ma. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />I na ngbaa mu kwuyengwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhɔnu U wo obatisima e ye la anu itama nzhii ba mu kwuye kwɔlɛ, Irɛsu Iyoshi i yi mu inyashi imama gyɔɔ moo enzu umba ovyo o gyi te lo nyi yi isheye keyi ma. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Anukenzu lɛɛbi mbala Ɛrama iyi Omosisi o siso mu reshi ingyi Irɛsu ɛlɛ dɛ gba Ɔzhɔnu e bo le. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Shi lu yi egbo iyi lu na, ba la lu na moo Ɔzhɔnu gba akwu Elazha uwu bɔkɔ anukenzu o so tee a nyɔlɔ le <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Onzu uwu e yi alu iyi ipwama ba la pwa!<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />&lt;&lt;Kimbe ba mi masa ngyi mbala enzu umba ɔyi ɔlɛ? O yi kyamate ɛmɛshɛri umba o ŋɔma mu rishi o ya esu ma tee, <verse eid="MAT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />&lt;Ki so yi amwu iyi okopo itomo, lunyi ba lu komo mo! Ki so amwu iyi obobyi, lunyi ba lo ɔga mo!&gt; <verse eid="MAT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Kwuye ungwu Ɔzhɔnu e bo e wo kenyo ba e wo owanyi mo, akwɛyi uwewe a zɔ tee,&lt; E yi kwundu ungwura!&gt; <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Umɛ uwu Onzu e bo e ri e wo, akwɛyi uwewe a zɔ tee, &lt;Lo yese onzu ele! Akwu u ri kwuri ungwu ubu mbala u wo owanyi, umɛza uwu wa na oba uwɛzhi mbala enzu umba ingbomo!&gt; Ilukwu iyi Ukpo ba o zɔngɔ yi ma mu i womo yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ese Iyi Bɔkɔ I Ta Mɛzhi Mo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Oluku 10.13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e le mu ese iyi bɔkɔ e wo ɛduma iyi amɛ ma yi itumo, kwuwongu o towo ikwu ira mba ɔsu. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />&lt;&lt;Ikpɛdɔma akwu iya yi Okorazi! Ikpɛdɔma akwu iya yi tete Ɔbɛsayida! Lɔ zɔ tee ɛduma iyi kenzu iyama iyi bɔkɔ o wo mekeka yi ele, gba lo wo yi mu Otaya mbala Ɔsidɔ, diridiri enzu mɔmɔ lo bo kwu ira ɔsu laa ashɔgiri mbala kwulɔ ikpomo mɛnwu! <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />La mi so yi ongbulolo mɛɛ, ɔnuwu Kwɔfyi ungwu Ombwu izɔma, eyembembyi iyi Ukpo a ba ma iyi Otaya mbala Ɔsidɔ i ka iyayi ma! <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Lunyi enzu umba Okapanawu, lu mate lu fya ipwɔma moshi re? Ayimo, mu aleku gba o fu yi le. Apula iyi kenzu iyama iyi o wo mekeka yi ele gba lo wo yi mu Ɔsɔdɔmu, ba lo bo degbo kwɔfyi ungwu ɔnɛ te! <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />La mi so yi ongbulolo mɛɛ, ɔnuwu Kwɔfyi ungwu Ombwu izɔma, eyembembyi iyi Ukpo a ba ma iyi Ɔsɔdɔmu i ka iyayi ma!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">La lu Bo Mbaa Mi, Kaa Ɛnwu Li Gboyimo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21">Oluku 10.21</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 10:22">22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Kwuye kwɔngu Ɔzhizɔsi a lɛ Ukpo a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Mi du ŋɔ ma, Ada, Ɔkwu uwoshi mbala ɛzhi, kwuwongu ŋɔ nvye apula ɛlɛ ma lɛɛbi laa enzu umba ilukwu mbala umba iyitu, akwɛyi ŋɔ wuyima laa ɛmɛshɛri. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Ee, Ada, ɛlɛ gba i she ŋɔ woshi le.<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />&lt;&lt;Apula lɛɛbi Ada mi e lo mi yi mɔwu. Onzu uwu e yi Umɛ ele e yi mo, Ada kɛɛkyi gba e yi wu le, tatayi onzu uwu e yi Ada ele e yi mo, Umɛ kɛɛkyi mbala umba bɔkɔ Umɛ a ŋa te laa zɔ wu mba.<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />&lt;&lt;La lu bo mbaa mi, lɛɛbi yi umba lu yi mu inyashi imama iyi ewulo iyi ɔlu ishimo akwɛyi mi shi yi ɛnwu igbomo. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />La lu bo lu gbo mi rinye kaa la lu vɔngɔ mbaa mi, kwuwongu mi ku onzu uwu egbo mbala ugyi ɛmi ma, akwɛyi luu fya ɛnwu igbomo ma. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Moo rinye mi ri yi fule fule te, ewulo iyi bɔkɔ mi bi shi yi ba i yi ɔlu mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s">Kwuyo Mɛka Iyi Kwɔfyi Ungwu Ɛnwu Igbomo Ungwu Azhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Omaki 2.23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Oluku 6.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Ɔnuwu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo ungufo, Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu luzɛ mu itu iyi ewiri. Lonzu lu wo Wavɔngɔkiya wu ma akwɛyi o mu eshi iyi ewiri o le mu ikwu mo. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Tabɔkɔ Afarisi o ma ɛlɛ, akwɛyi o za la Ɔzhizɔsi tee, &lt;&lt; Yese, Wavɔngɔkiya ŋa o fo ɛrama iyi kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo mo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt; Lu du wa yi dɛ mo re kiya ingyi bɔkɔ Odevidi e wo kwuyengwu bɔkɔ lonzu lu wo wu mo uwu mbala enzu umba luzɛ wu? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />E fye mu Ɔtɛpu, uwu mbala enzu umba luzɛ wu o ri kiya ingyi ɛrama ingyi ki kpo tee umba lo ri mo, ebwoshi kɛɛkyi gba o ri le. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Naa lu du wa mu ɛrama iyi Omosisi dɛ mo re tee ebwoshi bɔkɔ o wo ɛduma mu Ɔtɛpu ɔnuwu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo awu o fo ɛrama ngwu ma, tetete ba o yi mbo ombu mo mo? <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Imi ba mi so yi tee onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ka Ɔtɛpu ma e yi munɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Gba la lu yi iluma iyi iso iyi Ukpo iyi i zɔ tee, &lt;Mi gyi isabɔ iyi izɔfyi mo, eyembembyi gba mi gyi le&gt; le, ba la lu bi ngbɛ onzu ɔsɛkɛnɛ ombu uwoyi mo; <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />moo Umɛ uwu Onzu gba akwu Ɔkwu uwu Kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Onzu uwu Kwuwo Wu Kwu Kpokapiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Omaki 3.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Oluku 6.6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Ɔzhizɔsi a lafya laa mɔmɔ akwɛyi e fye mu udaba uwu ɛlu ikpalama uwu Azhu, <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />onzu uwu kwuwo wu kwu kpokapiya e yi mu mɔmɔ. Kwuwongwu bɔkɔ o gyi tee lo fya kwuyi ungwu bɔkɔ o yi Ɔzhizɔsi ombu, akwɛyi o yo wu kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Ishoshi tee lo bo onzu ofya ma ɔnu uwu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Akwɛyi e yo mbo tee, &lt;&lt;Uwe mekeka yi bɔkɔ ilɔ wu a ta mu kwuvɔ ɔnu uwu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo ba e ri a ba wawuma mo? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Onzu e yi umwɔ a ka ilɔ ma! Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ akwu ɛrama ifomo mo tee lo wo iyeshi ɔnu uwu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Akwɛyi a za la onzu awu tee, &lt;&lt;Nda kwuwo ŋɔ ma.&gt;&gt; A nda ngwu ma, akwɛyi kwu gba odedengwu kyamate ungufo kwɔngu. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Akwɛyi Afarisi o wɔ kwudu o ta amasa mu reshi wu kaa lo ngbɛ wu ma.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umɛgba Uwu Bɔkɔ Ukpo A Ŋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a pwa ɛlɛ akwɛyi a lafya laa riyi ngyɛngyi. Enzu gyɔɔ o mbwalu wu, akwɛyi umba bɔkɔ o yi efya, e bo yi mbo mo lɛɛbi, <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />akwɛyi e lo mbo ilutu malu tee lo ba enzu ɛza iyawu mo. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />E wo ɛlɛ kaa li nyɔlɔma iso iyi anukenzu Azaya e so tee:<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />&lt;&lt;Ele gba akwu unye mi uwu bɔkɔ mi Ŋa le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">uwu mi pwu idɛnyi wu, uwu ubwu uruwu mi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Mi lo wu Kwundu mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">akwɛyi a zɔ ombu uwu enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ lɛɛbi.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />E tumo mo ba a kpɛyi mo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:19">onzonzu ɛnyi te a pwa opwu wu mu ɔgwuzɛ mo.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Kwonga ungwu kwu sele mo, a mu ngu ma mo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">ba a nyi ɔyi uwu ututula uwu a wa la uwu ma mo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">nzhii ba e shi enzu o nyama la ongbulolo,<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />ma wu gba enzu lɛɛbi o fulo eyi le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi Mbala Obezebu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Omaki 3.20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Oluku 11.14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Akwɛyi enzu umbafo o ka laa Ɔzhizɔsi onzu upeyi u tukenzu kwuwongu e yi kwundu ungwura. Ɔzhizɔsi e bo onzu le ofya ma, akwɛyi a gba laa isisomo mbala ɛbɛ imama. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Akwɛyi enzu lɛɛbi izele i yi mbo mo, akwɛyi o yo tee, &lt;&lt;Naa ele gba akwu umɛ uwu Odevidi le Ŋa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Tabɔkɔ Afarisi o pwa ɛlɛ, akwɛyi o zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Akwu Obelezebu, ɔsu uwu ɛndu iyira gba e shi wu ekpasu gba e wo ɛlɛ le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba e yitu iyi egbo mbo akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Ɛzhi iyinayina iyi i ka epo kaa li to ewa mbala esu, i kpɛdɔma. Kwuse naa kwogba ungwunanguna ungwu kwu ka epo kaa li to ewa mbala esu, kwu rima mo. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Gba onzu uwoyi a ra laa onzu uwoyi mo, i zɔ tee ɛzhi wu i ka epo-o, uwu akwu ogewa uwu ɛnwu wu. O wo tee bɔkɔ ɛzhi wu ii rima? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Gba akwu mu ekpasu iyi Obelezebu gba mi ra laa ɛndu iyira ma le, mu ekpasu iyi uwe bɔkɔ enzu yi o ra mba ma awu? Kwuwo ngɔlɛ, enzu yi lo zɔ ombu yi. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Gba akwu mu ekpasu iyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo gba mi ra laa ɛndu iyira ma le,de ba i zɔ tee irɛsu iyi Ukpo i bo munyi yi-e.<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />&lt;&lt;Naa i wo tee bɔkɔ onzu e fye mu kwogba ungwu onzu uwu ekpasu akwɛyi a kwu wu ewulo mo ba a ma onzu uwu ekpasu ele ma dɛ gba a kwu wu ewulo mo le mo?<verse eid="MAT 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />&lt;&lt; Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e yi mbala mi mo, akwu ogewa mi, onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a kpala ɛlu mbala mi mo, akwu u sɛma. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ gba mi so yi ele, ingbomo mbala iso isomo iyira iyinayina iyi enzu o so, o gba yi o kpa mba; onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e so iso iyira laa Kwundu uwu Ukpo ba o gba yi o kpawu mo. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e siso iyira mu reshi ingyi Umɛ uwu Onzu o-oo gba yi kpa wu; onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e siso iyira mu reshi ingyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo ba o gba yi kpa wu mo, mu ɔyi ɔlɛ laa ɔyi uwu u bu nyɔ awu.<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwɛyi Mbala Imwuma Wu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Oluku 6.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />&lt;&lt;Uwɛyi, o zɔngɔ wu ma mu imwuma wu. Uwɛyi uwesheshi u wa laa imwuma iyesheshi. Uwɛyi uwura, u wa laa imwuma iyira. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Lunyi ɛdɔ iyi agbazhi mbɔlɛ - lu wo tee bɔkɔ lu siso iyeshi lunyi umba bɔkɔ lu yi ira te? Moo kiya ingyi ki nyɔlɔ akɔ ma gba kenzu ke so le. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Onzu uwoshi a wala apula iyeshi iyi bɔkɔ iyi mu akɔ wu, onzu uwura tete a wa laa iyira iyi bɔkɔ iyi mu akɔ wu.<verse eid="MAT 12:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />Gba mi so yi ongbulolo le tee, uwewe e fulo ata mu kenzu wu ɔnu uwu Kwɔfyi ungwu Ombwu izɔma iyi iso iyira iyi bɔkɔ e so lɛɛbi. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Moo akwu iso isomo iyi kenzu ŋɔ gba o zɔ nɔ ombu le - tee ŋɔ kwu onzu ɔsɛkɛnɛ naa ŋɔ kwu onzu ɔsɛkɛnɛ mo le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Afarisi Mbala Wazɔ Ɛrama Iyi Omosisi O Gagyi Kɛzɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11">Omaki 8.11</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 8:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Oluku 11.29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Akwɛyi Afarisi umbafo mbala wa zɔ ɛzu iyi ɛrama o yo Ɔzhizɔsi kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;U zɔ kiya,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;ki gyi tee zɔ nzu kɛzɔ unga kenzu iyama kaa la ki ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Enzu umba ɔyi uwura mbala umba o yitu iyi Ukpo mo kɛɛkyi gba o yo kwuyo ungwu kɛzɔ unga kenzu iyama le! O zɔ yi kɛzɔ unganangana mo, kɛzɔ unga anukenzu Ozhona kɛɛkyi gba o zɔ yi nga le. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Kyamate bɔkɔ Ozhona a ŋɔ mu ubwu uwu Umu uwakwu afyi ɛla laa utu laa ɔnu awu, tatayi gba Umɛ uwu Onzu a ba nɔ le mɛzhi afyi ɛla laa utu laa ɔnu. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Ɔnuwu Kwɔfyi ungwu Ombwu izɔma, enzu umba Ɔninɛvɛ o rima mbala yi o ngbɛ yi ombu uwoyi, moo ɔ kwu ira mba ɔsu kwuyengwu o pwa anu itama iyi Ozhona; onzu uwu a ka Ozhona ma ba e yi munɛ! <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Ɔnuwu Kwɔfyi ungwu Ombwu izɔma Omakazhiya uwu Osheba e yimo a rima a ngbɛ yi ombu uwoyi; moo a wɔ ngbaa mu ɛzhi wu iyi indama tee kaa la pwa ɛzu izɔma iyi ilukwu iyi Ɔsɔlɔmɔ. Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ka Ɔsɔlɔmɔ ma ba e yi munɛ!<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Igbama Iyi Kwundu Ungwura</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Oluku 11.24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />&lt;&lt;Kwuye ungwu kwundu ungwura kwu wɔma mu ɛnwu iyi onzu, kwu kpa ɛvyɛ mu akata tee kaa lakwu fya riyi ingyi ɛnwu gbomo. Gba kwu fya mo, <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />kwu za laa ɛngwu tee, &lt;Mi gba mi re mu kwogba ungwu mi wɔ awu.&gt; Akwɛyi kwuu gbama kwuu du te kwogba kwɔngu kwu yi onzu mɛmi mo, o vyɛ ngwu ma kwu yi sɛsɛsɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Akwɛyi kwu gba kwu ri kwu bi ngye laa ɛndu iyira iyifo ekperewo iyi bɔkɔ i ka yi ira ma. Akwɛyi o fyemo mɛmi o ŋɔma mɔmɔ. Imbwama iyi onzu awu i ka ira la iyekyi. Ɛlɛ te gba i bi du enzu umba ɔyi uwura ɔlɛ le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anyi Uwu Ɔzhizɔsi Mbala Ɛmanyi Wu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Omaki 3.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Oluku 8.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu iso isomo mbala enzu umba o gyirima, akwɛyi anyi wu mbala ɛmanyi wu o bo ri kwudu o gyi tee lo so iso mbala wu. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Akwɛyi onzu uwufo mɔmɔ a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɛnɛ ŋɔ mbala Ɛmɛnɛ ŋɔ o yi kwudu o rigbo ŋɔ, o gyi tee lo siso mbala ŋa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba e yo mbo tee, &lt;&lt;Uwe ba akwu Ɛnɛ mi? Umbana ba akwu ɛmɛnɛ mi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Akwɛyi a zɔ ɛfyi mba Wavɔngɔkiya wu, akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;La lu yese! Mbɔlɛ gba akwu Ɛnɛ mi mbala ɛmɛnɛ mi le! <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e wo iyi Adami uwu bɔkɔ e yi moshi a gyi gba akwu umɛnɛ mi ɔnzɔnu mbala umɛnɛ mi oko mbala ɛnɛ mi le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s">Kwoba Ungwu Ɔnɛgba U to Eyi Iyi Ewiri Mu Utu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Omaki 4.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Oluku 8.4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Mɔnɔɔnungawu Ɔzhizɔsi a wɔ kwudu mogba a ka ŋɔ mu kenzu ungwu risu kaa laa zɔ ɛzu. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Akwɛyi enzu riba o gyirima munyi wu, akwɛyi e fye mɛmi iyi kwoda a ŋɔ ma enzu lɛɛbi ba o ri mu kenzu unga embyi.<verse eid="MAT 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Akwɛyi e so mbo iso ribariba mu aba tee: &lt;&lt;Ɔnɛgba a wɔ kwudu iyi kaa le to eyi iyi ewiri wu. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Tabɔkɔ e yi mu eyi itomo, iyifo i fu mu ɔgwuzɛ, akwɛyi afyi o bo o koyimo. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Iyifo ba i fu mu ɔzɔ, mɔmɔ umbwuru u yi gyɔɔ mo. I biyi efyefya, kwuwongu umbwuru u yi fulefule bi. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Kwuye ungwu ɔnu u yama bɔkɔ u la yi ma, akwɛyi i shirima kwuwongu akpa yi i ka mɛzhi mu kindo mo. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Eyi iyifo i fu mu awula, kwuyengwu i biyi, awula i ri yi mo. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Iyifo ba i fu mu ɛzhi iyesheshi akwɛyi i wa la imuma gyɔɔ; iyifo i wala imuma uwo ekpuwo, iyifo uwo ɛkpɛrɛnyi, iyifo ba uwo ɛkpɛla.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a mbwa iso wu ma akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwu e yi alu, la pwa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwuyi Ungwu Aba ɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Omaki 4.10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9">Oluku 8.9</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:10">10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Akwɛyi Wa vɔngɔ kiya wu o bo munyi wu akwɛyi o yo wu tee, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ki shi ba ŋɔ so enzu iso mu aba?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Iyitu iyi kwunvyeru iyi irɛsu iyi oshi o shi yi, moo akwu umba mo. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi kiya, oo kyo wu ngyi mo kaa le yi ngyi duduu; onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi kiya kinyinyi mo ba, kɛkɛɛkyi ingyi bɔkɔ e yi ngyi awu lala o na wu ngyi ma. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Akwu kwuwo kwɔlɛ gba mi so mbo iso mu aba le moo o yi mu iyesemo, ba tete o ma ɛbɛ mo, o yi mu alu ingbɛma ba tete o pwa mo ba o zɔngɔma mo. <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Iso iyi bɔkɔ anukenzu Azaya e so awu ba i wɔ mamba tototo tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">&lt;&lt;Enzu mbɔlɛ o ngbalu ba o ngbalu, tete o zɔngɔma mo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">o yese ba o yese, tete o ma mo,<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />kwuwongu egbo iyi enzu mbɔlɛ i nzhirima-a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">o se alu mba ma akwɛyi i pwama ɔnyɛnyɛ mo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">ba o kpala eyi mbo mo-o.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">Moo o bo ma ɛbɛ mu eyi mbo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">o bo pwa mu alu mba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">o bo zɔngɔma mu egbo mbo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">akwɛyi oo fulo biri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">akwɛyi mii bo mbo ofya ma mo.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />&lt;&lt;Lunyi ba, ɔnyɛ akwu uwayi! Kwuwongwu eyi yi i ma ɛbɛ, alu yi ba i pwama. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Mi so yi ongbulolo tee, anukenzu gyɔɔ mbala enzu umba ototo o gyikpɔ tee lo ma kiya ingyi lu ma le umba ba o mangyi mo, lo pwa iyi lu pwa le ba o pwa mo.<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi A Lu Kwoba Ungwu Ɔnɛgba U to Eyi Iyi Ewiri Mu Utu Ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Omaki 4.13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Oluku 8.11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />&lt;&lt;La lu ngbɛ alu ŋa nɛ kaa lu pwa iluma iyi kwoba ungwu ɔnɛgba u to eyi iyi ewiri. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a pwa iso iyi irɛsu iyi oshi ba a zɔngɔ yi ma mo, onzu awu e yi kyamate ewiri iyi bɔkɔ i fu mu ɔgwuzɛ tayi. Akwɛyi onzu uwoyi e bo akwɛyi a wa kiya ingyi o so mawu awu ma. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Eyi iyi bɔkɔ i fu mu ɔzɔ awu i yi kyamate onzu uwu bɔkɔ a pwa iso ɛnyi akwɛyi mu kwotota a na yi ma laa ɔnyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Kwuwongwu a kɔ akpa ma mo, e to kwuye gyɔɔ mo. Gba kwuyengwu wɔnu kwu bo naa o lo wu inyashi kwuwongu iso ɛlɛ, a gba kembo efyefya. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Eyi iyi bɔkɔ i fu mu awula awu i yi kyamate onzu uwu bɔkɔ a pwa iso ɛnyi; ɔbulɛ idu gididi iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ mbala ekweyi iyi kiya ingyi kwuwo i kpo yi ɛndu akwɛyi imuma mo. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Eyi iyi bɔkɔ i fu mɛzhi iyesheshi awu i yi kyamate onzu uwu bɔkɔ a pwa iso ɛlɛ ba a zɔngɔ yi ma: A wala imwuma, iyifo uwo ekpuwo, iyifo uwo ɛkpɛrɛnyi iyifo ba uwo ekpela.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwoba Ungwu Asɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Ɔzhizɔsi a ba mba kwoba ungufo kpɔ tee: &lt;&lt;Irɛsu iyi oshi iyi kyamate onzu uwu e so ewiri iyesheshi mu utu wu tayi. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Kwuye ungwu enzu o yi mu ondo, ogewa wu e fyemo akwɛyi e so igbɛpɛ mɛmi iyi ewiri akwɛyi a ka ma iyawu. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ ewiri i le mu imwuma akwɛyi igbɛpɛ tete i wɔ meka yi. <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />&lt;&lt; Ɛmɛgba mba ɔnɛgba awu o bo mbaa wu akwɛyi o za wu tee, &lt;Ada kwogba, akwu eyi iyesheshi gba ŋɔ so le mo re? Muna bɔkɔ igbɛpɛ i wɔ?&gt; <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />A gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt; &lt;Akwu ɔgɛwa uwufo gba e wo ɛlɛ le,&gt; akwɛyi o yo wu tee, &lt;Ŋɔ gyi tee la ki so kaa la ki ngbɛ ikpɛpɛ ɛnyi ma re?&gt; <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />A gba mba opwu tee, &lt;Ayimo,&gt; &lt;moo kwuyengwu bɔkɔ lu bu le mu igbɛpɛ ingbɛma awu lu bu ngbɛ ewiri lu kyo mbala yi mo. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />La lu shi yi li bulɔma kya li gbo la kwuye ungwu o lɔ ewiri ma. Kwuye kwɔngwu gba mi za la walɔma tee: La lu kwu igbɛpɛ ma keyi ka la lu mayima mu ikpo ikpo ka la lu puyi mo mɔyi; ewiri ba la lu kpala yi ɛlu ka la lu fu yi mu kɛnɛ mi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwoba Ungwu Eyi Iyi Omusita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Omaki 4.30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18">Oluku 13.18</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:19">19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Ɔzhizɔsi a ba mba kwoba ungufo kpɔ tee: &lt;&lt;Irɛsu iyi oshi i yi mate eyi iyi omusita iyi bɔkɔ onzu e so mutu wu tayi. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Eyi yi i yi iyɛri i ka eyi iyinayina ma, tetete kwuye ungwu kwu bulɔma kwuu vindɔ uwɛyi uwu u ka uwunawuna ma utu ɔnwu, afyi umba oshi oo kwu mu ende wu akwɛyi oo ndo rigu mbo mɔmɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwoba Ungwu Otutu Owuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20">Oluku 13.20</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:21">21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba a ba mba kwoba kpɔ tee: &lt;&lt;Irɛsu iyi oshi i yi kyamate otutu kɛkyi uwu bɔkɔ okokpayi e to e kyo mu emudu ɛla iyi umbwu uwu akara akwɛyi a za mbu ma nzhii ba u fye mesu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛduma Iyi Ɔzhizɔsi E Wo Mu Aba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:33">Omaki 4.33</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 4:34">34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Ɔzhizɔsi e so iso ɛlɛ lɛɛbi laa riba ingyi enzu mu aba; ingyinangyina bɔkɔ e so mbo akwu mu aba. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />E wo ɛlɛ kaa iso iyi anukenzu e so awu li wɔma tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">Mu aba gba mi siso mbala mba le;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">Mi so mbo apula iyi o nvye yi mo ngba tabɔkɔ o wo kwudu kwɔlɛ le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi A Lu Kwoba Ungwu Asɛ Ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Kwuye ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi a lafya laa riba ingyi enzu mbamba akwɛyi e fye mogba, Wa vɔngɔ kiya wu o bo munyi wu akwɛyi o za wu tee, &lt;&lt;La nzu kwoba ungwu igbɛpɛ iyi i yi mɛmi iyi utu awu ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e so eyi iyesheshi awu akwu Umɛ uwu Onzu; <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />utu ɔnwu akwu kwudu kwɔlɛ; eyi iyesheshi ɛnyi ba akwu enzu umba irɛsu iyi Ukpo; igbɛpɛ ba akwu enzu umba Onzu Uwoyi; <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />ɔgɛwa uwu e so igbɛpɛ awu ba akwu Onzu Uwoyi. Kwuye ungwu ilɔma ba akwu imbwama iyi kwushi kwɔlɛ, wa lɔma ba akwu alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />&lt;&lt;Kyamate bɔkɔ o kpala igbɛpɛ ɛlu akwɛyi o pwu yi mo awu, tatayi gba i yi le mu imbwama iyi kwushi kwɔlɛ; <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Umɛ uwu Onzu a lɔ alɔgbulɔ wu ma, kaa lo kpala enzu umba bɔkɔ o shi enzu o ngbomo mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ o wo apula iyira ɛlu, <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />akwɛyi o kwu mbo oo fu mu kwoba ungwu ɔyi, mɔmɔ gba oga ilomo mbala ɛnyi ilamesu i yi le. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Kwuye kwɔngwu enzu umba Ukpo ba o lemo kyamate ɔnu tayi mu irɛsu iyi Ete mbo. Onzu uwu e yi alu ba laa pwa!<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwoba Ungwu Kiya Ingyi Kwuwo Ingyi Ki Nvyemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />&lt;&lt;Irɛsu iyoshi iyi mate kiya ingyi kwuwo ingyi ki nvyemo mɛzhi tayi. Onzu uwufo a ma ngyi akwɛyi a gba ngyi la invyemo. Kwuwongwu ɔnyɛ a gawu ma akwɛyi a ka ya apula iyi bɔkɔ e yi yi lɛɛbi ma akwɛyi a ya ɛzhi ɛnyi ma.<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwoba Ungwu Kwokyi Ungwu Abwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />&lt;&lt;Irɛsu iyi oshi i gba i yi mate u wo rishi uwu a gagyi ekyi iyi abwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Kwuye ungwu a fya kwukpɛnyi ungwu abwa, a ka ma akwɛyi akwu ingyinangyina wu ma ndii a yama akwɛyi a ya kwokyi kwɔngu.<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwoba Ungwu Eya Iyi Emu Iyimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />Tete kpɔ, Irɛsu iyoshi i yi mate eya iyi o fu mu risu akwɛyi i yi emu ikikɔ ikikɔ. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ eya ɛnyi i nyɔlɔma, wa yi emu o pyipyi yi o bo yi mu kenzu unga embyi. Akwɛyi o ŋɔma o tɛ emu umbesheshi ma o fu mu lubiri, umbira ba o fu mbo mo. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Tegba i yi le mu imbwama iyi kwushi kwɔlɛ: alɔgbulɔ umbu Ukpo o nyɔ akwɛyi o ka enzu umbira mbala umbesheshi ma. <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />akwɛyi o to mbo pyo o fu mbo mu kwoba ungwu ɔyi, mɔmɔ gba ɔga ilomo mbala ɛnyi ilamamesu i yi le.<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ongbulolo Uwepo Mbala Uwekyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Ɔzhizɔsi e yo mbo tee, &lt;&lt;Apula ɛlɛ lu zɔngɔ yi ma ndii?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:51">O gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ee.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Kwuwo kwɔngwu, u zɔ ɛzu iyi ɛrama iyi Omosisi uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ o zɔ wu ɛzu iyi Irɛsu iyoshi e yi mate ɔkwu uwu kwogba uwu bɔkɔ a wala kiya ingyi kwuwo wu mu kɛnɛ wu ingyepo mbala ingyekyi tayi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">O Towo Ɔzhizɔsi Ma Mu Ɔnazarɛti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Omaki 6.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Oluku 4.16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Kwuye ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi a mbwa mba aba ɛnyi ibama, a lafya laa kizɛ ngyɛngyi <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />akwɛyi a gba a ka mu kwuse wu. A zɔ ɛzu mu udaba uwu ɛlu ikpalama uwu Azhu akwɛyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o pwa wu, i shi mbo kenzu iyama. O yo tee, &lt;&lt;Muna bɔkɔ onzu ele a fya ilukwu ɛlɛ te mbala ekpasu iyi apula iwomo iyi kenzu iyama wu ɛlɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />&lt;&lt;Akwu umɛ uwu okapita ele mo re? Ɛnyi iyi anyi wu akwu Omeri mo re? Ɛmanyi wu ba akwu Ozhemisi, Ɔzhɔsɛfu, Ɔsamɔ mbala Ozhudasi mo re? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Ɛmanyi wu ekokpayi lɛɛbi o ŋɔ mbala nzu ele mo re? Muna ba onzu ele a fya ɛlɛ lɛɛbi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Akwɛyi o to la amba mbala wu akwɛyi o towu mo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">Ɔzhizɔsi ba a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Mu kwuse wu mbala mogba wu kɛɛkyi gba anukenzu e yi umwɔ mo le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />E wo apula iyi kenzu iyama mɔmɔ gyɔɔ mo, kwuwongu o kwu idu o fulo mawu mo.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s">Lukwu Ndu Ɔzhɔnu Uwo Obatisima (Omaki 6.14 - 29; Oluku 9.7- 9)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Mu kwuye kwongwu Ɛrɔdu, ɔsu uwu ɛzhi iyi Ogalili, a pwa eza iyi Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />Akwɛyi a za la ɛmɛgba wu tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu ele akwu Ɔzhɔnu uwo Obatisima, uwu bɔkɔ e yimo mu lukwu, ɛlɛ gba i shi e yi ekpasu iyi apula iyi amɛ iwomo le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Moo Ɛrɔdu e yi Ɔzhɔnu ma, a kpawakyi akwɛyi a ta wu mu ugu ugyi. E wo ɛlɛ kwuwongu Ɛrɔdiya, oko uwu umanyi wu Ofilipu. <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />Moo Ɔzhɔnu e koko e so wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ishoshi te kaa to Ɛrɔdiya lakwu oko ŋɔ mo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Ɛrɔdu a gyi tee laa ngbɛ wu ma, ba ee wiyi iyi enzu umba Azhu, kwuwongu umba o to Ɔzhɔnu tee akwu anukenzu uwu Ukpo.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Ɔnu uwu bɔkɔ Ɛrɔdu e wo odumudumu uwu kwɔfyi ungwu o mba wu, umɛ uwu Ɛrɔdiya e komo leyi iyi agboga wu. Ɛrɔdu a mwɔnyɛ mu eko wu ɛlɛ <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />akwɛyi e to wu ishi tee, &lt;&lt;Mi vungɔma mi shi ŋɔ kiya ingyinangyina ingyi ŋɔ nda!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Anyi wu e lo wu mu ubwu, akwɛyi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Shi mi reshi ingyi Ɔzhɔnu u wo obatisima mu kaatu munɛ kekelele!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Ɔsu Ɛrɔdu e wo ubugyi, akwɛyi kwuwongu bɔkɔ e tishi leyi iyi agboga wu lɛɛbi awu, akwɛyi e shi ɔkpa tee ingyi bɔkɔ a gyi awu, lo shi wu ngyi. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Akwɛyi a lɔma tee lo kpolo kwoshi ungwu Ɔzhɔnu ma mugu ugyi . <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Akwɛyi o bo la kwoshi wu mu kwuso akwɛyi o shi ngwu umoko awu, uwu ba e to ngwu a ka la anyi wu. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya umba Ɔzhɔnu o bo, o to ukpɛzhi wu ma, o ko kpa wu ami; akwɛyi o ka o so yi Ɔzhizɔsi.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi E Fye Enzu Edubu Ɛlɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Omaki 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Oluku 9.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Ɔzhɔnu 6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a pwa ingyi ri wo, akwɛyi e yimo e fye mu kwoda a ka ŋɔma kɛɛkyi wu mu riyi ingyifo. Tabɔkɔ riba ingyi enzu o pwa ɛlɛ o wɔ mu ese mba ɔ zɛ malɛ o mbwalu wu. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a wɔ mu kudu mu kwoda, akwɛyi a ma enzu riba, inyashi mba i wo wu mo, akwɛyi umba bɔkɔ o yi efya e bo yi mbo mo.<verse eid="MAT 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Mu onoyo ɔwu Wavɔngɔkiya wu o bo munyi wu akwɛyi o za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Munɛ akwu ɛzhi ɛngbarara, ɔnu ba u bo-o, lafya la enzu mbɔlɛ kaa lo fye mu kwuse kaa lo ya kiya ingyirimo lɛmba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Akwu mɛga tee oo gba o rimo mo, la lu shi mbo kiya ka lo ri!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu o za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ki yi eburedi ɛlɔ mbala emu wepo bi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La lu ka mi yi te.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Akwɛyi a za la enzu mbamba te lo ŋɔma mɛzhi; akwɛyi e to eburedi ɛlɔ ɛnyi mbala emu wepo mbamba akwɛyi e yese moshi, a gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi akwɛyi a mu eburedi ɛnyi ma, e shi Wavɔngɔkiya wu akwɛyi o ka yi enzu mbamba. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Enzu lɛɛbi mba o ri ubwu e do mbo mo. Akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu o kpala iyi bɔkɔ i shimo ɛlu mu lubiri luwo la lopo. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o ri kiya awu akwu anzɔnu edubu ɛlɔ, i kyo eko mbala ɛmɛshɛri mo.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi A Zɛma Mu Kadu Unga Embyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Omaki 6.45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Ɔzhɔnu 6.15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛnyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za la Wavɔngɔkiya wu tee lo fye mu kwoda lo to keyi lo so mu ɛsɛnyi iyi risu akwɛyi uwu ba a za la enzu umba riba mbamba tee lo so mogba. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Mizhikembo iyi a lafya laa enzu mbamba o kama, akwɛyi a ka mu lɔwa kɛɛkyi wu kaa la lɛ Ukpo. E yi mɔmɔ kɛɛkyi wu nzhii ba mu onoyo; <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />Kwuye kwɔngu ba kwoda kwu ka sharu mɛmi iyi risu-o, akwɛyi kwu le mu imima kwuwongu kwokpo kwu yi mu itumo kwu kpo mangwu.<verse eid="MAT 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Mu eyifumo Ɔzhizɔsi a zɛ mu kadu unga embyi e bo mbaa Wavɔngɔkiya wu. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Tabɔkɔ o ma wu mu luzɛ mu kadu unga embyi, iyi i wo mbo mo. Akwɛyi o tara oga o zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Akwu ubana!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Kɛlɛlɛ akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La lu kɔ idu ma, akwu Imi. La lu wiyi mo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Akwɛyi Opita a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu gba akwu uŋɔ ngboro de ba za mi te la mi zɛma mu embyi kaa la mi bi du ŋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Bo&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi Opita a wɔma mu kwoda akwɛyi e le mu luze mu kadu unga embyi e sheye mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Tabɔkɔ a ma kwokpo kwu yi mu ifyama iiyɛkɔkɔ mu kwoda akwɛyi a riyi akwɛyi e le mu dingbi akwɛyi a tara oga tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu sa mi ma loo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Kɛlɛlɛ akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a nda kwuwo e yi wu akwɛyi a za wu tee &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ uwu ikwu idu lu fulo kɛɛkyi ele! Kimbe ki shi ŋɔ yi egbo epo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Tabɔkɔ o fye mu kwoda akwɛyi kwokpo kwu gbo ndii. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Wambwalu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu kwoda mɔmɔ o gbo wu ɔya, akwɛyi o zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Iyesheshi ŋɔ kwu Umɛ uwu Ukpo kego!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi E Bo Enzu Ofya Ma Mu Kwuse Ungwu Ɔgɛnɛsarɛti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Omaki 6.53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Akwɛyi o sa risu ma o bo mu ɛzhi iyi Ɔgɛnɛsarɛ, <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />tabɔkɔ enzu umba kwuse kwɔngu o zɔngɔ Ɔzhizɔsi ma, o lɔ ma la ese iyi bɔkɔ i ŋɔ i kpamba kɛlɛ awu akwɛyi o ka wu laa enzu mbo lɛɛbi umba o pwu ofya. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />O kpa wu ɛshɛku kaa enzu umba o pwu ofya lo pwu afyi mu etu iyi okpayi wu, akwɛyi umba bɔkɔ o pwu afyi lɛɛbi ofya mba u bo mo.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s">Ɛzɔ Iyi Asɔkwu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Omaki 7.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Akwɛyi Wa zɔ ɛrama iyi Omosisi mbala Afarisi umbafo o wɔ mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ o bo mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi, akwɛyi o yo wu tee, <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />&lt;&lt;Iwote bɔkɔ Wavɔngɔkiya ŋa o fo ɛrama iyi asɔkwu nzu ma? O shishi ewo mo dɛ gba o ri kiya le mo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Ɔzhizɔsi, ba a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Iwote ba lunyi lu fo ɛrama iyi Ukpo mo kwuwo ungwu ukwu yi? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Moo Ukpo a zɔ tee, &lt;Lomo laa ada ŋa mbala ɛnɛ ŋɔ,&gt; &lt;Onzu uwunawuna uwu e pe ete wu nana anyi wu ari, mega o ngbɛ wu ma.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Lunyi ba lu zɔ tee gba onzu a za laa ete wu nana anyi wu te, &lt;Ogbo uwu lu bu fya munyi mi akwu rɛshi ingyi o shi ngyi laa Ukpo,&gt; <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />e lo ete wu mo fo, kwuwongu ukwu uwu ɛdɔ yi, iso iyi Ukpo lu mbwaya ra. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Lunyi enzu umba angba mbɔlɛ! Anukenzu Azaya e so kyaa kwuye ungwu e siso iyi Ukpo mu reshi yi tee!<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Ukpo a zɔ tee, enzu mbɔlɛ o lo mi mo mu kenzu mbo bi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:8">egbo mbo ba i ndama mbaa mi.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Umba oo gbo mi oya shaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:9">ɛzɔ mba akwu ikama iyi enzu, moo akwu iyi Ukpo mo!&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apula Iyi I Shi Onzu A Wuluma Mu Idu Iyi Ukpo Mo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Omaki 7.14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a ya riba ingyi enzu mo akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La lu ngbɛ alu kaa la lu zɔngɔ yi ma! <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Akwu kiya ingyi ki fye mu kenzu unga onzu gba ki tutu wu mo le mo, kiya ingyi ki wɔ mu kenzu wu gba ki tutu wu mo le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu o bo munyi wu akwɛyi o za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ yitu tee Afarisi o wo amba tabɔkɔ o pwa iso ɛlɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Kwuwɛyi ungwunanguna ungwu bɔkɔ akwu Adami uwu e yi moshi awu gba e gwungwu le mo, o ngbɛngwa buu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />&lt;&lt;La lu lu mba afyima! Umba akwu epeyi wa zɔ epeyi ɔgwuzɛ; gba upeyi a zɔ upeyi uwufo ɔgwuzɛ wepepo mbo o fu mu kwuvɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Akwɛyi Opita a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;La nzu kwoba kwɔlɛ ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Ɔzhizɔsi e yo mbo tee, &lt;&lt;Lunyi lu degbo lu du zɔngɔ iyi bɔkɔ mi yeyi mu isomo le mo kpɔɔ? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Lunyi lu yitu mo? Kiya ingyinangyina ingyi ki fye mu kenzu ki re mu ubwu akwɛyi o wa ngyi ma mɛnwu. <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Kiya ingyi ki wɔ mu kenzu ba akwu te ki wɔ mu akɔ, ingyi gba ki tutu onzu mo le. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Moo akwu mu akɔ gba amasa iyira iyi i bo laa onzu ingbɛma, kaya itomo, inyama, ɛlɔ, izɔgɔ itomo iyi iso iyira mbala enzu itutumo ii wɔ le. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Ɛlɛ gba i tutu onzu mo le. Kiya irimo mu kwuwo ungwu ɛnyinyi ki tutu onzu mo mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikwidufulo Iyi Okokpayi Uwu Okena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Omaki 7.24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a lafya laa kizɛ ngyɛngyi akwɛyi a ka mu ɛzhi iyi i yi kɛlɛlɛ mbala ese iyi Otaya mbala Ɔsidɔ. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Okokpayi uwu Okena uwu a wɔ mu ɛzhi e bo munyi wu, laa ɔga ilomo tee, &lt;&lt; Umɛ uwu Odevidi!&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Shɔɔkɔ ma eyembembyi mi nɛ Adakwogba! Umɛ mi okokpayi e yi ɛndu iyira e yi mu inyashi imama gyɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a gba wu opwu mo. Akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu o bo munyi wu akwɛyi o kpawu ɛshɛku o za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ra wu ma! Moo aa mbwalu nzu la oga, e wo nzu uzhi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔ lɔ mi mbaa enzu umba Izirɛ umba o yi kyamate ilɔ umba o tomo tayi awu kɛɛkyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Mɔmɔɔmɔ oko awu e bo, e kwumo mu idu wu laa ɛshɛku ikpama. A za wu tee &lt;&lt;Adakwogba shɔɔkɔ mbwa mi ma!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;ishoshi tee lo to kiya ingyirimo ingyi ɛmɛ umba enzu kaa lo ta ngyi laa izu mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Oko awu a gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ee tegba i yi le, Adakwogba,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;tetete izu o ri iyi bɔkɔ i fu mɛzhi mu idu iyi adakwogba mba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Oko ele, ikwu idu lu fulo ŋɔ i mbulama! O pwa kwoya ŋa-a.&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi ofya mbu umɛ wu u bomo mu kwotata kwɔngwu.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi E Bo Enzu Gyɔɔ Efya Ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Ɔzhizɔsi a lafya laa mɔmɔ a zɛ mu kenzu unga Risu ingyi Ogalili. Akwɛyi a yama a ka ŋɔma mu odudu. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Enzu riba riba o bo munyi wu, laa wa mu alɛ ma, epeyi, umba kinyɛ, wa tukenzu, mbala umbafo gyɔɔ uma ofya, o bo o shi mbo mu idu wu akwɛyi e bo mbo ofya ma. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Enzu o ya kenzu kwuwongu o ma wa tukenzu mu iso isomo, umba kinyɛ o ŋɔ gɛlɛ, wa mu alɛ ma o zɛma, wa peyi o ma ɛbɛ, akwɛyi enzu o gbo Ukpo oya uwu Izirɛ ma.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi E Fye Enzu Edubu Endo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Omaki 8.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Ɔzhizɔsi a ya Wavɔngɔkiya wu ma akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Eyembembyi iyi enzu mbɔlɛ i wo mi mo, moo o yi mbala mi afyi ela-a ba o yi kiya ingyirimo mo. Mi gyi tee la mi za mba lo sheyimo laa lonzu mo kwuwongu o bo kpo igbashi mu ɔgwuzɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Wa vɔngɔ kiya wu o yo wu kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Muna ba ki fya kiya ingyirimo mu ɛzhi ɛngbarara kwɔlɛ ingyi ki shi riba ingyi enzu mbɔlɛ kaa ki do mbo mo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yo mbo tee, &lt;&lt;Lu yi ɛvɔ eburedi ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 15:34">O gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Eburedi erewo mbala emu bwɛ umbɛri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi za laa riba ingyi enzu mbamba tee lo ŋɔma mɛzhi. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Akwɛyi e to eburedi erewo mbala emu mbamba, a gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi, a mu yi ma akwɛyi e shi Wavɔngɔkiya wu, akwɛyi o ka enzu. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Enzu lɛɛbi o ri ubwu e do mbo mo. Mizhikembo iyi ɛnyi, Wavɔngɔkiya wu o kwu iyi bɔkɔ o ri i shimo i nyɔlɔ lubiri lorowo ma. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o ri akwu enzu edubu endo, eko mbala ɛmɛshɛri o kyo o wa mba mo.<verse eid="MAT 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e wo enzu mbamba ungbo akwɛyi e fye mu kwoda a ka mu ɛzhi iyi Omagadani.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s">Afarisi O Gagyi Kɛzɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Omaki 8.11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Oluku 12.54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Ɔnu uwufo Afarisi mbala Asadusi umbafo o bo mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi kaa lo pwa wu ma, akwɛyi o za wu tee, la zɔ mba kɛzɔ unga ke ngyi moshi kaa lo yitu tee Ukpo e yi mbala wu. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Kwuye ungwu ɔnu u gbomo, lu zɔ tee, &lt;Oshi u ŋɔ yɔɔ le kizɛ ki ŋii shoshi.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Mu kwoto mu kwoto ba lu zɔ tee, &lt;Ɔnɛnɛ Ukpo e tumo moo oshi u ŋɔ yɔɔ mbala amu duruduru.&gt; Lunyi lu yese oshi ba lu yitu iluma wu ba lu yitu iluma iyi lɔzɔ undu kwuye kwɔlɛ mo!.<verse eid="MAT 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Ɔyi uwu enzu umbira mbala wa yitu iyi Ukpo mo mbɔlɛ! Lunyi luu gagyi kɛzɔ unga amɛ munyi mi? Kakpɛkpɛnyi te oo shi yi mo! Kɛzɔ unga amɛ unga Ozhona kɛɛkyi gba oo shi yi le.&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a lumba afyi ma a kama iyawu.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otutu Owuna Uwu Afarisi Mbala Asadusi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Omaki 8.14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Kwuye unga bɔkɔ Wavɔngɔkiya o sa risu ma, o ka la kwuleyi o za laa kwoburedi kukpɛnyi te mo. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La lu wo bɛtɛ; la lu gbo ɛnwu yi ma mbaa otutu uwu Afarisi mbala Asadusi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Akwɛyi o kwo mu esu isomo tee, &lt;&lt;Akwu kwuwongu ki za la eburodi mo le gba e so ɛlɛ le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba e yi egbo mbo awu, akwɛyi e yo mbo tee, &lt;&lt;Lunyi umba ikwu idu lu fulo kɛɛkyi mbɔlɛ! &lt;&lt;Kimbe ki shi ba lu so esu tee akwu kwuwongu lu za laa eburodi mo gba mi siso ɛlɛ le? <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Lu du zɔngɔ yi ma mo kpɔɔ? Lu lolo eburodi ɛlɔ bɔkɔ mi fye enzu anzɔnu edubu ɛlɔ ma yi akwɛyi iyi bɔkɔ i shimo akwu lubiri luwo la lopo mo re? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Nana eburodi erewo iyi bɔkɔ o shi enzu edubu endo o ri, lubiri lɔvɔ bɔkɔ o ri lu shimo? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />I wote ba lu zɔngɔ yi ma mo tee akwu iso iyi eburodi gba mi so yi le mo? &lt;&lt;La lu wo bɛtɛ; la lu gbo ɛnwu yi ma mbaa otutu uwu Afarisi mbala Asadusi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya o zɔngɔma tee, a za mba tee lo gbo ɛnwu mba ma mbaa otutu uwu o fu mu eburodi awu mo, akwu meka iyi ɛzɔ iyi Afarisi mbala Asadusi gba lo gbo ɛnwu mba ma le.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iso Iyi Opita E So Mɛka Iyi Ɔzhizɔsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Omaki 8.27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Oluku 9.18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Kwuye ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi e bo mu ɛzhi iyi Oseseriya Ofilipi, e yo Wavɔngɔkiya wu tee, &lt;&lt;Enzu ɔ zɔ tee Umɛ uwu Onzu akwu uwe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />O gba opwu, o zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Umbafo mbo o zɔ tee akwu Ɔzhɔnu u wo obatisima, umbafo o zɔ tee akwu Elazha, umbafo ba o zɔ tee akwu Ozheremaya nana anukenzu uwu Ukpo uwufo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Akwɛyi e yo mbo tee &lt;&lt;Lunyi kɔ?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Lunyi ba lu zɔ te mi kwu uwe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Akwɛyi Ɔsamɔ Opita a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ gba ŋɔ kwu Okrasi le, Umɛ uwu Ukpo ureyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔnyɛ akwu uwaŋa Ɔsamɔ umɛ uwu Ɔzhɔnu!&gt;&gt; Moo akwu onzu gba a wu ŋɔ ongbulolo ele ma le mo, Ada mi uwu e yi moshi awu gba a wu ŋɔ wu ma le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Mi so ŋɔ, Opita: ŋɔ kwu ɔzɔ, mu ɔzɔ ɔlɛ gba mii mbo ɔshɔshi mi le, onzu uwoyi ba e do wu ishirimo mo. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Imi mii shi ŋɔ anu iyi Irɛsu iyoshi. Kiya ingyinangyina ingyi ŋɔ towo ngyi mo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ, o towo ngyi mo tete moshi; kiya ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ nyama laa ngyi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ, moshi ba ɔɔ nyama laa ngyi tete.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Akwɛyi e yi Wavɔngɔkiya wu mu alu tee lo so onzonzu ɛnyi tee uwu gba akwu Okrasi le mo.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi E Kwu Epa Iyi Inyashi Wu Mbala Lukwu Wu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Omaki 8.31—9.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Oluku 9.22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Te i na mɔnu mawu Ɔzhizɔsi e le mu Wavɔngɔkiya wu isomo gedegede tee, &lt;&lt;Mega mi re mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ akwɛyi mi ma inyashi gyɔɔ mu ewo iyi enzu umbakɔ, mbala ebwoshi umbakɔ, mbala wa zɔ ɛrama iyi Omosis. O ngbɛ mi ma, ba ɔnu uwu kwɔfyi ungwola Ukpo aa gba mi laa iyimo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Opita e to wu a ka wu mɛmba akwɛyi e towumo. A za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ukpo le so yi mo, ɛlɛ i du ŋɔ mo ndii, Ɔkwu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Ɔzhizɔsi e gele eyi e yese Opita akwɛyi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Fyama kaa shemi kize, Osheta! Ŋɔ kwu kwokyi ungwu ɛfyi ilama; moo egbo ŋɔ ɛlɛ i ngyi mbaa Ukpo mo, akwiyi onzu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za la Wavɔngɔkiya wu tee, &lt;&lt;Gba onzu a gyi tee la mbwalu mi, mega a zɔ kwu zɔ ungwu ɛnwu wu, akwɛyi e to kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu wu kaa la mbwalu mi. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Moo onzu uwunawuna uwu a gyi tee la sa kwunyɔ wu ma, kwuu tomo; onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ kwunyɔ wu kwu tomo kwuwo mi, aa fya ngwu ma. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Kimbe ba akwu kule ungwu onzu uwu a fya mu kwudu kwɔlɛ ma lɛɛbi akwɛyi kwunyɔ wu ba kwu tomo? Kiya kinyinyi mo! Naa kimbe ba onzu a ra ngyi a ŋanga mbala kwunyɔ wu? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Moo Umɛ uwu Onzu a nyɔ mbala alɔgbulɔ wu mu inzumbɛku iyi Ete wu, akwɛyi ee shi uwewe rigbɛ kyakya mbala ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ e wo. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Mi so yi ongbulolo tee, umbafo o yi munɛ o ma lukwu dɛ ishi o ma Umɛ uwu Onzu a nyɔ mu irɛsu wu mo.<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi A vindɔma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Omaki 9.2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Oluku 9.28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Mizhikembo iyi afyi ɛrɛnyi akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e to Opita, Ozhemisi mbala Ɔzhɔnu umanyiwu Ozhemisi, akwɛyi a ka mba mu kadu unga lowa o ka o ko ŋɔma mɔmɔ kɛɛkyi mba. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Tabɔkɔ o yi mɔmɔ akwɛyi o ma Ɔzhizɔsi tee a vindɔma: ureyi wu u lemo kyamate ɔnu tayi, ekpayi iyi ɛnwu wu ba akwu iruwu puratata. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Akwɛyi o ma Omosisi mbala Elazha o yi mu iso isomo mbala Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Opita a za la Ɔzhizɔsi tee, &lt;&lt;Ee Ɔkwu, ishoshi bɔkɔ ki yi munɛ le! Gba i she ŋɔ woshi, mi la ɛnu ɛla munɛ, kwukpɛnyi akwu ungwaŋa, ungufo akwu ungwu Omosis, ungufo ba akwu ungwu Elazha.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Tabɔkɔ e degbo mu iso ɛnyi isomo bɛnɛ akwɛyi kwɔmu kwu lemo kwu kpo mamba akwɛyi opwu u wɔ mu kwɔmu tee, &lt;&lt;Ele akwu Umɛ mi, uwu mi pwu idɛnyi wu; uwu mi mu ɔnyɛ wu. La lu pwa iso wu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Kwuye ungwu Wavɔngɔkiya o pwa ɛlɛ, iyi i wo mbomo akwɛyi o kpo eyi mɛzhi. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e bo a pwu mba afyi. A za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La lu yimo.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;La lu riyi mo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Kwuye ungwu o yi eyefaa, o ma onzu ukpukpɛnyi fo, Ɔzhizɔsi kɛɛkyi gba o ma le.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Tabɔkɔ o yi mu ikalama mu lɔwa, Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt; La lu so onzu ɛnyɛnyi kiya ingyi lu ma le mo, nzhii ba Umɛ uwu onzu o yi wu mo mu lukwu dɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu o yo wu tee, &lt;&lt;I wo te ba wa zɔ ɛrama iyi Omosis o zɔ tee Elazha e to keyi la Okrasi mɛga?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ee, Elazha a nyɔ keyi laa Okrasi mega kaa la nɔngɔ kiya ingyinangyina ma dɛ. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Imi ba mi za yi tee Elazha e bo-o enzu ba o zɔngɔ wu ma mo, o wo kiya ingyi bɔkɔ umba o gyi. Tatayi Umɛ uwu onzu a ma wɔnu mu ewo mbo tete.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu o zɔngɔma tee iso iyi e so ele akwu meka iyi Ɔzhɔnu u wo obatisima.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi E Bo Umɛshɛri Uwu E Yi Kwundu Ungwura Ofya Ma.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Omaki 9.14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43a">Oluku 9.37-43a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Kwuye ungwu o bo mbaa riba ingyi enzu, onzu uwufo e bo mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi e kwu mo mu idu wu, <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, shɔɔkɔ ma eyembembyi iyi umɛ mi nɛ! Kwuwongwu e yi ofya umbu ookpo, e yi mu inyashi imama gyɔɔ, mbafo u to wu u ta mɔyi mbafo ba u to wu u ta mu embyi. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Mi to wu mi kaa laa Wavɔngɔkiya ŋa, umba ba o do wu ofya ibomo mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba opwu a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Lunyi enzu umba ɔyi uwura bɔkɔ o yi ikwu idu lu fulo mo mbɔlɛ! Mi ŋɔ mbala yi nzhii ba kwuyengwuna dɛ? Mi yi idu mbala yi nzhii ba kwuyengwuna dɛ? La lu ka mi laa umɛ awu munɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a kpa kwundu ungwura kwɔngu ɛyi akwɛyi kwu wɔma mu umɛ awu akwɛyi ofya wu u bomo mu kwotata kwɔngu.<verse eid="MAT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Wa vɔngɔ kiya o bo o du Ɔzhizɔsi mɛmba, akwɛyi o yo wu tee, &lt;&lt;I wo te bɔkɔ kinzu ki fa la kwundu ungwura kwɔngu irama?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />A gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Akwu kwuwongu lu yi ikwu idu fulo gyɔɔ mo le.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ongbulolo gba mi so yi le tee, gba lu yi ikwu idu fulo kɛkyi mate kwuyi ungwu omusita te lala, lu za la lɔwa ndɔlɛ tee, &lt;Turumo munɛ kaa so tayi!&gt; ba lu turumo. Kiya ingyinangyina ki ga yi iwomo mo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />Ɛndu iyira ɛlɛ te i wɔ kwudu byi mo, ii kyo Ukpo ilɛma mbala kenyo dɛ.<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi E Siso Iyi Lukwu Wu Kpɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Omaki 9.30 - 32; Luke 9.43b - 45)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Kwuye ungwu o kpala ɛlu mu Ogalili akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za laa Wavɔngɔkiya tee, &lt;&lt;O to Umɛ uwu Onzu o yama laa agewa wu.<verse eid="MAT 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />akwɛyi o ngbɛ wu ma; ɔnu uwu kwɔfyi ungwola ba o yi wu mo la kwunyɔ.&gt;&gt; Egbo iyi Wavɔngɔkiya i tutumo iiyɛkɔkɔ.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oba Uwɛzhi Uwu Ɔtɛpu Ishimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />kwuye ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu o fye mu Okapanawu, wa na oba uwɛzhi uwu ɔtɛpu o bo mbaa Opita akwɛyi o yo wu tee, &lt;&lt;U zɔ kiya yi e shi oba uwɛzhi uwu ɔtɛpu mo re?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Opita a gba mba opwu tee,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:25">&lt;&lt;Ee, e shi.&gt;&gt; Kwuye ungwu Opita e fye mogba, Ɔzhizɔsi gba e siso keyi le, e yo wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔsamɔni, ŋɔ ma te?&gt;&gt; Mbaa enzu umbana bɔkɔ asu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ o na eduwo iyi ifyemo mbala oba uwɛzhi? Mbaa ɛmɛ umba ɛzhi naa mbaa agboga ŋa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Opita a gba opwu tee,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:26">&lt;&lt;Mbaa agboga.&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;de ba ɛlɛ i zɔ te ɛmɛ umbu ɛzhi o lu mba ma. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Kwuwongwu kaa lo wo amba mbala nzu mo, so mu risu kaa ta ɛnyɔ ŋɔ. Umu uwu kwonze bɔkɔ ŋɔ yi, ya wu kenzu mo akwɛyi ŋɔ ma eduwo mɛmi, to yi mo kaa ka mba kaa lakwu oba uwɛzhi nzu.<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s">Uwe Bɔkɔ A Kale Mu Irɛsu Iyi Oshi?</para>
  <para style="r">(Omaki 9.33 - 37; Oluku 9.46 - 48)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Mu kwuye kwɔngwu Wavɔngɔkiya o bo mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi o yo wu tee, &lt;&lt;Uwe ba a ka mu Irɛsu iyi oshi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a ya umɛshɛri ma e shi wu a rima mu keyi mba, <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Ongbulolo gba mi so yi le tee, gba lu kwu ira ɔsu kaa lu yi mate ɛmɛshɛri mo, lu fye mu Irɛsu iyi oshi gbee mo. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e bo laa ɛnwu wu mɛzhi mate umɛshɛri ele, uwu gba a ka le mu Irɛsu iyi oshi. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />&lt;&lt;Tatayi onzu uwunawuna uwu a na umɛshɛri ma kyamate ele a kpa mu idu kwuwongu ɛnyi mi, Imi gba a na mi le.<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apula Iyi I Bo Laa Itama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Omaki 9.42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1">Oluku 17.1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:2">2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />&lt;&lt;Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e shi umɛshɛri ukpɛnyi meka iyi mbɔlɛ umba bɔkɔ o kwu idu lu fulo ma mi a tama, i ka wu woshi tee lo ma wu riko ingyɛkwu mu kɔrɔ kaa lo ta wu mu risu kaa embyi lo riwu mo. <verse eid="MAT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />&lt;&lt;Inyashi akwu iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ kwuwongu apula iyi ii shi enzu o la ɛfyi! Apula iyi ii shi enzu o la ɛfi i nyɔ mega, inyashi ba akwu iyi onzu uwu bɔkɔ i zɛ ma wu!<verse eid="MAT 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />&lt;&lt;Gba kwuwo ŋɔ nana kwɔlɛ ŋɔ kwuu shi ŋɔ kaa ngbomo, kpolo ngwu mo kaa tama. I fye mu kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ laa kwuwo kwukpɛnyi nana kwɔlɛ kwukpɛnyi i koshi laa iyi bɔkɔ oo ta ŋa mu kwoba ungwu ɔyi ungwu ɔkpɔɔ laa alɛ epo nana ewo epo. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Tatayi gba kwuyi ŋɔ kwuu shi ŋɔ kaa ngbomo, wala ngwu ma kaa tama. I fye mu kwunyɔ ungwu ɔkpɔ laa kwuyi kwukpɛnyi i koshi laa iyi bɔkɔ oo ta ŋa mu kwoba ungwu ɔyi ungwu ɔkpɔɔ laa eyi epo.<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwoba Ungwu Ilɔ Umba O Tomo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Oluku 15.3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />&lt;&lt;La lu ngbɛndu kaa la lu zhi ukpɛnyi meka iyi ɛmɛshɛri mbɔlɛ ma mo. Moo mi so yi ele, alɔgbulɔ mba moshi o koko ma eyi iyi Adami moshi. <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />Umɛ uwu Onzu e bo te la sa enzu ma lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o tomo.<verse eid="MAT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />&lt;&lt;I yi te mu eyi yi? Gba onzu e yi ilɔ oderi akwɛyi ukpɛnyi e tomo onzu awu a lafya laa uwekperendo la werendo mbamba kaa laa gagyi uwu e tomo awu moo? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Gba e fye wu mo, ongbulolo gba mi so yi le, ɔnyɛ wu a ka uwu wekperendo la werendo umba bɔkɔ o tomo mo awu ma. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Tatayi gba i yi le, Ete yi uwu e yi moshi awu aa nyama tee umɛshɛri ukpɛnyi kaa le tomo mo.<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Onzu Uwu E Ngbo Umanyiwu Ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />&lt;&lt;Gba umɛnɛ ŋɔ e ngbo ŋɔ mo so kaa zɔ wu ingbomo iyi e ngbo ŋɔ awu lunyi wepo. Gba e shi alu mu iso ŋɔ, de ba ŋɔ gba wu ŋɔ bo mu ɔgwuzɛ sawu. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Gba ba a pwa iso ŋɔ mo, gagyi onzu ɛnyi nana enzu wepo ka kyo mbala ɛŋɔ, &lt;moo izɔgɔ iyi enzu wepo nana enzu wala i shi iso iyinayina i rima shɛ.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Gba e to iso mbo mo, ka yi laa ɔshɔshi. Gba ɔshɔshi lala a pwa mba mo, yese wu mate u byi eshi naa onzu uwu e yi Ukpo mo tayi.<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />Ongbulolo gba mi so yi le tee: kiya ingyinangyina ingyi lu towo ngyimo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ o towo ngyi mo moshi tete, tatayi kiya ingyinangyina ingyi lu nyama la ngyi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ o nyama la ngyi tete moshi.<verse eid="MAT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />Mi gba mi so yi kpɔ tee: gba lunyi wepo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ lu nyama la kiya ingyinangyina ingyi lu nda, Ada mi uwoshi e wo yi ngyi mo. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />&lt;&lt;Moo munamuna mbaa bɔkɔ enzu wepo nana wala o kpala ɛlu mu ɛnyi mi, mi yi mbala mba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwoba Ungwu Umɛgba Uwu A Gbayi A Kpa Mo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Akwɛyi Opita e bo mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi akwɛyi e yo wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, izhɛvɔ ba mi-i gba la ingbomo mi-i kpa laa umɛnɛ mi uwu e ngbo mi mo? Izherewo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu tee &lt;&lt;Akwu izherewo mo, akwu uwekperewo izhi erewo. <verse eid="MAT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />&lt;&lt;Kwuwo kwɔlɛ Irɛsu iyi oshi i yi mate ɔsu ukpɛnyi uwu bɔkɔ a gyi te la ta amasa iyi eduwo wu mbala ɛmɛgba wu tayi. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ ɔsu awu e gwo laa iyesemo, akwɛyi o ka wu laa onzu uwu a ra wu laa kwɔkpa ungwu eduwo edinari ɛmiliyɔ guruguru. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Kwuwongwu e yi ɔgwuzɛ uwu iwama mo, ada kwogba wu e shi kaza tee, uwu ikyo oko wu, ɛmɛ wu mbala kiya ingyi e yi ngyi lɛɛbi lo ya ngyi ma kaa lo wa kwɔkpa kwɔngwu ma. s <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Umɛgba awu a la epunu mɛzhi mu idu iyi ada kwogba wu a kpa wu ɛshɛku, a za wu tee, &lt;Shɔɔkɔ yi idu mbala mi, &lt;moo mi wa ŋa kwɔkpa ŋa ma ndii!&gt; <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Ada kwogba wu a ma eyembembyi wu, akwɛyi a gba laa kwɔkpa kwɔngu a kpa wu akwɛyi a lu wu afyima.<verse eid="MAT 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />Tabɔkɔ umɛgba awu a wɔ kwudu, akwɛyi a ma umɛgba uwufo uwu akwu umɛgba kyamate uwu tete uwu e kwola kwɔkpa wu ugu eduwo edinari oderi. E yi wu mu ɔriga akwɛyi a gɔ wu ma a za wu tee, &lt;Wa mi kwɔkpa mi ma!&gt; <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Umɛgba umanyi wu awu a la epunu le mɛzhi a kpa wu ɛshɛku a za wu tee, &lt;Shɔɔkɔ yi idu mbala mi, moo mi wa ŋa kwɔkpa ŋa ma ndii!&gt; <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Onzu ele ba e tomo akwɛyi a ka ta wu mu ugu ugyi nzhii ba a wa wu kwɔkpa kwɔngu ma dɛ. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Kwuye ungwu ɛmɛgba umbafo mbamba o ma kiya ingyi ki wo, egbo mbo i tutumo iiyɛkɔkɔ akwɛyi o ko so ada kwogba mba iyi i wo lɛɛbi. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />&lt;&lt;Akwɛyi ada kwogba awu a lɔ la wu le bo, akwɛyi a za wu tee &lt;Uŋɔ umɛgba uwura ele, mi gba laa kwokpa ŋa lɛɛbi mi kpa ŋa kwuwongu ŋɔ kpa mi ɛshɛku. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Ishoshi tee ma eyembembyi iyi onzu uwopo ŋɔ kyamate bɔkɔ mi ma iyaŋa awu moo?&gt; <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Ada kwogba wu e wo amba gyɔɔ akwɛyi a ra wu e shi wa gbo ugu ugyi kaa lo lo wu inyashi nzhii ba a wa kwokpa kwɔngu ma dɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a mbwa yi tee, &lt;&lt;Tatayi gba Ada mi uwu e yi moshi awu e wo mbala yi le tete, gba onzu a gba laa ingbomo iyi umanyiwu a kpa wu mu egbo lɛɛbi mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s">Ɛzɔ Mɛka Iyi Ilafya Laa Oko</para>
  <para style="r">(Omaki 10.1 - 12)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Kwuye ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi a mbwa iso ɛlɛ isomo akwɛyi a lafya laa Ogalili a ka mu kuko ungwu Ozhudiya mu ɛsɛnyi iyi ɔkwu uwu Ozhoda. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Riba ingyi enzu o mbwalu wu mɔmɔ akwɛyi e bo mbo efya ma.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Afarisi umbafo o bo te lo pwa wu ma akwɛyi o yo wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɛrama nzu i nyama kaa onzu la ra laa oko wu ma kwuwongu kiya ingyinangyina bɔkɔ e wo ɔnuwu ba a gyi moo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Lu wa mu kwokpo ungwu Ukpo mo re tee mu igwumo Ukpo e wo mbo oko mbala ɔnzɔnu? <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />Akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ ɔnzɔnu a lafya laa ete wu mbala anyi wu kaa le to oko uwawu akwɛyi umba wepo oo yi kyamate onzu ukpɛnyi tayi&gt; <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ umba o yi wepo fo, o kwu ukpɛnyi ŋa. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, kiya ingyi Ukpo e kyo ngyi mesu onzu laa ka ngyi ma mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Akwɛyi Afarisi o yo wu tee &lt;&lt;Ba i zɛ te bɔkɔ Omosisi a ta ɔkpa tee onzu le shi oko wu kwupwu ungwu ikama kaa la rawu ma?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Omosisi a nya yi ma kaa onzu la ra la oko wu ma kwuwongu egbo yi i kɔma. I yi tayi mu igwumo mo. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Imi ba mi za yi tee onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a ra laa oko ma, ba akwu kwuwongu kaya itomo mo, akwɛyi e to oko awa, e yi mu kaya itomo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu o za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Gba iso iyi ɔnu mbala oko i yi te, de ba i to oko mo i koshi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;Akwu onzu uwunawuna gba aa nyama laa iso ɛlɛ le mo, enzu umba Ukpo e shi mbo kɛɛkyi. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Moo eyi i yi ikikɔ ikikɔ iyi bɔkɔ i shi umbafo o to oko mo: umbafo o mba mba inozhi; umbafo ba enzu gba o wo mbo; umbafo o towo oko itomo kwuwongu Irɛsu iyi oshi. Onzu uwu e do ɛzɔ ɛlɛ inama ba laa na yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi A Ta Ɛmɛshɛri Mbɛri Kenzu Ungeshi.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Omaki 10.13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Oluku 18.15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Akwɛyi enzu umbafo o bo laa ɛmɛshɛri mberi mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi kaa le fulo mbo ewo kaa la lɛmba Ukpo. Wa vɔngɔ kiya ba o kpa umba bɔkɔ o bo mbo awu ɛyi. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee &lt;&lt;La lu shi ɛmɛshɛri lo bo mbaa mi, la lu nyi mba ma mo, moo Irɛsu iyi oshi akwiyi mbɔlɛ te.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Akwɛyi e fulo mbo ewo mu reshi, a akwɛyi a ka ma iyawu.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulugbaga Uwu E Yi Kwuwo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Omaki 10.17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Oluku 18.18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Ɔnu uwufo ɔnzɔnu uwufo e bo mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi akwɛyi e yo wu tee,&lt;&lt; U zɔ kiya, kiya ingyesheshi ingyina ba mi wo mega kaa la mi fya kwunyɔ ungwu ɔkpɔɔ ma?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Ɔzhizɔsi e yo wu tee, &lt;&lt;Kwuwongwu mbe bɔkɔ ŋɔ yo mi kwuyo meka iyi kiya ingyesheshi?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Onzu ukpɛnyi kɛɛkyi gba e sheshi le. Gba ŋɔ gyi tee kaa fya kwunyɔ ungwu ɔkpɔɔ de ba mbwalu ɛrama iyi Ukpo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Akwɛyi Onzu awu e yo Ɔzhizɔsi tee, &lt;&lt;Ɛrama iyina?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 19:18">Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ki ngbɛ onzu mo; ki to kaya mo; ki wu ɛlɔ mo; ki na izɔgɔ iyi iso iyira mo; <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />lo ada ŋa ma mbala ɛnɛ ŋɔ; pwu idɛnyi iyi onzu uwu a nɔ a kpa ŋa te ɛŋɔ tayi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Akwɛyi Ulugbaga awu a gba opwu tee &lt;&lt;Ɛlɛ lɛɛbi mi wo yi-e. &lt;&lt;Kimbe ba ki shimo kpɔɔ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Gba ŋɔ gyi tee kaa wo iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a gyi, so kaa ya apula ŋa ma lɛɛbi kaa shi ayirewa eduwo enyi, akwɛyi ŋɔ yi kiya ingyi kwuwo moshi dɛ kaa bo kaa mbwalu mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Kwuye ungwu Ulugbaga awa a pwa iso ɛlɛ, a ka ma laa egbo itutumo kwuwongu e yi kiya ingyi kwuwo gyɔɔ.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za laa Wavɔngɔkiya wu tee, &lt;&lt; Mi so yi ongbulolo: i kɔma kaa onzu uwu e yi kiya ingyi kwuwo le fye mu Irɛsu iyi oshi. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Mi gba mi so yi kpɔ tee: i yi fulele i shi Onyakurumi kaa le fye mu ɔtu uwu keyi i ka onzu uwu e yi kiya ingyi kwuwo le fye mu Irɛsu iyi oshi mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Kwuye ungwu Wavɔngɔkiya o pwa ɛlɛ, i shi mbo kenzu iyama gyɔɔ akwɛyi o yo tee, &lt;&lt;Uwe ba aa fya isama fo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Ɔzhizɔsi e yese mbo akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ɛlɛ i womo mbaa uwu onzu mo, mbaa Ukpo ba kiya ingyinangyina kii wo mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Akwɛyi Opita e to koro. A za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Yese,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;ki lafya laa kiya ingyinangyina kaa la ki mbwalu ŋɔ! Kimbe ba akwu ogbo nzu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ongbulolo gba mi so yi le tee, lunyi umba lu mbwalu mi ele, mu kwudu kwɔlɛ ungwu epo , kwuyengwu Umɛ uwu Onzu aa ŋɔma mu ukpa uwu inzumbɛku wu, lunyi tete luu ŋɔma mu ikpa iyɛsu uwo la epo mu ombu uwu lunzu luwo laa lopo iyi Izirɛ izɔma. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a lafya laa agba wu, naa ɛmanyi wu anzɔnu naa ɛmanyi wu eko, ete wu naa anyi wu naa ɛmɛ wu naa ɛzhi iyi utu wu, kwuwo mi, aa na iyi i ka ɛlɛ ma izhi oderi, a gba e ri ogu uwu kwunyɔ ungwu ɔkpɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Enzu gyɔɔ umba o to keyi kekelele o gba akwu umba kembo, umbafo gyɔɔ bɔkɔ akwu umba kembo kekelele ba a gba akwu umba keyi ŋa.<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s">Kwɔba Ungwu Enzu Umba Ɛduma Iyi Eduwo Mu Utu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a zɔ te, &lt;&lt; Irɛsu iyi oshi i yi mate ɔkwu uwu utu uwu a kyiwɔma mu kwoto kaa le to enzu lo wo wu ɛduma mu utu. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />A nyama tee e shi onzonzu eduwo osiliva ukpɛnyi mu kwɔfyi kwukpɛnyi, akwɛyi a lɔ mba ɔ ka mu utu uwu ovanyi wu. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />&lt;&lt;Mu ekerefe erendo iyi kwoto, a wɔ kwudu kpɔ akwɛyi a ma enzu umbafo mu rishi o yi mu kiya kyinyinyi iwomo mo. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Akwɛyi a za mba tee &lt;Lunyi tete la lu so lu wo mi ɛduma mu utu, akwɛyi mi-i shi yi rigbɛ, kyakya laa ɛduma iyi lu wo.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Akwɛyi o ka. &lt;&lt;A gba a wɔ kwudu kpɔ mu ekerefe uwo laa epo iyi ɔnɔnda mbala ekerefe ɛla iyi onoyo akwɛyi e wo mate bɔkɔ e wo kwonze tayi. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Mu ekerefe ɛlɔ iyi onoyo a gba a wɔ kwudu akwɛyi e du enzu umbafo ɔ rima iya mba shaa. E yo mbo tee &lt;Lu ri iyi kwuwongumbe mune ngbaa mu kwoto ba lu yi mu kiya kinyinyi iwomo mo le?&gt; <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />O gba wu opwu tee &lt;&lt; &lt;Kidi fya onzu uwu e shi nzu ɛduma mo.&gt; Akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;Lunyi tete la lu so lu wo ɛduma mu utu mi.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />&lt;&lt;Mu onoyo, ɔkwu uwu utu a za la u to keyi uwu utu wu tee, &lt;Ya umba ɛduma ma kaa shi onzonzu rigbɛ wu, i gwu mu umba o to mbo mizhikembo i gba kadu.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />&lt;&lt; Enzu umba ɛduma umba o to mbo kembo mu ekerefe ɛlɔ iyi onoyo, onzonzu a na osiliva ukpɛnyi. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Enzu umba ɛduma umba o to mbo keyi awu, o bo, o fulo eyi tee rigbɛ mba ri ka le. Umba tete o na osiliva ukpɛnyi ukpɛnyi. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Tabɔkɔ o na yi ma, o kwo mu kwuzhini ikpomo, <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />O zɔ tee, &lt;Enzu mbɔlɛ umba o to mbo kembo le o wo ɛduma iyi awa ikpɛnyi bi,&gt; &lt;ba ŋɔ shi mbo kyakya mbala kinzu umba ki wo ɛduma ngbaa mu kwoto ba ɔnu u la nzu ma te le!&gt; <verse eid="MAT 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />&lt;&lt;Akwɛyi a gba ukpɛnyi mba opwu, a za wu tee, &lt; Umɛza mi, mi wo ŋɔ iwiwomo mo. Ki nyama kyaa tee ŋɔ na osiliva ukpɛnyi mo re? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Na rigbɛ ŋɔ ka sheyimo. Mi gyi tee mi shi onzu uwu o to wu kembo le kyakya mbala iyi mi shi ŋɔ. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Nana mi do te mi wo ingyi mi gyi mu eduwo mi mo ŋa? Nana ŋɔ wo rise mi kwuwongu mi shi ari le ŋa?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a mbwa yi tee &lt;&lt;Kwuwo kwɔngwu enzu umba o mbwa kembo akwu wa to keyi, enzu wa to keyi ba akwu wa mbwa kembo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi A Gba E Siso Iyi Lukwu Wu Kpɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Omaki 10.17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Oluku 18.18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Kwuye ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi e sheye mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ, a ya Wavɔngɔkiya wu wewo la wepo ma mu ɛmba akwɛyi a za mba tee, <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />&lt;&lt;La lu pwa,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;tabɔkɔ ki sheye mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ le, Umɛ uwu onzu o-oo ra wu o-oo shi ebwoshi umbakɔ mbala wa zɔ ɛrama iyi Ukpo. O-oo fu ombu uwu lukwu o lo wu <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />akwɛyi o ra wu o shi enzu umba akwu azhu mo, o-oo wo wu ɛnɛ, o kpa wu ikpa akwɛyi o-oo kpa wu mu kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu. Ɔnuwu kwɔfyi ungwola ba o-oo gba wa laa iyimo la kwunyɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">????? Kwoya Ungwu Ɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Mark 10.35-45)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Akwɛyi anyi wu ɛmɛ umba Ɔzɛbɛdi e bo mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi mbala ɛmɛ wu wepo, e kwumo mu idu wu, akwɛyi a nda wu kwɔya.<verse eid="MAT 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Ɔzhizɔsi e yo wu tee &lt;&lt;Kimbe bɔ ŋɔ gyi?&gt;&gt;.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:21">Akwɛyi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Shɔkɔ nyama kaa ɛmɛ mi wepo mbɔlɛ, ukpɛnyi la ŋɔ mu kwuwo ungwu ungyi ŋɔ uwufo ba la ŋɔ mu kwuwo ungwu ɔzu ŋɔ kwuye ungwu ŋɔ bi kwu ɔsu awu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a gba opwu laa ɛmɛ mbamba a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Lu yitu iyi kiya ingyi lu yi mu indama mo.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Lu do te lu wo ago iyi inyashi iyi mi ŋi wo le?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:22">O gba wu opwu tee &lt;&lt;Ee ki do iwomo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee &lt;&lt;Ee lu do te lu wo ago mi iyi inyashi iyi mi ŋi wo bi, iŋɔma mu ungyi mi mbala ɔzu mi ba mi shi le mo. Riyi ngyɛlɛ akwu ingyi bɔkɔ Ada mi a nɔngɔ laa enzu umba wa ŋa le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Tabɔkɔ Wavɔngɔkiya wewo umba o shimo awu o pwa iso ɛlɛ, o wo amba gyɔɔ mbala ɛmɛnɛ wepo mbamba. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a ya mba ma lɛɛbi akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Lu yitu tee asu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ o lo enzu mba inyashi, enzu umbakwu mba ba o zɔ mba idomo. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />I yi tayi mbala yi mo. Onzu uwu a gyi tee lakwu onzu uwakwu mekeka yi de ba mɛga lakwu umɛgba yi, <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />onzu uwu a gyi te lakwu uwu kwonze mekeka yi de ba mɛga lakwu unye yi - <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />kyamate Umɛ uwu Onzu uwu e bo tee lo gbo wu rinye mo, uwu gba e gbo rinye laa enzu le kaa le shi kwunyɔ wu kaa lakwu sa enzu gyɔɔ ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi E Bo Epeyi Wepo Ɔfya Ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Omaki 10.46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Oluku 18.35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />kwuye ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu o lafya laa Ozheriko, riba ingyi enzu ri mbwalu mba. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Epeyi wepo umba ɔ ŋɔ mu kenzu unga ɔgwuzɛ, ɔ pwa tee Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu ikakama, akwɛyi o ta opwu kpaa mu iyama tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, Umɛ uwu Odevidi, shɔɔkɔ ma eyembembyi nzu nɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Riba ingyi enzu ba ri kpa mba ɛyi tee lo kpala kenzu mo. Umba ba o kyakpɔ mu iyama mu opwu uwɔkwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, Umɛ uwu Odevidi, shɔɔkɔ ma eyembembyi nzu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a rima, a ya mba ma akwɛyi e yo mbo tee &lt;&lt; Kimbe ba lu gyi te la mi wo yi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />O gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;ki gyi tee la ki gba laa ɛbɛ imama!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Ɔzhizɔsi a ma eyembembyi mbo akwɛyi a pwu mba afyi mu eyi. Mɔmɔɔmɔ, eyi mbo i wuma, o kwo mu ɛbɛ imama akwɛyi o mbwalu wu.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi E Fye Mu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Omaki 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Oluku 19.28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Ɔzhɔnu 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Kwuye ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu o nda laa Ɔzhɛrusalɛ fo, o bo mu kwuse ungwu Obetafage mu Lɔwa undu Olifu, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a lɔ Wavɔngɔkiya wu wepo ma. <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />A za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La lu so mu kwuse ungwu keyi kwɔngu akwɛyi lu ma ɔzɛki o mawu ma mbala umɛ wu mɔmɔ. La lu vuvu mba ma kaa la lu ka mi. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Gba onzu e so yi iso, la lu za wu tee Ɔkwu e yi ugɔ mba. A ngbɛ kwuye mo a lɔ mba ɔ nya mba efyefya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Ɛlɛ i wo te ka li nyɔlɔ iso iyi anukenzu e so tee:<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />&lt;&lt;La lu za la kwuse ungwu Ɔzayɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">&lt;Yese, ɔsu yi e yi mu inyɔma munyi yi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">E to ɛwu tee wakwu kiya kinyinyi mo, a zɛ mu ɔzɛki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">ɔzɛki uwu bɔkɔ o do ya mawu dɛ mo.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu ɔ ka o wo iyi bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a lɔ mba tee lo wo. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />O bo la ɔzɛki mbala umɛ wu, o fulo ekpayi mba mu ɔzɛki awu akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a ŋɔ ma yi. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Enzu guruguru umba ɔ mbwalu wu o fu ekpayi mba mɛzhi, umbafo o kpolo ende iyi ɛwɛyi o fu mu ɔgwuzɛ. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Riba ingyi enzu umba o yi mu keyi mbala umba bɔkɔ o yi mizhikembo o le wu mu ɛnyi itomo mu opwu uwɔkwu, ɔ zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Osana la Umɛ uwu Odevidi!&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Esheshi akwiyi onzu uwu e yi mu inyɔma mu ɛnyi iyi Ɔkwu! Ukpo lɔ duwuma!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Kwuse ungwu Ɔzhɛrusalɛ ku fulowa kwuye ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi e fye mangwu. Kwuwongwu ɛlɛ, umbafo o yo tee, &lt;&lt;Ele akwu uwe te?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Riba ingyi enzu umba ɔ mbwalu wu ɔ gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ele akwu Ɔzhizɔsi, anukenzu uwu a wɔ mu ɛzhi iyi Onazareti uwu Ɔgalili.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi A Ka Mu Ɔtɛpu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Omaki 11.15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Oluku 19.45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Ɔzhɔnu 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e fye mu ɔtɛpu akwɛyi a ra laa enzu lɛɛbi ma umba o yi mu rishi iyama mɔmɔ. Eteburu iyi wa ŋanga eduwo mbala abɛ iyi iŋɔma iyi enzu wa ya atatabiri ma e fulo ye mbwe, <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />akwɛyi za mba tee, &lt;&lt; Ɔ ka yi ma mu kwokpo ungwu Ukpo tee, &lt;Ɔtɛpu mi o ya wu tee kwogba ungwu Ukpo ilɛma.&gt; Ɔbulɛ lunyi lu wo ungwu kwogba ungwu awɛlɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Epeyi mbala umba kinyɛ o bo munyi wu mu ɔtɛpu akwɛyi e bo mbo efya ma. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Tabɔkɔ ebwoshi umbakɔ mbala wazɔ ɛrama iyi Ukpo ɔ ma apula iyi izele iyi bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu iwomo, ikyo mbala uzhi duruduru uwu ɛmɛshɛri o wo mu ɔtɛpu o zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Osana akwiyi Umɛ uwu Odevidi,&gt;&gt; akwɛyi o le mu amba iwomo.<verse eid="MAT 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Akwɛyi o yo Ɔzhizɔsi tee, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ pwa iso iyi ɛmɛshɛri mbɔlɛ o yi mu isomo?&gt;&gt; Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ee mi pwa, lu du wa yi dɛ mo re mu kwokpo ungwu Ukpo tee? &lt;Ŋɔ zɔ ɛmɛshɛri mbala ɛmɛ umba elu kaa lɔ duŋɔma?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a lumba afyima, a ka mu Ɔbɛtani, mɔmɔ gba a nama le.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhizɔsi A Ta Uwɛyi Uwu Oboriyo Kenzu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Omaki 11.12-14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Ɔzhizɔsi a wɔ mu kwoto mu kwoto a gba e sheye mu kwuse, lonzu ba lu wo wu mo. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />A ma uwɛyi uwu oboriyo mu kenzu unga ɔgwuzɛ akwɛyi a ka mba wu. E du epwepu bi moo u muma mo. Akwɛyi a za laa uwɛyi ɔnwu tee &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ muma gbee fo!&gt;&gt; Mɔmɔɔmɔ uwɛyi ɔnwu u shirima.<verse eid="MAT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Tabɔkɔ Wavɔngɔkiya o ma ɛlɛ izele i yi mbo mo akwɛyi o yo tee, &lt;&lt;I wo la bɔkɔ uwɛyi uwu oboriyo ɔlɛ u shirima efyefya te?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee &lt;&lt;Mi so yi ongbulolo, gba lu yi ikwu idu lu fulo akwɛyi lu yi egbo epo mo, lu do tee lu wo iyi bɔkɔ mi wo uwɛyi uwu oboriyo ɔlɛ. Akwu iyi i wo uwɛyi uwu oboriyo le kɛɛkyi mo, lu do te luu za laa lɔwa kwɔlɛ tee, &lt;Yimo, so kaa ta mu risu,&gt; ba ii wo tayi. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Gba lu kwu idu lu fulo mu Ukpo, kiya ingyinangyina ingyi lu nda wu, lu fya ngyi ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">O Yo Ɔzhizɔsi Kwuyo Tee Uwe E Shi Wu Ekpasu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Omaki 11.27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Oluku 20.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gbama e fye mu ɔtɛpu akwɛyi kwuye ungwu e yi mu enzu ɛzu izɔma, ebwoshi umbakɔ mbala enzu umbakɔ umba kwuse o bo o du wu. Akwɛyi o yo wu tee, &lt;&lt;Mu idomo iyi uwe ba ŋɔ wo apula ɛlɛ?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt; Uwe e shi ŋɔ idomo ɛlɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee &lt;&lt;Imi tete mi yo yi kwuyo kwukpɛnyi, gba lu gba mi opwu, Imi tete mi so yi mbaa mi fya idomo iyi apula ɛlɛ iwomo: <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Idomo iyi obatisima iwomo iyi Ɔzhɔnu i ngyi mu na: i ngyi mbaa Ukpo naa i ngyi mbaa enzu ŋa?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Akwɛyi o le mu amasa itama mbala esu tee, &lt;&lt;Inyete ki zɔ te? Gba ki zɔ tee &lt;I ngyi mbaa Ukpo,&gt; e yo nzu tee &lt;Kimbe ki shi lu mbwalu iso iyi Ɔzhɔnu mo?&gt; <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Gba ba ki zɔ tee &lt;I ingyi mbaa enzu,&gt; ɛlɛ tete i lo nzu iyi moo enzu lɛɛbi ɔ nyama tee Ɔzhɔnu akwu anukenzu uwu Ukpo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Kwuwo kwɔngwu, ɔ gba Ɔzhizɔsi opwu tee, &lt;&lt; Ki yitu mo.&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;I mi tete mi zɔ yi mbaa mi fya idomo iyi apula ɛlɛ iwomo mo.<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwɔba Ungwu Ɛmɛ Anzɔnu Wepo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />Akwɛyi e yo ebwoshi umbakɔ mbala enzu umbakɔ tee &lt;&lt;Lunyi lu ma te mu kwoba ngwɔlɛ? Onzu uwufo e yi ɛmɛ anzɔnu wepo. A ka mbaa umɛ uwakɔ akwɛyi a za wu tee, &lt;Umɛ mi, ɔnɛ so kaa wo mi ɛduma mu utu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Umɛ awu a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;Ada mi ri mo,&gt; mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ a ŋanga egbo mo akwɛyi a ka biŋa. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Akwɛyi a gba a ka mbaa umɛ uwopo a ke so wu tete. Umɛ awu a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;Ada, mi ri,&gt; ba a ka mo.<verse eid="MAT 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />&lt;&lt;Mu ɛmɛ wepo mbɔlɛ uwe e wo kiya ingyi ete wu a gyi?&gt;&gt; Ɔ gba wu opwu tee &lt;&lt;Umɛ uwakɔ&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Mi so yi ongbulolo, wa na oba uwɛzhi mbala eko umba o to kaya o fye mu Irɛsu iyi Ukpo keyi la lunyi. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Moo Ɔzhɔnu e bo a zɔ yi ɔgwuzɛ uwu ototo, lu nyama laa iso wu mo. Wa na oba uwɛzhi mbala eko umba o to kaya ba o nyama laa iso wu. Tabɔkɔ lu ma ɛlɛ lala i fulo yi egbo mo kaa lu ta mɛzhi kaa lu mbwalu wu mo.<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwɔba Ungwu Asukpo Mu Utu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Omaki 11.27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Oluku 20.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />&lt;&lt;La lu ngbɛ alu mbaa kwoba ungufo: Onzu uwufo a gba utu uwu ɛwɛyi. A wɛ wu ma mu ɔbɛ, a vu kizɛ ingyi bɔkɔ o tu imuma iyi uwɛyi akwɛyi e mbo ugu uwu onzu uwu igbomo. Akwɛyi a ra la utu ɔwu e shi asukpo akwɛyi a ka luzɛ. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Kwuye ungwu ewiri ilɔma, a lɔ ɛmɛgba wu tee lo so mbaa asukpo mbamba kaa lo na ogbo wu lo ka wu. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />&lt;&lt;Asukpo mbamba o yi ɛmɛgba wu mbɔlɛ ma, o byi ukpɛnyi ɛmu, o ngbɛ uwufo mo, onzu uwɔla ba o to wu ekyi. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Ada uwu utu ɔwu a gba a lɔ ɛmɛgba umbafo kpɔ, o ka umba kwonze riba ma, asukpo o wo mbo kyamate o wo umba kwonze awu. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Imbwama yi akwɛyi a lɔ umɛ wu munyi mbo ŋa. A byi egbo tee, &lt;Enzu mbamba o lo umɛ mi ma.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />&lt;&lt; Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ asukpo mbamba o ma umɛ uwu ada uwu utu tee e yi mu inyɔma, akwɛyi o le mu esu isomo tee, &lt;Ele gba akwu u ri ogu wu le. Bo la ki ngbɛ wu ma kaa utu lu ŋa nzu!&gt; <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Akwɛyi o yi wu ɔ wawu ma mu utu ɔwu akwɛyi ɔ ngbɛ wu ma.<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yo tee, &lt;&lt;Kwuye ungwu ada uwu utu ɔwu a ba gbama awu ba e wo asukpo mbamba te?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />O gba wu opwu tee &lt;&lt;Enzu umbira mbamba a ngbɛ mba lukwu undura,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;akwɛyi a ra la utu ɔwu e shi enzu mbawa, umba o koko o ka wu laa ogbo wu kyaa kwuyengwu ewiri ilɔma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yo mbo tee, &lt;&lt; Lu du wa yi dɛ mo re mu kwokpo ungwu Ukpo tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">&lt;Kwokyi ungwu ola ungwu bɔkɔ wa mbo ugu o towo ngwu mo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">gba ku gba ku kwu ola uwu ugu le,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">ɛlɛ akwu iwomo iyi Ɔkwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">kinzu ba</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:42">a kwa nzu iyi kenzu iyama!&gt;<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />&lt;&lt;Kwuwo kwɔngu la mi so yi te oo na ɛsu irimo iyi oshi mu ewo yi ma, akwɛyi oo shi yi enzu umba o walaa imuma iyesheshi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Onzu uwu a ta mu kwokyi ngwɔlɛ, a muma kpɛrɛ kpɛrɛ, onzu uwu ba kwokyi ngwɔlɛ ku ta ma wu, a shɛkɛma pwutuu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 21:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Eboshi umbakɔ mbala Afarisi o pwa aba iyi Ɔzhizɔsi ɛlɛ, akwɛyi o dama tee iso ɛlɛ e so mbo. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Akwɛyi o gagyi ɔgwuzɛ tee lo yi wu mo, iyi ba i wo mbo mo kwuwongu riba ingyi enzu moo enzu o nyama tee Ɔzhizɔsi akwu anukenzu.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s1">Kwɔba ungwu Odumudumu Uwu Oko Itomo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Oluku 14.15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba e so mbo iso mu aba kpɔ. A zɔ tee, <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />&lt;&lt;Ɛsu iyi oshi i yi mate ɔsu uwu e wo odumudumu uwu oko itomo laa umɛ wu. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Akwɛyi ɔsu a lɔ ɛmɛgba wu te lo so lo fu enzu umba a lɔ la mba awu oga te lo bo odumudumu moo kwuye kwu wo-o, enzu mbamba ba o towo ibomo.<verse eid="MAT 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />A gba a lɔ ɛmɛgba umbafo kpɔ akwɛyi a za mba tee la lu so kaa lu za laa enzu umba o lɔ la mba tee: &lt;Kiya ingyinangyina ingyi odumudumu mi o mbwa-a; ɔgbɛbɛ uwu endo mbala endo uwakwu o ngbɛ mba-a, kiya ingyinangyina ki yi mu ɛzhi-e. La lu bo mbaa odumudumu uwu okopo biŋa!&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />&lt;&lt;Enzu umba ba ɔ lɔ la mba awu ba o wo iso ɛnyi raa, o towo ibomo - uwufo a ka mu utu iyawu, uwufo a ka mbaa rishiwu iwomo, <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />umba bɔkɔ o shimo awu ba o yi ɛmɛgba umba o lɔmba ma awu o byi mba ɛmu, akwɛyi ɔ ngbɛ mba ma. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Amba o wo ɔsu awu ma gyɔɔ akwɛyi a lɔ asozha wu ɔ ka mu kwuse ungwu enzu mbamba, o pwu ngwu mo akwɛyi o ngbɛ enzu umba o ngbɛ alɔgbulɔ umba ɔsu awu ma.<verse eid="MAT 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />&lt;&lt;Akwɛyi a za laa ɛmɛgba wu tee, &lt;Iyinayina iyi odumudumu ele o mbwa-a, enzu umba mi lɔ la mba awu o fa mo. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />La lu so mu akpulepo iyi ɛgwuzɛ, onzu uwunawuna uwu lu du wu la lu za wu tee le bo mbaa odumudumu.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Akwɛyi ɛmɛgba mbɔlɛ o fye mu ɛgwuzɛ o kpala enzu ɛlu guruguru umba bɔkɔ o fya, umbeshi mbala umbira lɛɛbi o bo. Kizɛ ingyi odumudumu awu ki nyɔlɔma kpakiri mbala agboga.<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />&lt;&lt;Kwuye ungwu ɔsu e fye mo te kaa laa ma agboga akwɛyi a ma onzu uwufo uwu e lo ekpayi iyi odumudumu awu mo. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Akwɛyi ɔsu e yo wu tee, &lt;Umɛza mi, ŋɔ wo la ŋɔ fye munɛ ba ŋɔ lo ekpayi iyi odumudumu ele mo?&gt; Onzu awu ba a fa la opwu igbama.<verse eid="MAT 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />&lt;&lt;Akwɛyi ɔsu a za la ɛmɛgba wu tee, &lt;La lu gbawakyi mu alɛ mbala ewo, kaa lo ta wu mu kwudu mu ipwu kaa la ma inyashi iyɛku mbala oga ilomo mbala ɛnyi ilamesu.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Ɔzhizɔsi a mbwa iso ɛlɛ isomo tee, o ya enzu gyɔɔ ma, umba o ŋa ba o yi bwɛ bi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwuyo Meka Iyi Ɔba Uwɛzhi Ishimo Laa Okesa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Omaki 12.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Oluku 20.20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Akwɛyi Afarisi o wɔ kwudu o ko ka amasa iyi ɔgwuzɛ uwu o wa wu kaa lo yi Ɔzhizɔsi mo mu iso wu. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />O lɔ Wavɔngɔkiya mba mbala Wambwalu Ɛrɔdu ma mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi. O za wu tee, &lt;&lt;U zɔ kiya,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ki yitu tee ŋɔ kwu onzu u so ongbulolo, ŋɔ zɔ enzu ɔgwuzɛ ongbulolo uwu Ukpo. Onzu e do ŋɔ egbo ingangama mo moo ŋɔ loshi laa onzu kwuwongu kwunzu ungwu e yi ngwu mo. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />So nzu imama iyaŋa, i sheshi tee lo shi oba uwɛzhi laa Osiza naa i sheshi mo ŋa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba e yitu iyi egbo mbo iyira awu akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Lunyi wamwangba mbɔlɛ! Kimbe ki shi lu gyi te la lu kpa mi kwuda? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />La lu zɔ mi eduwo iyi bɔkɔ lu shi oba uwɛzhi ma mayi awu.&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi o ka wu laa odinari kwukpɛnyi, <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />akwɛyi e yo mbo tee, &lt;&lt;Ureyi ɔlɛ mbala ɛnyi ɛlɛ akwiyi uwe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />O gba wu opwu tee &lt;&lt;Akwiyi Osiza.&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Ingyi akwu ingyi Osiza, lo shi ngyi Osiza, ingyi akwu ingyi Ukpo, lo shi ngyi Ukpo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Tabɔkɔ o pwa ɛlɛ, izele i yi mbo mo; akwɛyi ɔ lu wu afyima o kama iyamba.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwuyo Mɛka Iyi Iyimo Mu Kwuvɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Omaki 12.18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Oluku 20.27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Mu ɔnɔnungawu, Asadusi umbafo, umba zɔ tee iyimo mu lukwu i yi mo awu, o bo mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi la kwuyo. <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />O za wu tee, &lt;&lt;U zɔ kiya,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Omosisi a za nzu tee, gba ɔnumboko e kpomo e shi umɛ mo, umanyiwu le to oko awu kaa laa mbawu ɛmɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Mekyi ki yi ɛmɛnɛ umbafo werewo munɛ. Umɛ uwakɔ e to oko, e kpomo e shi umɛ mo. Oko wu a ŋa laa umanyiwu kwuwongu e yi umɛ mo. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Inyinyi gba i du umanyiwu uwopo mbala uwɔla nzhii ba uworo le. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ, oko awu e kpomo tete. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />So nzu ŋanɛ, ɔnu uwu iyimo mu lukwu, uwe, mu ɛmɛnɛ werewo mbɔlɛ, ba akwu ɔnu uwu oko ele moo kpɛkpɛmba lɛɛbi o to oko ele?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Lunyi lu ngbomo gyɔɔ kwuwongu lu yitu iyi iso iyi Ukpo mbala ekpasu wu mo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Ɔnu uwu iyimo mu lukwu enzu o to eko mo ba o ya anu mo, enzu o yi kyamate alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo tayi moshi. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Mekeka iyi iyimo iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpomo: lu du wayi dɛ mo re iyi Ukpo e so yi mekeka iyi iyimo mu lukwu? A zɔ tee, <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />&lt; Imi gba mi kwu Ukpo uwu Aburamu, Ukpo uwu Aziki mbala Ukpo uwu Ɔzhɛkɔbu le.&gt; Uwu akwu Ukpo uwu enzu wareyi moo akwu uwu ɛkpɛzhi mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Tabɔkɔ enzu o pwa iso iyi Ɔzhizɔsi ɛlɛ, izele i wo mbo mo mu ɛzɔ wu ɛlɛ.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛrɛma Iyi I Kiika Le</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Omaki 12.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Oluku 10.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Tabɔkɔ Afarisi o pwa tee Asadusi o fa laa Ɔzhizɔsi opwu igbama, akwɛyi o kpala esu ɛlu, <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />akwɛyi ukpɛnyi mba uwu akwu ɔkɛtɛkpɛ mu ɛrama iyi Omosisi, a pwa Ɔzhizɔsi ma mu kwuyo. <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />A za wu tee, &lt;&lt;U zɔ kiya, ɛrama iyina bɔkɔ i kiika?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt; &lt;Pwu idɛnyi iyi Ɔkwu Ukpo ŋɔ mu akɔ ŋɔ, laa idu iyanana ŋa mbala egbo ŋɔ lɛɛbi.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Ɛlɛ gba akwu ɛrama iyi kwonze iyi i ka iyinayina ma le. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Ɛrama iyopo iyi i kiika i yi mate iyi kwonze tete: &lt;Pwu idɛnyi iyi onzu uwu a nɔ a kpa ŋa kyamate ɛŋɔ tayi.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Ɛrama iyi Omosisi mbala ɛzu izɔma iyi anukenzu lɛɛbi i wɛlɛ mu ɛrama ekpepo ɛlɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwuyo Mɛka Iyi Omezaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Omaki 12.35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Oluku 20.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Kwuye ungwu Afarisi o kpala ɛlu, Ɔzhizɔsi e yo mbo tee, <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />&lt;&lt;Egbo lu bi te meka iyi Omezaya? Uwu akwu umɛ uwu uwe?&gt;&gt; O gba wu opwu tee,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">&lt;&lt; Akwu Umɛ uwu Odevidi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e yo mbo tee, &lt;&lt;Ba i wo la bɔkɔ Kwundu e shi Odevidi a ya wu tee &lt;Ɔkwu&gt;? Moo Odevidi a zɔ tee,<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />&lt;Ɔkwu a za la Ɔkwu mi tee:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">Ŋɔma mu kwuwo ungwu ungyi mi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">kaa la mi fulo ŋɔ mu kadu unga agewa ŋa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">dɛ.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Gba Odevidi a ya wu tee &lt;Ɔkwu,&gt; i wo la bɔkɔ Omezaya akwu umɛ wu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Onzu u gba wu opwu e yi mo. Ngbaa mu ɔnungawu, onzu u do wu kwuyo iyomo e yi fo.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Ta Wa Zɔ Ɛrɛma Iyi Omosisi Mbala Afarisi Undu Kwudu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38">Omaki 12.38</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 12:39">39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43">Oluku 11.43</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:46">46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45">20.45</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 20:46">46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za la riba ingyi enzu mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu tee: <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />&lt;&lt;Wa zɔ ɛrama iyi Ukpo mbala Afarisi gba o shi mbo ekpasu iyi iluma iyi Ɛrɛma iyi Omosisi le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Kwuwo kwɔngu la lu lo mbo mo, la lu wo iyi o so yi lɛɛbi; lunyi ba la lu lu wo apula iyi bɔkɔ umba o wo mo, moo o wo iyi bɔkɔ umba o so mo. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Umba oo ma ewulo iyɔlu akwɛyi o fulo yi enzu mu igyɔsu mba, umba ba o nyamate tee lo ngiri yi ɛfyi kaa lo mbwamba ma lo to ewulo ɛnyi mo. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />&lt;&lt;O wo kiya ingyinangyina kaa enzu lo ma mba: O lo ipwulɛshi iyɛku iyi iso iyi Ukpo; o kyo o lo ɛriga iyɛku laa ɛzu iyi iso iyi Ukpo ma yi! <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />O gyi iŋɔma mu riyi ingyɛkwu mbaa odumudumu mbala udaba uwu ɛlu ikpalama uwu Azhu; <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />gba o fye mu rishi, o gyi tee uwewe la gbɛlɛ mba ɛnyi, lo to mbo ɛnyi tee &lt;U zɔ kiya.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Ɔzhizɔsi a za la Wavɔngɔkiya tee,&lt;&lt;Lunyi ba enzu lo ya yi tee &lt;U zɔ kiya mo,&gt; kwuwongu U zɔ kiya akwu ukpɛnyi bi gba lu yi wu le, lunyi ba lu kwu imɛnɛ kpɛkpɛyi. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />La lu ya onzu uwunawuna mu kwudu kwɔlɛ tee &lt;Ada&gt; mo, moo lu yi Ada ukpɛnyi bi uwu e yi moshi awu. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Lunyi ba enzu lo ya yi te &lt;U to keyi&gt; mo, kwuwongu u to keyi yi akwu ukpɛnyi bi, gba akwu Omezaya le. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Onzu uwu a ka le meka yi, aakwu umɛgba yi mɛga. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu e to ɛnwu e fulo kadu, o gba wu ɔ nyɔ mɛzhi, onzu uwunawuna uwu ba e to ɛnwu tee akwu kiya mo, o to wu o fulo mu kadu.<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Ɔzhizɔsi A Kpa Kwukyoromo Mbo Apwu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38">Omaki 12.38</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 12:39">39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43">Oluku 11.43</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:46">46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45">20.45</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 20:46">46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />&lt;&lt;Inyashi iyɛku i rigbo yi, lunyi wazɔ ɛrama iyi Ukpo mbala lunyi Afarisi! Lunyi wamwangba mbɔlɛ! Lu se enzu ɔgwuzɛ uwu ɛsu irimo iyi oshi ma. Lunyi lu fye mo, enzu umba ɔ gyi tee lo fye ba lu nyi mba ma. <verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />&lt;&lt;Gbetu yi, lunyi wazɔ ɛrama iyi Ukpo mbala lunyi Afarisi, lunyi wamwangba mbɔlɛ! Lu na agba iyi eko umba o kpo anu ma akwɛyi lu koko ira yi ɛlɛ ma mu Ukpo ilɛma gbulɔlɔ. Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ, inyashi iya yi i ka le.<verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />&lt;&lt;Inyashi iyɛku i rigbo yi, lunyi wa zɔ ɛrama iyi Ukpo mbala lunyi Afarisi, lunyi wamwangba mbɔlɛ! Lu kpa ɛvyɛ lu fula ɛzhi ma, lu sa risu kaa la lu fya u mbwalu ukpɛnyi shooshosho, gba lu fya ma-a, lunyi ba lu gba lu wo wu umɛ uwu kwogba ungwu ɔyi uwu a ka yi ma izhepo!<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />Inyashi iyɛku i rigbo yi, lunyi epeyi wazɔ epeyi ɔgwuzɛ! Lu zɔ ɛzɔ tee, &lt;Gba onzu a vungɔma laa Ɔtɛpu, akwu kiya mo, onzu uwu a vungɔma laa ogolu uwu e yi mu Ɔtɛpu, gba ivungɔma ɛnyi i rima le.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Epeyi erendo mbɔlɛ! Iyina i ka: ogolu nana Ɔtɛpu uwu a wulu ogolu ma kɛrikɛri awu ŋa? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Lu kyo lu zɔ mu ɛzɔ yi tee &lt;Gba onzu a vungɔma laa kwɔla ungwu isabɔ, akwu kiya kinyinyi mo, onzu ba a vungɔma laa rɛshi ingyi o fulo mu kwɔla ungwu isabɔ awu gba ivungɔma ɛnyi i rima le.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Lunyi epeyi mbɔlɛ! Iyina i ka: rɛshi nana kwɔla ungwu isabɔ ungwu kwu wulu rɛshi ma kɛrikɛri awu ŋa? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Kwuwo kwɔngu, onzu uwu a vungɔma laa kwɔla ungwu isabɔ, a vungɔma e kyo mbala rɛshi ingyi o fulo mu kwɔla kwɔngu; <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />tatayi onzu uwu a vungɔma laa Ɔtɛpu, a vungɔma e kyo Ukpo uwu e yi mu Ɔtɛpu awu; <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />onzu uwu a vungɔma e to laa oshi, a vungɔma e to laa ukpa uwɛsu uwu Ukpo mbala Ukpo uwu a ŋɔ mawu awu.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />&lt;&lt;Inyashi iyɛku i rigbo yi, lunyi wazɔ ɛrama iyi Omosisi mbala Afarisi, lunyi wamwangba! Lu to ikpɛnyi meka iyi uwo iyi: imadu, okwonu mbala epwu iyɛri iyɛri iyi utu yi lu ka laa Ukpo, lunyi ba lu lafya laa iyi i ka le mu ɛrama iyi Ukpo - ongbulolo, eyembembyi mbala ikwu idu lu fulo mu Ukpo. I fate la lu wo ɛlɛ tete ba la lu lafya laa iyi kwonze ɛnyi mo. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Lunyi epeyi umba o zɔ epeyi ɔgwuzɛ mbɔlɛ! Lu sɛ ezhizhiri ma mu embyi yi umba lu wo, ba lu mbiri onyakurumi ma.<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />&lt;&lt;Inyashi iyɛku i rigbo yi, lunyi wazɔ ɛrama iyi Omosisi mbala lunyi Afarisi, lunyi wamwangba mbɔlɛ! Lunyi lu gbɔ kwudu unga kagɔ mbala kaatu ma, mɛmi ba akwu enzu iwiwomo mbala igyɛyɛyi. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Uŋɔ Ofarisi upeyi ele! Gbɔ ɛmi iyi kagɔ mbala kaatu ma keyi dɛ akwɛyi kwudu ba kwu wulu ma tete.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />&lt;&lt;Inyashi iyɛku i rigbo yi lunyi wa zɔ ɛrama iyi Omosisi mbala lunyi Afarisi, lunyi wamwangba mbɔlɛ! Lu yi kyamate agariwu iyi o kpa yi ɔgɔ uruwu, akwɛyi i sheshi mu kwudu, mɛmi ba inyɔlɔma duduu laa ekwu iyi enzu mbala ɛkpɛzhi umba o vama-a tayi. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Tatayi gba lu yi le. Mu kwudu lu zɔ tee lu kwu enzu umbeshi, mɛmi ba lu nyɔlɔma duduu laa angba imuma mbala ira.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Ɔzhizɔsi E So Inyashi Iyi I Bi Du Mbo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Oluku 11.47-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />&lt;&lt;Inyashi iyɛku i rigbo yi, lunyi wazɔ ɛrama iyi Omosisi mbala lunyi Afarisi, lunyi wamwangba mbɔlɛ! Lu mbo agariwu iyesheshi laa anukenzu umba Ukpo, lu nɔngɔ Ogariwu iyi enzu umba ototo ma, <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />akwɛyi lu zɔ tee, &lt;Kwuye ungwu asɔkwu nzu o fu ɛnzhi umba anukenzu umba Ukpo ma awu, gba la ki yi mɔmɔ, ki lo kwuwo mbala mba mu ɛnzhi ifumo iyi anukenzu umba Ukpo mo.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Mu ɛlɛ, i zɔ tee lu nyama tee lu wɔ mu ɛdɔ iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o ngbɛ anukenzu umba Ukpo ma awu. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />La lu kyakpɔ nɛ kaa la lu nyɔlɔ ingbomo iyi bɔkɔ asɔkwu yi o ye kambu awu ma!<verse eid="MAT 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />&lt;&lt;Lunyi akwu mbɔlɛ! Lunyi ɛdɔ iyi agbazhi mbɔlɛ! Lu wo la ba lu vuluma mu ombu uwu Ukpo? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ, mi lɔ yi laa anukenzu umba Ukpo mbala enzu umba ilukwu mbala wa zɔ ɛzu. Umbafo mba lu ngbɛ mba ma, umbafo lu kpa mba mu kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu, akwɛyi umbafo ba lu kpa mba ikpa mu idaba iyi ɛlu ikpalama yi, lu mbwalu mba mese mese. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ, ɛnzhi umba enzu umba ɔsɛkɛnɛ umba bɔkɔ o fu mbo mo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ lɛɛbi, i gwu mu ɛnzhi umba Ɛbɛlu onzu ɔsɛkɛnɛ, nzhii ba ɛnzhi umba Ozakaraya umɛ uwu Oberekiya, uwu lu ngbɛ wu ma mu kwudeka ungwu Ɔtɛpu mbala kwɔla ungwu isabɔ awu, o yi mu reshi yi lɛɛbi. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Mi so yi ongbulolo, inyashi iyi o lo wa ngbɛ enzu mbɔlɛ, i du enzu umba ɔyi ɔlɛ lɛɛbi tete!<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Ɔzhizɔsi E Pwu Idɛnyi Iyi Ɔzhɛrusalɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34">Oluku 13.34</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:35">35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />&lt;&lt;Ɔzhɛrusalɛ ye! Ɔzhɛrusalɛ ye! Lunyi lu ngbɛ anukenzu umba Ukpo ma akwɛyi lu to umba o lɔmba ma munyi yi ekyi. Izhɛvɔ bɔkɔ mi gyi tee la mi kpala ɛmɛ ŋɔ ɛlu, kyamate ɛnu uwu a kpala ɛmɛ wu ɛlu mu idu wu tayi, ba lu to mo. <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ o lafya laa Ɔtɛpu yi uwidɔ. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />La mi so yi mɛɛ, lu ma mi gbee fo nzhii ba ɔnu uwu lu bu zɔ te, &lt;Iduma akwiyi onzu uwu e yi mu inyɔma mu ɛnyi iyi Ɔkwu.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E Siso Mɛka Iyi Ɔtɛpu Ishirimo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1">Omaki 13.1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 13:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5">Oluku 21.5</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 21:6">6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Mizhikembo iyi Ɔzhizɔsi a lafya laa Ɔtɛpu e yi mu luzɛ akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu o bo munyi wu o zɔ wu woshi umbu agba iyi Ɔtɛpu. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Uwu ba e yo mbo tee, &lt;&lt;Lu ma ɛlɛ lɛɛbi? La mi so yi ongbulolo tee, ekyi ɛlɛ kpɛkpɛyi o shiriyimo; kwokyi kwukpukpɛnyi tee kwu fulo mu kadu unga kwokyi ungufo mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Inyashi Ilomo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Omaki 13.3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Oluku 21.7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a ŋɔma mu lɔwa ungwu Olifu akwɛyi wa vɔngɔ kiya wu o bo munyi wu kyo kyo. Akwɛyi ɔ za wu tee, &lt;&lt;So nzu kwuyengwuna ba ɛlɛ i bi wo,&gt;&gt; kimbe bɔkɔ akwu kɛzɔ unga igbama ŋa mbala ibomo iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba mba opwu tee: &lt;&lt;La lu ngbɛndu, kaa onzu uwunawuna le kyoro yimo mo. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Moo enzu gyɔɔ ɔ wɔ mu ɛnyi mi, ɔ zɔ tee, &lt;Imi gba mi kwu Omezaya le!&gt; akwɛyi o kyoro enzu gyɔɔ ma. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Luu pwa eza iyi ewa mbala kwɔdu ungwu ewa itomo, ɛlɛ li lo yi iyi mo. Apula ɛlɛ te i wo mega, tetete, ibomo iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ i di bo mo bɛnɛ. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Ɛzhi iyifo i wa laa ewa i fo laa iyifo, tatayi kwuse ungufo kwu wala ungufo laa ewa. Lonzu iyama mbala ishirimo iyi ɛzhi i kpo fyɛɛ mu kizɛ ikikɔ ikikɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi i yi kyamate kambu iyemo unga ɛnyi iyimo iyi kwɔmba iwomo bɛnɛ.<verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />&lt;&lt;Akwɛyi, o ra yi o shi enzu kaa lo lo yi inyashi, lɔ ngbɛ yi ma, o towo yi mo kwuwo mi. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Mu kwuye kwɔngu enzu gyɔɔ oo gba kembo mu imbwaluma mi; enzu o rutu uwesu, o gyi esu mo. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Anukenzu umba angba gyɔɔ o wɔ, o kyoro enzu guruguru ma. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Idɛnyi ipumo iyi enzu gyɔɔ i gyima kwuwongu ikyomo iyi inzumbira. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Tetete, onzu uwu e yidu a rima nzhii ba ibomo iyi kwudu kɔlɛ, a fya isama ma. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Akwɛyi Iso iyesheshi iyi ɛsu irimo iyi oshi ɛlɛ o ta yi anu munamuna kaa la kwu izɔgɔ laa enzu lɛɛbi, akwɛyi kwudu kwɔlɛ kwu bo mo.<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Inyashi Iyɛkwu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Omaki 13.14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Oluku 21.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />&lt;&lt;Gba lu ma &lt;Apula iyi kashi iyi ingbomo&gt; tee i rima mu Ɔtɛpu ɔkɛrikɛri, kyamate anukenzu Ɔdaniyɛ e so awu,&gt;&gt; &lt;Onzu uwunawuna uwu a wa ɛzu ɛlɛ la ngbɛndu kaa laa zɔngɔ yi ma!&gt; <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu Ozhudiya lo ri lo so mu lɔwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Onzu uwu e yi mu kɛnu unga kwogba wu, la kalama le bo mɛzhi te e to kiya mogba mo. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Onzu uwu e yi mu utu, le so mogba te le to ɔmu mo. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Afyi ɛnyi akwu afyi iyi inyashi laa eko umba rifo mbala eko umba o ra laa ɛmɛ umbelu mu kwuwo! <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />La lu lɛ Ukpo kaa ɛnya irima yi lakwu mu iwo mo ba lakwu ɔnu uwu kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo mo! <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Moo aakwu kwuyengwu inyashi iyɛku i yi o dɔ ma yi dɛ mo ngba mu iyemo iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ, ba o gba o ma ɛlɛ te fo. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Gba afyi ɛnyi o gyi yi wɔzhi ma mo, onzu uwu e do irima e yi mo; tetete ba kwuwongu enzu umba Ukpo a ŋa mba, afyi ɛnyi o gyi yi wɔzhi ma. <verse eid="MAT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />Mu kwuye kwɔngu gba onzu uwunawuna a za yi tee &lt;La lu yese, Omezaya a ŋɔ munɛ le! Nana a za yi tee a ŋɔ aawu! La lu nyama mo&gt;. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Moo Amezaya umba angba mbala anukenzu umba angba oo wɔ, oo wo lɔzɔ undɔkwuu mbala apula iyi kenzu iyama kaka kaa lo kyoro enzu mo, gba i wo mbo enzu umba bɔkɔ Ukpo a ŋa mba lala oo kyoro mbo mo tete. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />La lu yese, gba mi so yi kpeke-e awu mɛɛ!<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />&lt;&lt;Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ, gba onzu uwunawuna a za yi tee, &lt;A ŋɔ aawu, mu ɛzhi ɛngbarara, la lu wɔ kwudu mo; nana a za yi tee, e nvyemo munɛ!&gt; La lu nyama mo. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Moo kwɔfyi ungwu umɛ uwu onzu a ba gbama awu, kwu yi kyamate kawu izɛma unga Ukpo bɔkɔ ka wɔ mu ɔnu uwukwoto ba o ma nga mu ononoyo awu, tatayi gba inyɔma iyi Umɛ uwu Onzu iyi le. <verse eid="MAT 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />&lt;&lt;Munamuna mbaa abwu i yi le gba eperemi o kpala ɛlu le.<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Igbama Iyi Umɛ Uwu Onzu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Omaki 13.24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Oluku 21.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />&lt;&lt;Mizhikembo iyi inyashi iyɛku ɛnyi, akwɛyi mu kwotota: &lt;&lt; &lt;Ɔnu u shipwu, ɔvya ba u lemo fo, elovyo i kala ii fu mɛzhi, akwɛyi apula iyi oshi lɛɛbi o wo yi akpa zhigizhigi.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />&lt;&lt;Mu kwuye kwɔngu kɛzɔ unga Umɛ uwu Onzu ka wɔ moshi, akwɛyi enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ lɛɛbi o wo ubugyi. O ma Umɛ uwu Onzu e yi mu inyɔma a wɔ mu amu iyi oshi, laa ekpasu, mbala inzumbɛku iyɛkuu. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Akwɛyi a lɔ alɔgbulɔ wu o ngyi kwongangaraki gbogbogbo, akwɛyi a lɔ alɔgbulɔ mu eko ekpendo iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ, akwɛyi o kpala enzu umba a ŋa mba ɛlu i wɔ mu kwuko ungwu kwudu kwɔlɛ i so mu imbwama ngwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Kiya Ingyi O Vɔngɔ Mbaa Uwɛyi Uwu Oboriyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Omaki 13.28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Oluku 21.29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />&lt;&lt;La lu vɔngɔ kiya mu uwɛyi uwu oboriyo. Gba u le mu epu itumo akwɛyi epu i le mu iwɔma la lu yitu tee iwo inda fo. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Tatayi gba lu ma apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi, la lu yitu tee kwuye kwu bo-o, a ndama fo, e yi mu kenzugwu-o. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Mi so yi ongbulolo tee, apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi i wo dɛ gba ɔyi ɔlɛ u rimo le. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Oshi mbala ɛzhi i tomo, iso mi ba i tomo mo.<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Onzu Uwu E Yitu Iyi Kwɔfyi Mbala Kwuye E Yi Mo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Omaki 13.32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Oluku 17.26-30</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />&lt;&lt;Onzu uwunawuna e yitu iyi kwɔfyi mbala kwuye kwɔngu mo - alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo mu oshi lala o yitu mo, Umɛ tete e yitu mo. Ada kɛɛkyi gba e yitu le. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Kyamate i wo mu kwuyengwu Onowa awu, tatayi gba i wo le mu kwuyengwu igbama iyi Umɛ uwu Onzu. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Kwuye ungwu embyi o do lomo mo, enzu o yi mu kiya irimo mbala iwomo, eko itomo mbala anu iyama, nzhii ba ɔnu uwu Onowa e fye mu kwoda; <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />ba o yitu iyi bɔkɔ i yembo mu inyɔma awu mo nzhii ba embyi o ri mbo mo lɛɛbi. Tatayi gba i wo le mu ɔnu uwu igbama iyi Umɛ uwu Onzu. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Mu kwuye kwɔngu anzɔnu wepo o yi mu utu; o to ukpɛnyi ma akwɛyi o lafya laa ukpɛnyi. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Eko wepo o yi mu ikpomo mu riko; o to ukpɛnyi ma akwɛyi o lafya laa ukpɛnyi.<verse eid="MAT 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />Kwuwo kwɔngu la lu ngbɛndu, moo lu yitu iyi kwɔfyi ungwu Ɔkwu yi a ba gbama mo. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Lunyi ba la lu yitu iyi ɛlɛ tee, gba ada uwu kwogba le yitu iyi kwuyengwu uwɛlɔ a nyɔ mogba wu, ba le be gbomo ka uwɛlɔ la fya le fyemo mogba wu mo. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Kwuwo kwɔngu lunyi tete la lu yi ɛnwu ma, moo Umɛ uwu Onzu a gbama mu kwuyengwu lu fulo eyi wu mo.<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Uwe Ba Akwu Umɛgba Uwu kwuyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Oluku 12.41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />&lt;&lt;Uwe ba akwu umɛgba uwu kwuyi mbala ilukwu? Akwu uwu bɔkɔ ada kwogba wu e shi wu tee la bɔ eyi mu agba wu kaa le shi mbo kiya ingyirimo mu kwuyengwu i kpo. <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Ɔnyɛ akwu uwu umɛgba awu uwu bɔkɔ ada kwogba wu a gbama akwɛyi e du wu mu ɛduma iwomo iyi bɔkɔ e lo wu te le wo awu! <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Imi mi so yi ongbulolo, ada kwogba wu e lo wu ingyinangyina ingyi e yi ngyi mɔwu. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Gba umɛgba awu akwu onzu uwura, a za la ɛnwu mu egbo tee, &lt;Ada kwogba mi a gbama kekelele mo,&gt; <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />akwɛyi e le mu ɛmɛgba ɛmanyi wu ɛmu ikpama mbala apula irimo mbala iwomo mbala enzu wa wo atɛ gyɔɔ. <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />Ada kwogba uwu umɛgba awu a gbama mu kwɔfyi ungwu Umɛgba awu e fulo eyi mo mbala kwuyengwu e yitu mo. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />E kpolo wu kpɔkpɔ akwɛyi a ta wu mu kizɛ ingyi inyashi mbaa bɔkɔ o fu wa mwangba, mɔmɔ gba e loga mbala ɛnyi ilamesu le.<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s1">Kwoba Ungwu Emoko Wewo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />Mu kwuye kwɔngu Ɛsu irimo iyi kwogba ungwu oshi i yi mate emoko wewo umba bɔkɔ o ka mbaa odumudumu uwu okopo itomo akwɛyi o kwu itutula mba tee o bo kpolo ɔnu uwu okopo. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Ɛmɛ eko walɔ mba akwu alofo walɔ mba ba akwu wazeyi. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Alofo mbɔlɛ o kwu itutula mba ba ɔ za la anyi umbafo o kyo mo. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Wazeyi ba o o kwu itutula mba o kyo o za la anyi umbafo mu ɛgya mba. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Ɔnu uwu okopo ele e to kwuye e bo efya mo, akwɛyi lɛɛbi mba o fye mu ondo ilemo nzhii ba o kpondo.<verse eid="MAT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />Akwɛyi &lt;&lt;Mu utu uwɛka o pwa ɔ tanu tee: &lt;Ɔnu uwu okopo e bo-o loo! La lu wɔ kwudu kaa lo kpolo wu!&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />&lt;&lt;Akwɛyi emoko wewo mbɔlɛ lɛɛbi o nyeyimo, o nɔngɔ itutula mba ma. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Akwɛyi emoko alofo mbɔlɛ o za la wazeyi tee, &lt;La lu gyi anyi la lu shi nzu nɛ moo itutula nzu i yi mu inyima-a.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Wazeyi mbɔlɛ ba o gba mba opwu tee, &lt;Ayimo,&gt; &lt;Anyi o do nzu mo mbala yi mo. La lu so kaa lu ya umbayi mbaa wa ya anyi ma.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />&lt;&lt;Te o yimo o sheye mbaa anyi iyama, akwɛyi ɔnu uwu okopo e ngyi. Emoko wazeyi mbɔlɛ o fyemo mu ugu uwu odumudumu, akwɛyi o koko riku mo.<verse eid="MAT 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />&lt;&lt;Kwuye mbwɛ akwɛyi emoko alofo mbɔlɛ o ngyi tete akwɛyi o le mu iyama tee, &lt;Ada, ada! Wa nzu riku mo nɛ!&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />&lt;&lt;ɔnu uwu okopo ba a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;Ongbulolo gba mi so yi le, mi yi yi mo.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />&lt;&lt;Kwuwo kwɔngu la lu ngbɛndu, moo lu yitu iyi kwɔfyi mbala kwuyengwu mi gbama mo.<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwoba Ungwu Ɛmɛgba Wala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Oluku 19.11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />Tete kpɔ &lt;&lt;Ɛsu irimo iyi oshi i yi kyamate onzu uwufo uwu e sheye mu luzɛ mu kizɛ ingyi indama akwɛyi a ya ɛmɛgba wu ma, akwɛyi e shi mbo kiya ingyi kwuwo wu kaa lɔ bɔ eyi mangyi. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />E shi ukpɛnyi ɛtalɛnti ɛlɔ, e shi uwufo ɛtalɛnti epo, uwufo ba e shi wu kwo talɛnti kwunyi, onzonzu o shi wu mate bɔkɔ ekpasu wu i bɔ. Akwɛyi e yi mo a ka luzɛ. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Umɛgba uwu a na ɛtalɛnti ɛlɔ awu a ngbɛ kwuye mo, akwɛyi e le mu ewo ifulomo ma yi akwɛyi a fya ɛtalɛnti ɛlɔ e kyo kadu. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Tete umɛgba uwu a na ɛtalɛnti epo awu a fya ɛtalɛnti epo e kyo kadu. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Umɛgba uwu a na kwo talɛnti kwukpɛnyi awu ba a ka vu kwuvɔ mɛzhi akwɛyi e nvye eduwo iyi ada kwogba wu ma.<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />&lt;&lt;Ada kwogba uwu ɛmɛgba mbamba e to kwuye gyɔɔ dɛ gba a gbama le. Akwɛyi a ya mba ma mu idu wu kaa onzonzu le so iyi e wo mu ɛtalɛnti iyi bɔkɔ a na. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Umɛgba uwu a na ɛtalɛnti ɛlɔ awu e bo la ɛtalɛnti ɛlɔ iyifo e kyo kadu. Akwɛyi a za laa ada kwogba wu tee, &lt;Ada kwogba,&gt; &lt;ŋɔ shi mi ɛtalɛnti ɛlo. Yese, mi fya ɛtalɛnti ɛlɔ mi kyo kadu.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />&lt;&lt;Akwɛyi ada kwogba wu a za wu tee, &lt;Gbagba uwu ɛduma, umɛgba uwoshi, uwu o fulo idu mawu! Kwuwongwu ŋɔ wo ongbulolo mu apula bwɛ le, mi lo ŋɔ apula guruguru mɔwu. Bo kaa mwɔnyɛ mbala ada kwogba ŋa!&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />&lt;&lt;Umɛgba uwu a na ɛtalɛnti epo awu e bo tete. A zɔ tee, &lt;Ada kwogba,&gt; &lt;ŋɔ shi mi ɛtalɛnti epo. Yese, mi fya ɛtalɛnti epo mi kyo kadu.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />&lt;&lt;Akwɛyi ada kwogba wu a za wu tee, &lt;Gbagba uwu ɛduma, umɛgba uwoshi, uwu o fulo idu mawu! Kwuwongwu ŋɔ wo ongbulolo mu apula bwɛ le, mi lo ŋɔ apula guruguru mɔwu. Bo kaa mwɔnyɛ mbala ada kwogba ŋa!&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />&lt;&lt;Akwɛyi umɛgba uwu a na kwɔtalɛnti kwukpɛnyi awu e bo akwɛyi a za wu tee, &lt;Ada kwogba, mi yitu te ŋɔ kɔma, ŋɔɔ lɔ mbaa ŋɔ somo mo, ŋɔ kpala ɛlu mbaa ŋɔ to eyi mo. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Ɛlɛ gba i lo mi iyi le gba mi nvye eduwo ŋɔ mo mɛzhi le. Yese! Na kya ŋa.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />Akwɛyi ada kwogba wu a za wu tee, &lt;Umɛgba u mwakɔ ma, ulofo ele! Ŋɔ yitu tee mii lɔ mbaa mi somo mo, mi gba mi kpala ɛlu mbaa mi to eyi le mo? <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Ba la ŋɔ bi shi eduwo mi mba wafulewo, kaa kwuyengwu mi gbama akwɛyi mi na yi mbala kwule yi.<verse eid="MAT 25:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Akwɛyi a zɔ tee, la lu na wu eduwo ɛnyi ma kaa lu shi yi onzu uwu e yi ɛtalɛnti uwo awu! <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Moo uwewe uwu e yi kiya, o kyo wu ngyi mo kaa le yi ngyi gyɔɔ. Onzu uwu e yi ngyi mo ba, ɛkɛkyi iyi e yi yi awu lala o gba oo na wu yi ma. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />La lu to umɛgba uwu umbwa le mo kaa lu ta wu mu kwudu, mu ipwu, mu riyi ingyi ɛga ilomo mbala ɛnyi ilamesu.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ombwu Izɔma Uwu Imbwambwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />&lt;&lt;Ɔnuwu Umɛ uwu Onzu a ba nyɔ mu inzumbɛku wu, mbala alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo lɛɛbi, a ŋɔ mu ukpa wu mu inzubɛkwu iyoshi. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Lunzu undu kwudu kwɔlɛ lɛɛbi lu kpala ɛlu mu idu wu, akwɛyi a ka mba ma mbala esu kyamate u pya luzhi bɔkɔ a ka ilɔ mbala ɛmu ma ta yi. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />E shi enzu watoto mu kwuwo ungwu ungyi wu, washimo ba e shi mbo mu kwuwo ungwu ɔzu wu.<verse eid="MAT 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />Akwɛyi Ɔsu a za laa enzu umba o yi mu kwuwo ungyi wu tee, &lt;La lu bo, lunyi umba lu fya esheshi iyi Adami! La lu bo kaa lu na ogu uwu irɛsu iyi bɔkɔ o nɔngɔ kwuwo yi ngba mu iyemo iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ awu. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Moo kwuyengwu mi yi lonzu, lu shi mi kiya mi ri, ugbembyi u wo mi mo, lu shi mi embyi mi wo, mi kwu ugboga, lu na mi ewo epo mogba yi, <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />mi yi rewa ingyi ekpayi, lu shi mi, mi pwu ofya lu yese mbaa mi, o ta mi mu ugu ugyi lu ka lu ma mi.<verse eid="MAT 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />&lt;&lt;Akwɛyi enzu umba ototo o gba wu opwu tee, &lt;Ɔkwu, ɔnuwuna bɔkɔ ki ma ŋa te ŋɔ yi lonzu akwɛyi ki shi ŋɔ kiya ŋɔ ri, na ugbembyi u wo ŋɔ mo akwɛyi ki shi ŋɔ embyi ŋɔ wo? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Ɔnuwuna bɔkɔ ki ma ŋa ugboga bɔkɔ ki na ŋa ewo epo mogba nzu, naa ŋɔ yi ugɔ uwu ekpayi akwɛyi ki kpo ŋɔ ekpayi? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Ɔnuwuna bɔkɔ ki ma ŋa mu ofya ipwuma naa o ta ŋa mu ugu ugyi akwɛyi ki ka ki ma ŋa?&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Akwɛyi Ɔsu awu a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;Ongbulolo gba mi so yi le tee, kiya ingyinangyina ingyi lu wo laa ukpɛnyi umbwambwa mu ɛmɛnɛ mi mbɔlɛ, lu wo mi!&gt; <verse eid="MAT 25:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />&lt;&lt;Akwɛyi a za laa umba bɔkɔ o yi mu ɔzu wu awu tee, &lt;La lu zɛ gboo lu she mi kizɛ lunyi umba bɔkɔ Ukpo a ta yi kenzu-o! La lu fye mɔyi uwu o nɔngɔ laa Onzu uwoyi mbala alɔgbulɔ wu! <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Moo kwuyengwu lonzu lu wo mi mo, lu shi mi kiya te la mi ri mo, ugbembyi u wo mi mo ba lu shi mi embyi te la mi wo mo; <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />mi kwu ugboga mogba yi ba lu na mi mo, mi yi ugɔ uwu ekpayi lu shi mi mo; mi pwu ofya, o gba o ta mi mu ugu ugyi, ba lu yese mbaa mi mo.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />&lt;&lt;Umba tete o gba wu opwu tee, &lt;Ɔkwu, ɔnuwuna bɔkɔ ki ma ŋa te lonzu lu wo ŋɔ mo, naa laa ugbembyi naa ŋɔ kwu ugboga naa ŋɔ yi ugɔ uwu ekpayi naa ŋɔ pwu ofya naa o ta ŋa mu ugu ugyi ba ki mbwaŋama mo?&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Akwɛyi Osu awu a gba mba opwu tee, &lt;Mi so yi ongbulolo, kiya ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ lu towo iwomo laa ukpɛnyi umbwambwa uwu mbɔlɛ mo, lu wo mi mo.&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />&lt;&lt;Akwɛyi Ukpo e fu enzu umba bɔkɔ o wo iyi ira mu riyi ingyi inyashi iyɔkpɔɔ, enzu umba ototo ba Ukpo e shi mbo mu riyi ingyi kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s1">O Kpa Kwuda Laa Ɔzhizɔsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1">Omaki 14.1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1">Oluku 22.1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Ɔzhɔnu 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a mbwa iso ɛlɛ isomo lɛɛbi, akwɛyi a za laa Wavɔngɔkiya wu tee, <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />&lt;&lt;Kyamate bɔkɔ lu yitu, odumudumu uwu ikalama e shi afyi epo bi ŋa, akwɛyi o ra laa Umɛ uwu Onzu o shi kaa lo kpa wu mu kuwɛyi ungwu lukwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Akwɛyi ebwoshi umbakɔ mbala enzu umbakɔ umba Azhu o bo o kpala ɛlu mu ufiri uwu u to keyi uwu ebwoshi uwu bɔkɔ o ya wu tee Okayafasi awu, <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />akwɛyi o wo amasa iyi kaa lo yi Ɔzhizɔsi mo kyokyokyo kaa lɔ ngbɛ wu ma. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />O zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;ki wo yi kwuyengwu odumudumu ele mo,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;kwuwongu enzu o bo wo ovyo mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O la Ɔzhizɔsi Anyi Mu Ɔbɛtani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Omaki 14.3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Ɔzhɔnu 12.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Ɔzhizɔsi e fye mu Ɔbɛtani mu kwogba ungwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ o ya wu tee Ɔsamɔ uwu e yi ofya umbu embyi umbɔyi dɛ-ɛ awu. <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />Kwuye ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi e yi mu kiya irimo, akwɛyi okokpayi ɛnyi e bo munyi wu laa ogya uwu anyi umba abwa gyɔɔ, akwɛyi e fulo mbo e fu wu mu reshi.<verse eid="MAT 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Wavɔngɔkiya wu o ma ɛlɛ, o wo amba. O yo tee, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ki bo laa ishi ɛlɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />&lt;&lt;Anyi mbɔlɛ lo bo ya mba ma mu abwa iyɛku kaa lo ra laa eduwo ɛnyi lo shi yi ayirewa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba e yitu iyi bɔkɔ o yi mu isomo, akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ki wo ba oko ele lu wo wu egbo gidigidi tee? Kiya ingyi e wo mi ele akwu kiya ingyesheshi. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Lunyi lu yi mbala ayirewa kwuyengwunanguna, Imi ba mi yi mbala yi kwuyengwunanguna mo. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Anyi umba bɔkɔ e fu mi mɛnwu ele, e wo ɛlɛ kaa la nɔngɔ ukpɛzhi mi ma kaa le gbo laa ipwumo mi. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Ongbulolo gba mi so yi, muna muna bɔkɔ o tanu iyi ilɔ iyesheshi ɛlɛ mu kwudu kwɔlɛ lɛɛbi o so kiya ingyi okpayi ele e wo, kaa lakwu ilolo mo wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ozhuda A Nyama Kaa La Ya Ɔzhizɔsi Ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10">Omaki 14.10</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:11">11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Oluku 22.3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Akwɛyi ukpenyi mekeka iyi Wavɔngɔkiya wewo la wepo mbamba uwu bɔkɔ o ya wu tee Ozhuda Isikariyɔ awu ka mbaa ebwoshi umbakɔ <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />akwɛyi e yo mbo tee, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ba lu shi mi, gba mi ra laa Ɔzhizɔsi mi shi yi?&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi o wala esiliva uwekpela o shi wu. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />I na mu kwuye kwɔngu i sheye keyi Ozhuda e le mu ɔgwuzɛ igagyima kaa laa ra laa Ɔzhizɔsi le shi mbo.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E Ri Kiya Ingyirimo Ingyi Odumudumu Uwu Ikalama Mbala Wa vɔngɔ Kiya Wu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Omaki 14.12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Oluku 22.7-13</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Ɔzhɔnu 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Mu kwɔfyi ungwu kwonze mu afyi iyi Odumudumu uwu Oburedi uwu bɔkɔ e yi otutu mo, Wavɔngɔkiya o bo mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi akwɛyi o yo wu tee, &lt;&lt;Muna bɔkɔ ŋɔ gyi te la ki nɔngɔ kizɛ ingyi kaa ri kiya ingyirimo ingyi Odumudumu uwu ikalama?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La lu so mɛmi iyi kwuse mbaa onzu uwufo,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;kaa la lu za wu tee: &lt;U zɔ kiya a zɔ tee, Kwuye mi kwu bo-o; mi gyi tee la mi mu ɔnyɛ uwu odumudu uwu ikalama mbala Wavɔngɔkiya mi mogba ŋa.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya wu o wo mate Ɔzhizɔsi e so mbo awu akwɛyi o nɔngɔ kiya ingyirimo ingyi Odumudumu uwu ikalama.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Kwuye ungwu eyikpomo, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a ŋɔma akwɛyi e ri kiya mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wewo la wepo mamba. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Mate bɔ o yi mu kiya irimo, Ɔzhizɔsi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Mi so yi ongbulolo, onzu ukpɛnyi meka yi e to mi a ya ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Idu mbo i tutumo iyɛkɛkɔ akwɛyi o le wo mu kwuyo iyomo kɛnyi, kɛnyi tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu, mi yitu akwu Imi gba ŋɔ so le mo amoo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e lo kwuwo wu mu kaatu mbala mi gba e to mi a yama le. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Umɛ uwu Onzu e kpomo mate bɔkɔ iso iyi Ukpo i so mu reshi wu awu, ikpɛdɔma ba akwiyi onzu uwu bɔkɔ e to Umɛ wu Onzu a ya ma awu! Lo mba wu mo lala ba i bi koshi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Akwɛyi Ozhuda uwu bɔkɔ e be to wu a ya ma awu, e yo tee, &lt;&lt;U zɔ kiya, mi yitu te, akwu Imi gba ŋɔ so le mo amoo?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:25">Ɔzhizɔsi a gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ee, akwu uŋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Kiya Ingyirimo Ingyi Onoyo Ingyi Ɔkwu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Omaki 14.22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Oluku 22.14-20</ref>; 1 Okorotiya I 11.23-25)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Tabɔkɔ o yi mu kiya irimo, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e to kwoburedi, a gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi akwɛyi a mu ngwu ma akwɛyi e shi Wavɔngɔkiya wu. Akwɛyi a zɔ tee; &lt;&lt;La lu na kaa lu ri,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;ɛlɛ akwu ɛnwu mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Akwɛyi e to ago, a gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi akwɛyi e to e shi mbo. Akwɛyi a zɔ tee; &lt;&lt;La lu wo lɛɛbi yi; <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />mbɔlɛ akwu ɛnzhi mi umba o ka o shi mɛzhi, umba bɔkɔ o fumo kwuwongu enzu riba kaa lo fya igbɔma iyi ingbomo. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Mi za yi tee, mi gba mi wo owanyi mbɔlɛ fo, nzhii ba mi bi wo umbepo mbala yi kwuyengwu Irɛsu iyi Ada mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Akwɛyi o so kwɔmu, o wo kwudu o ka mu lɔwa undu Olifu.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E So Kpeke Tee Opita A Zɔma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Omaki 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Oluku 22.31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Ɔzhɔnu 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, mu utu ɔlɛ lɛɛbi yi lu rɛnya luu shi mi, moo iso iyi Ukpo i zɔ tee, &lt;Ukpo a ngbɛ u gbo ilɔ ma, akwɛyi uzhi uwu ilɔ u kpashaa.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Mizhikembo iyi bɔkɔ mi yimo mu lukwu ba, mi to keyi la yi mu Ogalili.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Opita ba a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Gba enzu lɛɛbi o rɛnya o shi ŋɔ lala, mi lu ŋɔ afyima gbee mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a za la Opita tee, &lt;&lt;Ongbulolo gba mi so ŋɔ le te, mutu uwu ɔnɛnɛ ŋɔ zɔ kwu zɔ mi izhɛla dɛ gba Okwuru e tɛyi le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Opita ba a gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Akwiyi mi kpomo mbala ŋa lala, mi zɔ kwu zɔ ŋɔ mo!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:35">Tegba Wavɔngɔkiya umba bɔkɔ o shimo awu o so le tete.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Lɛ Ukpo Mu Ɔgɛsɛmani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Omaki 14.32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Oluku 22.39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a zɛ mbala Wavɔngɔkiya wu o ka mu riyi ingyi bɔkɔ o ya ngyi tee Ɔgɛsɛmani awu akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La lu ŋɔma munɛ kaa la mi so tayi kaa la mi lɛ Ukpo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />E to Opita mbala ɛmɛ umba Ɔzɛbɛdi wepo mbamba akwɛyi o kama mbala wu. Akwɛyi e le mu ubu ugyi iwomo, egbo wu i fomo gyɔɔ, <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />akwɛyi a za mba tee &lt;&lt;Ubu ugyi uwu e yi mami ele, a ŋaa ka mi la lukwu. La lu ŋɔ munɛ kaa lu gbomo mbala mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Tabɔkɔ e turu a ka keyi bwɛ, akwɛyi e kpo eyi mɛzhi akwɛyi a lɛ Ukpo tee, &lt;&lt;Ada mi, gba iwomo, ki shi kaa la mi wo ago iyi inyashi ɛlɛ mo! Tetete akwu iyi mi gyi gba li wo le mo, iyi ŋɔ gyi gba li wo le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Akwɛyi a gbama e bo mbaa Wavɔngɔkiya wu wala mbamba ba e du mbo tee o yi mu ondo ikpolomo; akwɛyi e yo Opita tee,&lt;&lt;Lu do tee luu gbomo mbala mi iyi awa ikpɛnyi shoo moo? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />&lt;&lt;La lu rima mu igbomo akwɛyi la lu lɛ Ukpo kaa la lu fye meka iyi imondomo mo. Kwundu kwu gyi kpɔɔ ɛnwu ba i funyashi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba a kama ungwu opo akwɛyi a lɛ Ukpo tee, &lt;&lt;Ada mi, gba iwomo te ago iyi inyashi ɛlɛ ŋɔ to yi mo mo, shi akwu mega tee la mi wo yi, ba iyi ŋɔ gyi gba li wo le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Tabɔkɔ a gbama kpɔ, e du Wavɔngɔkiya mbamba mu ondo; kwuwongu ondo u ra mba gyɔɔ.<verse eid="MAT 26:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a lu mba afyima a gba a kama kpɔ a ka lɛ Ukpo izhi ungwola, a gba e siso inyinyi.<verse eid="MAT 26:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Akwɛyi a gbama e bo mbaa Wavɔngɔkiya wu akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Lu degbo mu ondo ikpolomo mbala ɛnwu igbomo? La lu yese! Kwuye kwu bo kɛlɛ-ɛ bɔkɔ o to Umɛ uwu Onzu o shi enzu umba ingbomo. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />La lu yimo la ki sheyimo! La lu yese, onzu uwu bɔkɔ e to mi ee shi mbo le a ŋɔ le!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Yi Ɔzhizɔsi Mo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Omaki 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Oluku 22.47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Ɔzhɔnu 18.3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Tabɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e degbo mu iso isomo bɛnɛ, akwɛyi u vɔngɔ kiya ukpɛnyi meka iyi Wavɔngɔkiya we wo la wepo mbamba uwu o ya wu tee Ozhuda awu e ngyi mbala riba ingyi enzu. O za la ikpandɛrɛ mbala engbule. Eboshi umbakɔ mbala enzu umbakɔ gba ɔ lɔ mba le. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />U to onzu u yama awu e shi riba ingyi enzu mbamba kɛzɔ kpeke tee: &lt;&lt;Onzu uwu bɔkɔ mi kpa wu idu, uwu gba a ŋa wu. La lu yi wu mo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Ozhuda a ngbɛ ngbulolo mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi akwɛyi a zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Gbɛgyɛ loo u zɔ kiya,&gt;&gt; akwɛyi a kpa wu idu.<verse eid="MAT 26:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Umɛza mi, wo ingyi ki bo ŋɔ efyefya!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:50">Akwɛyi enzu mbamba o bo o yi Ɔzhizɔsi mo akwɛyi o ra wu. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Onzu ukpɛnyi uwu bɔkɔ e yi mbala enzu umba o yi mbala Ɔzhizɔsi awu a wa la ukpandɛrɛ wu akwɛyi e kpolo kwɔlu ungwu unye uwu Oboshi Uwakɔ ma.<verse eid="MAT 26:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Gba la ukpandɛrɛ ŋɔ lo mu ayuwɛ wu.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e to ukpandɛrɛ, ukpandɛrɛ gba a ngbɛ wu le. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Lu yitu te mi do te mi ya Ada mi ma kaa la mbwa mi ma akwɛyi kɛlɛlɛ a lɔ alɔgbulɔ wu umba bɔkɔ riba mba ri pika uzhi uwu asozha uwo la epo ma kaa lo gbo mi mo moo? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Moo ii wo te bɔkɔ iso iyi Ukpo i nyɔlɔma, iyi bɔkɔ o so te, ɛlɛ te gba ii wo le mɛga?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za la riba ingyi enzu mbamba te, &lt;&lt;Mi kwu onzu uwu ovyo re bɔkɔ lu wa la ikpandɛrɛ mbala engbule bɔkɔ lu bo te lu yi mi mo le? Mi ŋɔ mu Ɔtɛpu kwɔfyi kwɔfyi mi zɔ enzu kiya ba lu yi mi mo. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Ɛlɛ lɛɛbi i wo tee kaa iso iyi anukenzu o ka mu kwokpo ungwu iso iyi Ukpo li nyɔlɔma.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:56">Akwɛyi Wavɔngɔkiya lɛɛbi o rɛnya o lu wu afyima.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Rima Midu Iyi Asayɛndiri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Omaki 14.53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54">Oluku 22.54</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:55">55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13">Ɔzhɔnu 18.13</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:14">14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Akwɛyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi Ɔzhizɔsi mo le o ka wu mbaa Oboshi Uwakɔ Okayafasi mbaa bɔkɔ wa zɔ ɛrɛma iyi Omosis mbala enzu umbakɔ o kpala ɛlu. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Opita ba a mbwalu wu shaaru nzhii ba a ka mu udaba uwu Oboshi Uwakɔ. E fyemo mu udaba akwɛyi a ka ŋɔma mbala wa gbomo kaa la ma iyi i bi wo.<verse eid="MAT 26:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Eboshi umbakɔ mbala Odudu uwu Asayɛndiri lɛɛbi o gagyi azɔgɔ umba bɔkɔ o mu o lo Ɔzhizɔsi kaa lo ngbɛ wu ma; <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />Enzu gyɔɔ ɔ wɔ o shi izɔgɔ, tetete o fya onzu ukpukpɛnyi te mo. Mizhikembo iyi ɛnyi azɔgɔ wepo o wɔ, <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />akwɛyi o zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu ele a zɔ tee &lt;Mi do te mi shiri Ɔtɛpu uwu Ukpo mo, akwɛyi mii gba wa la imbomo mu afyi ela.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Akwɛyi Oboshi Uwakɔ e yimo a za la Ɔzhizɔsi tee, &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ gba opwu mu iso iyi bɔkɔ o mu o lo ŋɔ le mo re?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba a gba opwu mo. Oboshi Uwakɔ a gba e so kpɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Mu ɛnyi iyi Ukpo ureyi: so nzu akwiyi uŋɔ gba ŋɔ kwu Omezaya, Umɛ uwu Ukpo le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ee i yi mate bɔkɔ ŋɔ so awu. Imi ba mi so yi lɛɛbi tee: ina mu kwuye kwɔlɛ i sheye keyi, lu ma Umɛ uwu Onzu te a ŋɔma mu kwuwo ungwu ungyi ungwu Ukpo a gba e yi mu inyɔma mu amu iyi oshi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Akwɛyi Oboshi Uwakɔ a tara origa wu ma akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;E pye Ukpo ari ee! Ki yi ugɔ uwu azɔgɔ umbafo fo! Yese, kekelele lu pwa mate bɔkɔ e pye Ukpo ari ee! <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Lunyi lu mate?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:66">Akwɛyi o gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;E do lukwu mo, lɔ ngbɛ wu ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Akwɛyi o kpo wu ɔtɛ meyi akwɛyi o kpa wu ɛmwu; umbafo mbo ba o shi wu afyi mu angba <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />laa isomo tee, &lt;&lt;So nzu ŋa nɛ, Omezaya! Uwe bɔkɔ a kpa ŋa afyi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Opita A Zɔ Kwu zɔ Ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Omaki 14.66-72</ref>; Olukuk 22.56-62; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Ɔzhɔnu 18.15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Opita a ŋɔma mu ufiri akwɛyi umɛgba okokpayi uwu Oboshi Uwakɔ e bo munyi wu akwɛyi a za wu tee, &lt;&lt; Uŋɔ tete ŋɔ yi mbala Ɔzhizɔsi uwu Ogalili.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Opita ba a zɔma mu keyi mbo lɛɛbi. A za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Mi yitu iyi iso iyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ so le mo ndii,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />akwɛyi a wɔ kwudu a ka mu kenzugwu. Akwɛyi umɛgba okokpayi uwufo a ma wu akwɛyi a za laa enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mɔmɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu ele e yi mbala Ɔzhizɔsi uwu Ɔnazarɛti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Opita a zɔma kpɔ a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Mi vungɔma, mi yi onzu awu mo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Mizhikembo iyi kwuye bwɛ akwɛyi enzu ba o rima mɔmɔ o ka mbaa Opita akwɛyi o za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Iyesheshi uŋɔ ŋɔ yi mbala mba tete.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Moo opwu uwu iso ŋɔ isomo u ta ŋa undu kwudu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 26:73" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Akwɛyi Opita e le mu ivungɔma tee, &lt;&lt;Ongbulolo gba mi yi mu isomo le! Iyi mi so ele gba i yi tayi mo, Ukpo laa ka mi ingyira! Onzu awu mi yi wu mo!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:74">Mu kwotata kwɔngu akwɛyi okwuru e to ɛyi, <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />akwɛyi Opita e lolo iso iyi bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e so wu awu tee: &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ zɔ kwu zɔ mi izhɛla dɛ gba okwuru e to ɛyi le.&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi a wɔ kwudu la oga ilomo iyɛkɔkɔ.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s1">O Ka La Ɔzhizɔsi Midu Iyi Opayileti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Omaki 15.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1">Oluku 23.1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 23:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Ɔzhɔnu 18.28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Mu kwoto biri, ebwoshi umbakɔ mbala enzu umbakɔ umba Azhu lɛɛbi o wo okwura kaa lɔ ngbɛ Ɔzhizɔsi ma. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />O kpawakyi, akwɛyi o to wu o ka o ra wu o shi Opayileti, ɔgɔmina uwu Oromu.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Lukwu Undu Ozhuda</para>
  <para style="r">(Iwomo Iyi Wa zɛ ilɔ 1.18,19)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Kwuye ungwu Ozhuda, uwu bɔkɔ e to Ɔzhizɔsi a yama awu, a ma tee Azhu ɔ ngbɛ Ɔzhizɔsi ombu uwoyi ee, akwɛyi e shi ɛnwu wu kwungbɛ akwɛyi a gba laa esiliva uwekpela iyi a na awu a ka laa ebwoshi umbakɔ mbala enzu umbakɔ. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Mi ngbomo, moo mi to onzu ɔsɛkɛnɛ mi yama kaa lɔ ngbɛ wu ma.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">Mba ba o gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ki ta nzu?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ɛnyi akwu ewo ŋɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Akwɛyi Ozhuda e to eduwo ɛnyi pyo mu Ɔtɛpu akwɛyi e fulo mo mɔmɔ a ka sa ɛwu karende.<verse eid="MAT 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Eboshi umbakɔ o kwu eduwo ɛnyi ma, akwɛyi ɔ zɔ tee, &lt;&lt; Kaza nzu ka nyama kaa lo ta eduwo ɛlɛ mu kakyɔ unga Ɔtɛpu mo, kwuwongu akwu eduwo iyi ɛnzhi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Akwɛyi ɔ ka amasa ɔ nyama akwɛyi ɔ ra la eduwo ɛnyi o ya ɛzhi, o ya yi tee, ɛzhi iyi onzu u mbo lu wu, kaa lo koko lo pwu ɛkpɛzhi agboga. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Ɛlɛ gba i shi enzu o ya kizɛ ngyɛngyi tee &lt;&lt;Ɛzhi iyi Ɛnzhii&gt;&gt; le nzhii ba ɔnɛ te.<verse eid="MAT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Iwomo ɛlɛ i nyɔlɔ iso iyi bɔkɔ anukenzu Ozheremaya e so tee: &lt;&lt;Ɔ kwu esiliva uwekpela ɛnyi ma, inyi gba akwu eduwo iyi enzu umba Izirɛ o shi mu reshi wu le, <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />akwɛyi o ra yi o ya ɛzhi iyi onzu u mbo lu wu mate Ɔkwu a za mi tee la mi wo awu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Opayileti E Yo Ɔzhizɔsi Eyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Omaki 15.2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Oluku 23.3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Ɔzhɔnu 18.33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Kwuye kwɔngu Ɔzhizɔsi a rima mu keyi unga ogomina uwu Oromu, ogomina e yo wu tee, &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ gba ŋɔ kwu ɔsu uwu Azhu lee?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:11">Ɔzhizɔsi a gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ee, ŋɔ so yi ee lo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Uwu ba a gba opwu mu imwilo iyi bɔkɔ ebwoshi umbakɔ mbala enzu umbakɔ ɔ mu o lo wu mo. <verse eid="MAT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Akwɛyi Opayileti e yo wu tee &lt;&lt;Ŋɔ pwa izɔgɔ iyi bɔkɔ ɔ na o fulo ŋɔ le mo re?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Ɔzhizɔsi ba e towo opwu igbama mu kiya ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ o mu o fulo wu. Ɛlɛ i shi ogomina kenzu iyama iyɛkɔkɔ.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Ɔ Ngbɛ Ɔzhizɔsi Ombwu Uwu Lukwu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Omaki 15.6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Oluku 23.13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Ɔzhɔnu 18.39—19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Kwuye kwɔngu, ɔnu uwu kwɔfyi ungwu Odumudumu uwu Ikalama uwunawuna, ogomina e koko aa wa la onzu uwu ɛyɛ ukpɛnyi uwu bɔkɔ riba ingyi enzu ri mulɛ mu ugu ugyi ma. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Mu kwuye kwɔngu o yi onzu uwu ɛyɛ ukpɛnyi uwu bɔkɔ e ri kwɔdu ungwura, o ya wu tee Ɔzhizɔsi Obarabasi. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Akwɛyi kwuyengwu bɔkɔ riba ingyi enzu o kpala ɛlu, Opayileti e yo mbo tee, &lt;&lt;Uwe bɔkɔ lu gyi te la mi wawuma mu ugu ugyi kaa la mi shi yi? Ɔzhizɔsi Obarabasi naa Ɔzhizɔsi uwu bɔkɔ o ya wu tee Omezaya awu ŋa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Opayileti ba a zɔngɔma tee Atekeyi umba Azhu o wo rise ingyi Ɔzhizɔsi gba o ra wu o shi wu le.<verse eid="MAT 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Kwuye ungwu Opayileti a ŋɔma mu ukpa uwu ombu izɔma, oko wu a lɔma la wu a za wu tee: &lt;&lt;Wa laakwuwo ŋɔ mu iso iyi onzu ɔsɛkɛnɛ awu, moo mi ma kinɔ gyɔɔ ɔnɛnɛ meka iyi ondo umbwu bɔkɔ mi wolo kwuwo wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Eboshi umbakɔ mbala enzu umbakɔ ba o bɔ riba ingyi enzu mbamba ewo kaa lo nda Opayileti kaa la wala Obarabasi ma, Ɔzhizɔsi ba lɔ ngbɛwu ma.<verse eid="MAT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Opayileti e yo mbo kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Uwuna meka iyi enzu wepo mbɔlɛ bɔkɔ lu gyi te la mi wawuyima?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:21">O gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt; Obarabasi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Akwɛyi Opayileti e yo mbo tee, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ba mi wo fo mbala Ɔzhizɔsi uwu bɔkɔ o ya wu tee Omezaya le?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:22">Lɛɛbi mba o gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Lo kpa wu iba!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Opayileti ba e yo mbo tee, &lt;&lt;Ira iyina bɔkɔ onzu ele e wo?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:23">Umba ba o kyo uzhi mo gbɔrɔrɔ, o zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Lo kpa wu iba!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Tabɔkɔ Opayileti a ma ingyi e wo fo, moo ovyo gba aa ŋe yimo le biŋa, akwɛyi e to embyi e shishi ewo wu mo leyi iyi enzu wariba mbamba, akwɛyi a zɔ tee &lt;&lt;Kwuwo mi kwu kyo meka iyi lukwu undu onzu ele mo! Ɛlɛ akwu iwomo iyayi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Enzu mbamba lɛɛbi o gba wu opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ɛnzhii wu lo yi mu reshi nzu mbala ɛmɛ nzu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Akwɛyi Opayileti a wa laa Obarabasi ma mu ugu ugyi e shi mbo; akwɛyi mizhikembo iyi o kpa Ɔzhizɔsi ikpa, a ra wu e shi tee lɔ bɔ wu iba.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asozha O Wo Ɔzhizɔsi Ɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Omaki 15.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2">Ɔzhɔnu 19.2</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 19:3">3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Akwɛyi asozha umba ogomina o to Ɔzhizɔsi o ka wu mu udaba uwu ogomina akwɛyi o ya uzhi uwu asozha ma lɛɛbi te lo wu kwukpo. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />O lu wu ekpayi wu ma akwɛyi o kpo wu ɛkiri ufyobyo. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />O ndo ipulɛshi iyi awula o lo wu mu reshi. O to upi o lo wu mu kwuwo ungwu ungyi, akwɛyi o kwumo mu idu wu akwɛyi o wo wu ɛnɛ, o za wu te,&lt;&lt;Bagayidu, reshi ŋɔ lakwu ɔwu, ɔsu uwu Azhu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />O kpo wu ɔtɛ akwɛyi o na upi awu ma akwɛyi o le wu mu ifyama mu reshi. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Mizhikembo iyi o mbwa wu ɛnɛ iwomo mo, o lu wu ɛkiri awu ma akwɛyi o gba la ɛriga wu o lo wu, akwɛyi o ka wu ma kaa lo so kpa wu mu kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ Kpa Ɔzhizɔsi Iba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Omaki 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Oluku 23.26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Ɔzhɔnu 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Tabɔkɔ o wɔ kwudu o sheyi mo, o ma onzu uwu Osarini ɛnyi wu o ya wu tee Ɔsamɔ akwɛyi o kpa wu mɛga kaa le shi kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu ungwu Ɔzhizɔsi kwɔngu. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />O bo mu riyi rikpɛnyi ingyi bɔkɔ o ya ngyi tee Ɔgɔlugɔta, iyi bɔkɔ iluma yi akwu tee &lt;&lt;Riyi ingyi Kwukɔgɔ ungwu reshi&gt;&gt; awu. <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />Mɔmɔ gba o to owanyi akwɛyi o yoro mbo mo mbala izɛwɔnu o shi Ɔzhizɔsi kaa le wo; tabɔkɔ a pwa mba kenzu, akwɛyi e towo mbo iwomo. <verse eid="MAT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Mizhikembo iyi o bɔ wu iba, o nyi ɛpwu akwɛyi o ka ekpayi wu ma mbala esu. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Akwɛyi o ŋɔma o bɔ wu eyi mɔmɔ. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Akwɛyi mu kadu mbaa reshi wu, o ka ingyi bɔkɔ o kwu o fulo le tee: &lt;&lt;Ele akwu Ɔzhizɔsi, Ɔsu uwu Azhu <verse eid="MAT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Awɛlɔ wa zɛ kpɔ wepo o kpa mba iba mbala Ɔzhizɔsi tete, ukpɛnyi mu kwuwo ungwungyi wu, ukpɛnyi ba mu kwuwo ungwɔzu wu.<verse eid="MAT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Enzu umba o kaka mɔmɔ o mi reshi o kpa Ɔzhizɔsi ari: <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />akwɛyi ɔ zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ uwu bɔkɔ ŋɔ zɔ tee ŋɔ shiri Ɔtɛpu mo akwɛyi ŋɔ gbawa laa imbomo mu afyi ɛla! Sa ɛnwu ŋɔ ma ŋa nɛ gba ŋɔ kwu umɛ uwu Ukpo! Kalama mu kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu nɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Tegba ebwoshi umbakɔ mbala wa zɔ Ɛrama mbala enzu umbakɔ o wo wu ɛnɛ le tete. <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />O zɔ tee: &lt;&lt;A sa enzu umbafo ma ba e do ɛnwu wu isama mo! Akwu Ɔsu uwu Izirɛ mo re? Gba a kalama mu kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu kekelele, kinzu ki kwidu ki fulo mawu! <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />E fulo idu mu Ukpo akwɛyi a zɔ tee wakwu Umɛ uwu Ukpo. La ki ma ŋanɛ shi Ukpo a gyi tee la sa wu ma kekelele. <verse eid="MAT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Tegba awɛlɔ wa zɛ kpɔ umba bɔkɔ o bɔ mba iba mbala wu awu o la wu kwuzu ungwu ari le tete.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lukwu Undu Ɔzhizɔsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Omaki 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Oluku 23.44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Ɔzhɔnu 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Ina mu ɔnɔnda nzhii ba ɔnu u selemo ipwu i kpo mɛzhi ɛnyi lɛɛbi. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Mu kwuye ungwu ɔnu u selemo, Ɔzhizɔsi e lo oga mu opwu uwɔkwu a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ɛlɔyi, Ɛlɔyi, lama sabatani?&gt;&gt; iyi o lu yi tee, &lt;&lt;Ukpo mi Ukpo mi, i wo te ŋɔ lu mi afyima te?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Mate bɔ umbafo mba bɔ o rima mɔmɔ o pwa ɛlɛ, ɔ zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;E yi mu Elazha iyama!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Mataata ɛnyi onzu ɛnyi meka mba a ri ɛnya a ka e ke to amegbere, a nyɔlɔ ngwu ma mbala owanyi uwu iwuma, a bɔ ngwu mu kwuwɛyi, akwɛyi e shi Ɔzhizɔsi kaa le wo.<verse eid="MAT 27:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o shimo ba o zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Shiwobi kaa la ki mate Elazha a nyɔ a ba sa wu ma!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e wo anu mu opwu uwɔkwu kpɔ, akwɛyi a ta kwunyɔ ma.<verse eid="MAT 27:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Mu kwotota kwɔngu okpayi uwu bɔkɔ e se kenzugwu unga Ɔtɛpu ma a tarama epo i wɔ mu kadu nzhii ba mu undu. Ɛzhi i wo akpa, ekyi i tarama, <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />agariwu i wuma akwɛyi enzu umba Ukpo riba umba bɔkɔ o kpomo, o yi mbo laa reyi. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />O wɔ kwudu mu agariwu, akwɛyi mizhikembo iyi iyimo iyi Ɔzhizɔsi, o fye mu Kwuse kwɔ Kɛrikɛri, enzu riba o ma mba.<verse eid="MAT 27:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ u to keyi uwu asozha mbala umba bɔkɔ o yi mbala wu mu Ɔzhizɔsi igboshimo o ma te ɛzhi i wo akpa mbala ingyi ri wo lɛɛbi, o wiyi akwɛyi o zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ele akwu Umɛ uwu Ukpo kego!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Ekokpayi riba o yi mɔmɔ o yi mu iyesemo shaaru, umba bɔkɔ o mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi kwuyengwu a wɔ mu Ogalili kaa lɔ mbwa wu ma. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Omeri Omagadali e yi mekeka mba, mbala Omeri anyi wu Ozhemisi mbala Ɔzhɔsɛfu mbala anyi wu ɛmɛ umba Ɔzɛbɛdi.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ipwumo Iyi Ɔzhizɔsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Omaki 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Oluku 23.50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Ɔzhɔnu 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Bɔkɔ ɔnu u gbomo, onzu uwu kiya ingyi kwuwo a wɔ mu Arimatiya e bo; ɛnyi wu o ya wu tee Ɔzhɔsɛfu, uwu tete akwu u vɔngɔ kiya uwu Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />A ka mbaa Opayileti akwɛyi a nda tee lo shi wu ukpɛzhi uwu Ɔzhizɔsi. Akwɛyi Opayileti a zɔ tee lo shi wu wu. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhɔsɛfu e to ukpɛzhi awu ma, e wuwumo mu okpayi uwu ɔlinɛ uwu bɔkɔ a wuluma sɛsɛsɛ, <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />akwɛyi e to wu a ke shi mu Ogariwu wu uwepo uwu bɔkɔ a vu mu ɔzɔ. A mbiri kwokyi ungwɔkwu e se mu kenzu unga Ogariwu awu akwɛyi a kama iyawu. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Omeri Omagadali mbala Omeri uwufo o ŋɔma mu ɛsɛnyi o shi eyi mu Ogariwu awu.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s1">U gbomo Uwu Ogaruwu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Eyi i lama ba, akwu Kwɔfyi ungwu Ɛnwu Igbomo ungwu Azhu, akwɛyi ebwoshi umbakɔ mbala Afarisi o ko fu ɛlu mbala Opayileti,<verse eid="MAT 27:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />akwɛyi o za wu tee, &lt;&lt;Ada&gt;&gt; ki lolo kwuyengwu bɔkɔ ukyoro enzu mo awu e degbo e yi la reyi, a zɔ tee, &lt;Mizhikembo iyi afyi ɛla mi yimo mu kwuvɔ la reyi.&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, shi kaza kaa Ogariwu awu lo gbɔ wu mo iyɛkɔkɔ nzhii ba kwɔfyi ungwɔla, kaa Wavɔngɔkiya wu lo so lo to ukpɛzhi awu ma akwɛyi o za la enzu te e yimo mu lukwu mo. Kwukyoro ungwu kembo kwɔlɛ kwu ka ira laa ungwu kwonze ma gyɔɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 27:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Akwɛyi Opayileti za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La lu to u gbomo, lu so lu gbo Ogariwu awu ma mate bɔkɔ ekpasu yi i bɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 27:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Akwɛyi o kama o gbo Ogariwu awu ma shɛ. o wo kɛzɔ unga ɔsu mu kwokyi kwɔngu akwɛyi o shi u gbomo mɔmɔ.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi E Yimo Mu Kwuvɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Omaki 16.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Oluku 24.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Ɔzhɔnu 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Mizhikembo iyi kwɔfyi ungwu ɛnwu igbomo, ɔnuwu aladi, Omeri Omagadali mbala Omeri uwufo awu o ka kaa lo kpo eyi mu Ogariwu.<verse eid="MAT 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Kporo ba ɛzhi i wo akpa iyɛkɔkɔ; kwuwongu ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ɔkwu a wɔ moshi a ka mu Ogariwu awu, a pya kwokyi mo mu kenzu unga Ogariwu, akwɛyi a ŋɔma mangwu. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Ɔlɔgbulɔ awu e lemo mate imingɔma iyi kawu tayi, ekpayi wu i wuluma purɛtɛtɛ mate owuru tayi. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Asozha umba o gbo Ogariwu awu o wiyi gyɔɔ laa ipwulama akwɛyi o fu mɛzhi mate ɛkpɛzhi umba enzu tayi. <verse eid="MAT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ awu a za laa ekokpayi mbamba tee, &lt;&lt;La lu wiyi mo.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Mi yitu tee Ɔzhizɔsi, uwu bɔkɔ ɔ bɔ wu iba awu gba lu yi mu igagyima le. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />E yi munɛ fo; e yimo o, mate bɔkɔ e so awu. La lu bo kaa lu ma mbaa bɔkɔ a nɔ. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />La lu so efyefya kaa lu za laa Wavɔngɔkiya wu tee: &lt;E yimo mu kwuvɔ ɔ, E to keyi la yi a kaawu mu Ogalili; lu ma wu mɔmɔ!&gt; La lu lolo iso iyi mi so yi ele.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Akwɛyi eko mbamba o lafya laa Ogariwu efyefya, laa iyi mu akɔ, tetete kwuwongu ɔnyɛ a ga mba ma, akwɛyi o ri ɛnya kaa lo so lo so Wavɔngɔkiya wu kiya ingyi ri wo. <verse eid="MAT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Tabɔkɔ o sheyimo, akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi e kpolo mbo kporo akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Egbo-mɛzhi li yi mbala yi loo.&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi o ka kɛlɛ mbaa wu, o fulo wu ewo mu ata wu akwɛyi o gbo wu ɔya. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Akwɛyi Ɔzhizɔsi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La lu wiyi mo.&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;La lu so kaa lu za laa ɛmɛnɛ mi tee lo so mu Ogalili, ɔ ma mi mɔmɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Izɔgɔ Iyi U gbo Ogaruwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Tabɔkɔ eko mbamba o degbo mu ɔgwuzɛ bɛnɛ, akwɛyi asozha umbafo umba o kyo mu igbomo iyi Ogariwu awu ba o fye mɛmi iyi kwuse o ka o za laa ebwoshi umbakɔ apula iyi i wo lɛɛbi. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Akwɛyi ebwoshi umbakɔ mbala enzu umbakɔ umba Azhu, ɔ ŋɔma o ka amasa; akwɛyi o shi asozha mbamba eduwo iyɛku <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />akwɛyi o za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La lu zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Wa vɔngɔ kiya wu o bo mu utuwɔkɔ akwɛyi o to ukpɛzhi wu ma mɛlɔ o ka wu ma kwuyengwu ki yi mu ondo. <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Gba iso ɛlɛ i ka mu alu iyi Ogomina, kinzu ki na wu egbo ma, akwɛyi lu fye mu rɛnu mo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="MAT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Akwɛyi asozha mbamba o na eduwo ɛnyi ma akwɛyi o wo mate bɔkɔ o so mbo awu. Ɛza ɛlɛ gba Azhu ɔ gayi munamuna le nzhii ba kwɔfyi ungwu ɔnɛ.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔzhizɔsi A Zɔ Ɛnwu Ma Laa Wa vɔngɔ Kiya Wu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Omaki 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Oluku 24.36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Ɔzhɔnu 20.19-23</ref>; Iwomo Iyi Wa zɛ ilɔ 1.6-8)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Wa vɔngɔ kiya wewo laa upkɛnyi mbamba, o ka mu lɔwa mu Ogalili mbaa bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi e so mbo tee lo so awu. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Tabɔkɔ o ma wu, akwɛyi o gbo wu ɔya, umbafo ba ɔ nyama tee akwu uwu mo. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Ɔzhizɔsi e turu a gba mba akwɛyi a za mba tee, &lt;&lt;Idomo mu oshi mbala ɛzhi lɛɛbi o shi mi yi-e. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ la lu so mbaa enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ lɛɛbi kaa lu wo mbo Wavɔngɔkiya mi: la lu wo mbo obatisima mu ɛnyi iyi Ada, mbala iyi Umɛ, mbala iyi Kwundu uwu Ukpo, <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />la lu zɔ mba kaa lo lomo laa ɔkpa uwu bɔkɔ mi shi yi lɛɛbi. Imi mi yi mbala yi iyɔkpɔɔ nzhii ba ibomo iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>